t/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/b7851409db27e45140767294cfa51f79931173d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:55:49Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T14:55:49Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add skill evaluators and managed third-party evaluators (DeepEval/AutoEval)\n\n- Builtin catalog 13 -> 15: SkillSelectionAccuracy + SkillInstructionFollowing (TOOL_CALL)\n- New THIRD_PARTY_EVALUATORS catalog (10 DeepEval + 3 AutoEval), levels verified against live ListEvaluators\n- Evaluators page: third-party card grouped by provider; Runs page: collapsible third-party picker group\n- Sim wizard Step 4: third-party evaluators selectable with authored sim scores\n- Fix: ThirdParty.* IDs no longer misclassified as custom evaluators\n- en/zh i18n for all new evaluators; e2e verified against us-west-2 (real batch eval scores)","tree":{"sha":"abb4264452ef248857d0ce2a3bfcc126fdc01cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/abb4264452ef248857d0ce2a3bfcc126fdc01cba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/b7851409db27e45140767294cfa51f79931173d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravat