api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/cb2b85e1155f499cf58376c5544726ded6268f37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:12:56Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:12:56Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Split A/B testing into independent target-based & config-bundle flows\n\nMake Target-based A/B and Configuration-bundle A/B two independent,\nself-contained flows in both the Sim wizard and the Live console,\nfaithful to the two AWS AgentCore docs.\n\nBackend:\n- experiments: additive `kind` column (config_bundle|target_based) with a\n  PRAGMA-guarded ALTER migration; create/get/list echo it. Create request\n  validates kind via Literal (invalid -> 422).\n- abtest: document the standalone target-based path (no STOP call when\n  bundleAbTestId is falsy); target_variants default 90/10 -> 80/20 so the\n  optional rollout ramp starts at treatment=20.\n\nLive console (ExperimentsPage):\n- create form gains an A/B-pattern kind selector; detail branches by kind.\n- config_bundle: recommend -> bundles -> A/B -> promote + finish (no canary).\n- target_based: self-contained TargetBasedStage that owns its gateway\n  (gatewaySetup + abtestTargetSetup with bundleAbTestId omitted, never\n  abtestConfigBundle), 80/20, promote-winner + optional rollout 20->50->100.\n- liveApi: ExperimentKind type, kind on ExperimentRecord, per-kind stage\n  sequences.\n\nSim wizard (Step 10):\n- reframed as a standalone target-based A/B: SETUP_STAGES creates its own\n  gateway (STOP stage removed), 80/20 split, a promote-winner card before an\n  OPTIONAL phased rollout; targetAB snippet + TARGET_AB_RESULTS reframed.\n\ni18n both locales updated; FE 185 / BE 176 tests pass, tsc/eslint/ruff clean,\nbuild green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3cc4550f0d744da9dde13728ebff4648db26c9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/c3cc4550f0d744da9dde13728ebff4648db26c9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/cb2b85e1155f499cf58376c5544726ded6268f37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/cb2b85e1155f499cf58376c5544726ded6268f37","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKGNiMmI4NWUxMTU1ZjQ5OWNmNTgzNzZjNTU0NDcyNmRlZDYyNjhmMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/b80392174daa59f42408a09f33f47fc7c47a3b2d","sha":"b80392174daa59f42408a09f33f47fc7c47a3b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/b80392174daa59f42408a09f33f47fc7c47a3b2d"}],"sha":"cb2b85e1155f499cf58376c5544726ded6268f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/cb2b85e1155f499cf58376c5544726ded62