iehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/562fd3d151e85194a11d0ae7d845d378858d3ce1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T15:04:48Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T15:04:48Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Flatten SSE runtime responses before feeding the simulation actor\n\nStreaming AgentCore runtimes answer InvokeAgentRuntime with\ntext/event-stream bodies (one JSON string per data: line). The raw SSE\nframing leaked into the user-simulation actor''s input and the stored\ntranscripts. flatten_sse() collapses the stream into plain text at the\nruntime-invoker boundary; non-SSE bodies pass through unchanged.\n\nFound in the live e2e: simulated-personas run against a real deployed\nHR agent (3 actor conversations, all stopped_by=goal, GSR/Helpfulness\n1.0, clean transcripts after the fix). 171 backend tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01dc5e41f1a8427d71ab1c55222446c0d0f5292b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/01dc5e41f1a8427d71ab1c55222446c0d0f5292b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/562fd3d151e85194a11d0ae7d845d378858d3ce1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/