s","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/0ca09c909603e3396aaa004a5bb3a66fef2c129d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T14:28:14Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T14:28:14Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add Dataset evaluation & User simulation to Sim wizard and Live console\n\nSim mode: new Step 5 \"Dataset Evaluation & User Simulation\" (wizard now\n11 steps) — deterministic scenario-dataset run with ground truth and a\ndeliberate trajectory failure feeding the Insights step, plus LLM-actor\ntranscript playback with goal/max_turns stop conditions. Old 9- and\n10-step session snapshots migrate via chained migrateSnapshot.\n\nLive console:\n- Datasets: predefined/simulated dataset kinds (devguide schema JSON\n  editor + samples), one-way sync to real AWS Dataset resources\n  (CreateDataset inline examples, poll to ACTIVE) and account-level\n  cloud dataset list/get/delete.\n- Runs: scenario-aware active runs — one session per scenario,\n  sequential multi-turn replay, groundTruth sessionMetadata on\n  StartBatchEvaluation (assertions/expectedTrajectory/expectedResponse),\n  server-side bedrock-runtime Converse actor loop for simulated\n  datasets (configurable model id, 20-turn hard cap, graceful stop on\n  unparseable actor output), per-scenario transcripts persisted and\n  rendered with ground-truth evaluator hints.\n\n168 backend pytest / 181 frontend vitest; browser-smoke screenshots in\ndocs/screenshots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f5615d420ea74144b2b9742765126c36f2c8cec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/0f5615d420ea74144b2b9742765126c36f2c8cec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/0ca09c909603e3396aaa004a5bb3a66fef2c129d"