bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/4185e524d9d61230b4628aa3f03c70da23b38cae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:12:38Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:12:38Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Sim wizard: expandable teaching panel on every step\n\nThe sim exists to teach the optimization workflow; each step now\nexplains WHY it exists, not just what button to press. StepHeader\ngains a collapsible learn-more block — purpose, key concepts\n(term + explanation pairs), takeaway — populated for all 10 steps in\nboth locales (StepLearn is part of StepMeta, so a missing entry in\neither language is a compile error). The canary step spells out\nbundle-A/B-vs-canary, 90/10 blast radius, and weight ramping as the\nrelease lever.\n\nChinese copy written for native technical reading: session/trace/\nspan/agent/runtime kept in English, no translationese.\n\nAlso: built-in evaluator docs links on Step 4 + Evaluators page,\nsingle-column step layouts to give the panels room, start.sh --prod\nrebuilds when sources are newer than dist/, CLAUDE.md project guide,\nignore __pycache__/.codegraph.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7802517751c03bf8dbe6f6f8b40680b30af56281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/7802517751c03bf8dbe6f6f8b40680b30af56281"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/4185e524d9d61230b4628aa3f03c70da23b38cae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/4185e524d9d61230b4628aa3f03c70da23b38cae","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKDQxODVlNTI0ZDlkNjEyMzBiNDYyOGFhM2YwM2M3MGRhMjNiMzhjYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a","sha":"9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a"}],"sha":"4185e524d9d61230b4628aa3f03c70da23b38cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/4185e524d9d61230b4628aa3f03c70da23b38cae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:12:20Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:12:20Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Live console: evaluate ANY agent, not just AgentCore-runtime-hosted\n\nPer the observability-configure-3p doc, evaluations read CloudWatch\ntelemetry — the runtime is not required. Three additions:\n\n1. External agent registration: agents.kind (''managed''|''external'') +\n   agents.binding {serviceName, logGroup, region?, invoke?}. External\n   agents are registered, not deployed. Telemetry resolution shared in\n   app/telemetry.py (deployment wins, else binding) and used by runs,\n   insights and the telemetry check.\n\n2. Passive evaluation: POST /api/runs takes exactly one of datasetId\n   (active) / lookbackHours / sessionIds (passive — zero invocations,\n   StartBatchEvaluation filterConfig.timeRange over existing traffic).\n   runs.source column records the scope. Insights lifted to the same\n   rule, so external agents get failure analysis too.\n\n3. Telemetry check + HTTP invoker: POST /agents/{id}/telemetry-check\n   probes aws/spans for the service''s spans + session.id before any\n   eval spend (paginated filter_log_events); invokers.py gives dataset\n   runs a generic HTTP POST path ({prompt}/{sessionId} JSON-safe\n   template, session header, no header-value logging).\n\nUI: register-external form with copyable ADOT setup snippet, telemetry\ncheck panel on agent cards, run-scope picker (dataset / lookback /\nsession IDs), invoke-endpoint config. i18n in both catalogs.\n\nProven against real AWS end to end (scripts/e2e_external.py): local\ndemo agent → spans land → telemetry gate → active run scores\nGSR 0.0 / Helpfulness 0.83 / Correctness 0.67 → passive lookback run\nscores 0.2 / 0.83 / 0.6 → cleanup.\n\nIncludes i18n groundwork (StepLearn content) for the sim teaching\npanels wired up in the next commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a085c505d66e2c2a1a8d4d2fc1711e5aa53fe7b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/a085c505d66e2c2a1a8d4d2fc1711e5aa53fe7b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKDllZjA2Y2YxMDEzYmIwMzE3MjQzMTZiODIzOGNjNTMzZTFiNDg4NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad","sha":"fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad"}],"sha":"9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/9ef06cf1013bb031724316b8238cc533e1b4886a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:59:54Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:11:14Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add demo-agent: locally-runnable external agent (Claude Agent SDK + ADOT)\n\nFastAPI wrapper (:9100) around claude-agent-sdk query() on the Bedrock\nbackend, with calculator/current_time SDK-MCP tools. Emits BOTH telemetry\nrecords AgentCore Evaluations joins per invocation:\n- an invoke_agent span (aws/spans) under the strands.telemetry.tracer\n  scope — the service only parses supported instrumentation scopes\n- a Gen AI content event in the agent log group, in the exact Strands\n  body shape (anything else fails every session with\n  AgentSpanMappingException)\n\nrun.sh = full ADOT export env per the observability-configure-3p doc\n(+ idempotent log group/stream creation); run-local.sh = offline dev.\nTests stub the SDK query and assert span/event shape via in-memory\nexporters — no network, no cost.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7eec4fdb12c7ff7247fe33d3889980cc4ce4b95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/7eec4fdb12c7ff7247fe33d3889980cc4ce4b95f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKGZjMTE3ZDcxZmNkYzg5NGVhNjhjNDVlNmM4M2U5M2U2ODdhY2VmYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/26ff33bf137d9616bea3c7fa4c02c79a5f5668ea","sha":"26ff33bf137d9616bea3c7fa4c02c79a5f5668ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/26ff33bf137d9616bea3c7fa4c02c79a5f5668ea"}],"sha":"fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/fc117d71fcdc894ea68c45e6c83e93e687acefad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/26ff33bf137d9616bea3c7fa4c02c79a5f5668ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T10:50:18Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T10:50:18Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add Chinese HR Assistant sample agent (variant=zh)\n\nGET /api/samples/agent?variant=zh returns the v1 agent with the\nbaked-in DEFAULT_SYSTEM_PROMPT swapped for a Chinese one (same\nstring-mutation approach as build_v2_code, failing loudly if the\nupstream marker disappears) and a config whose system prompt and all\nfive tool descriptions are Chinese. Tool NAMES stay English — they are\ncode identifiers — and the prompt spells out extracting the employee id\nfrom the English \"Employee ID:\" context prefix the zh datasets keep.\nThe prompt also instructs answering in Chinese, pairing with the *-zh\nsample datasets for an all-Chinese demo.\n\nConsole: third sample button on the Agents page (\"New from HR sample\n(Chinese)\" / \"从 HR 中文样例新建\"). 98 backend + 145 frontend tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8b24efe682df30c3d1ccb227782ce3241b87085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/c8b24efe682df30c3d1ccb227782ce3241b87085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/26ff33bf137d9616bea3c7fa4c02c79a5f5668ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url