ll / \"same as last\nyear\"), compliance shortcuts (skip confirmation, file on a colleague''s\nbehalf), and cross-context confusion (compare two employees, act on a\nfabricated prior balance).\n\nAll four sample datasets (baseline / gateway / target / failure) now\nalso ship Chinese variants (*-zh keys) mirroring the English scenarios\n1:1 — the \"Employee ID:\" context prefix stays English since the agent''s\nsystem prompt keys on it. Dataset menu label handles the Chinese sample\nsuffix. start.sh --prod now reads only the first line of\n.run/auth_password (the file may carry notes).\n\n97 backend + 145 frontend tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41f23755e41f24a4bb284338e8fe04e690a1616b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/41f23755e41f24a4bb284338e8fe04e690a1616b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/b43d1bb41fcb0ab1629a0a4f0878bd0c64ba5e17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_typ