ogin":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/f5a6588ce2d3dc455e6087b010d8c1e6962b7760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:56:42Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:56:42Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add password auth + production single-port mode for internet exposure\n\nBackend (app/auth.py): optional shared-password gate enabled by\nLAB4_AUTH_PASSWORD — without it nothing changes (local dev, tests).\nWhen enabled, every /api route and the FastAPI docs return 401 until\nPOST /api/auth/login sets a stateless signed session cookie\n(HMAC-SHA256 over the expiry, key derived from the password): sessions\nsurvive restarts with no store, and rotating the password invalidates\nthem all. /api/health and the auth endpoints stay open (ALB health\nchecks, login). Constant-time comparisons throughout.\n\nProduction mode: when dist/ exists the backend also serves the built\nSPA (content-hashed /assets + SPA fallback), so the ALB needs a single\ntarget. scripts/start.sh --prod builds if needed, binds 0.0.0.0,\ngenerates the password into .run/auth_password (or takes\nLAB4_AUTH_PASSWORD).\n\nFrontend: LoginGate wraps the app — probes /api/auth/status on mount,\nrenders a password form only when the backend requires it; the session\nlives in an HttpOnly cookie. Unreachable backend falls through so the\nsim experience never dead-ends.\n\nInfra (documented in README, created via CLI in us-west-2):\nCloudFront (HTTPS, CachingDisabled+AllViewer; /assets/* cached) → ALB\nagentxray-alb :80 (SG admits only the CloudFront origin-facing prefix\nlist) → EC2 :8787 (SG admits only the ALB SG). Direct ALB access\nverified blocked; full login flow verified through the public URL.\n\n97 backend + 145 frontend tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0894b43876f30f744349246fb5d4ef30ac307178","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/0894b43876f30f744349246fb5d4ef30ac307178"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/f5a6588ce2d3dc455e6087b010d8c1e6962b7760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/f5a6588ce2d3dc455e6087b010d8c1e6962b7760","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKGY1YTY1ODhjZTJkM2RjNDU1ZTYwODdiMDEwZDhjMWU2OTYyYjc3NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759","sha":"04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759"}],"sha":"f5a6588ce2d3dc455e6087b010d8c1e6962b7760","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/f5a6588ce2d3dc455e6087b010d8c1e6962b7760"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:29:42Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:29:42Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add one-shot start/stop scripts for the dev servers\n\nscripts/start.sh launches the FastAPI backend (:8787) and Vite dev server\n(:5173) detached, with logs + pidfiles under .run/ (gitignored), waits for\neach to answer, and is idempotent. scripts/stop.sh terminates the recorded\nprocess trees and falls back to freeing the ports, so stale pidfiles never\nleave orphans. Ports overridable via BACKEND_PORT/FRONTEND_PORT.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1b698401e8150b20a4d52acca4130ab44e6e8a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/d1b698401e8150b20a4d52acca4130ab44e6e8a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKDA0ZmYwN2QwZmFiYTI4MTE4YjI0MWFmODgyNmE0YzViMGJiYmQ3NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/35f227ecfcf83f87e6c972ebbb00566279646d66","sha":"35f227ecfcf83f87e6c972ebbb00566279646d66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/35f227ecfcf83f87e6c972ebbb00566279646d66"}],"sha":"04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/04ff07d0faba28118b241af8826a4c5b0bbbd759"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/35f227ecfcf83f87e6c972ebbb00566279646d66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:20:37Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T06:20:37Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"Add AgentCore Insights: Sim Step 5 triage + Live console Insights page\n\nInsights (public preview) reuses the batch-evaluation API — insights=\nINSTEAD of evaluators= (mutually exclusive; one active batch evaluation\nper account) — and returns three result trees from GetBatchEvaluation:\nfailureAnalysisResult (categories → subcategories → root causes, each\nwith a suggested fix), userIntentResult, executionSummaryResult.\n\nSimulation (wizard now 10 steps):\n- New Step 5 \"Failure Insights\" between Evaluate and Recommend: animated\n  triage run, failure taxonomy tree, intent/execution clusters — the\n  authored root causes deliberately motivate Step 6''s recommendations\n- Old 9-step session snapshots migrate on hydrate (insights derived\n  from the recommend status)\n- Step indices/eyebrows renumbered (6a/6b, 8a–g, 9a–f); insights boto3\n  snippet in the code view\n\nLive console (7th section \"Insights\"):\n- POST /api/insights: scope sessions to a past Run (one-click \"Triage\n  with Insights\" from run detail) or a lookback window; background job\n  starts the analysis and polls to completion; insight_reports table\n  persists history across reloads/restarts\n- Failure tree / intent / execution-pattern rendering; resume for\n  in-flight reports\n- 4th built-in sample dataset: 12 failure-injection prompts (unknown\n  employee IDs, out-of-capability asks, hallucination bait) to make\n  failure patterns reproducible\n\nVerified against real AWS (us-west-2): deploy → failure-dataset run\n(GSR 0.17 vs 0.90 baseline) → insights report with 2 failure root\ncauses + 6 intent and 8 execution clusters over 12 sessions → cleanup\n(zero leftover resources). 93 backend + 141 frontend tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"763ff83f3809b38c25c7f09a600947428b9fc860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/763ff83f3809b38c25c7f09a600947428b9fc860"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/35f227ecfcf83f87e6c972ebbb00566279646d66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5M