Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T03:00:36Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"add sample code","tree":{"sha":"e9a7bae68f301a25fd6fff361263c1731b261b38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/e9a7bae68f301a25fd6fff361263c1731b261b38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/4c7972e54cc6af2aa0da51d84e25c95932873736","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/4c7972e54cc6af2aa0da51d84e25c95932873736","node_id":"C_kwDOTOvhT9oAKDRjNzk3MmU1NGNjNmFmMmFhMGRhNTFkODRlMjVjOTU5MzI4NzM3MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commit/2dadda7c98c962f2a20f113022f97f27662e45ef","sha":"2dadda7c98c962f2a20f113022f97f27662e45ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/2dadda7c98c962f2a20f113022f97f27662e45ef"}],"sha":"4c7972e54cc6af2aa0da51d84e25c95932873736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/4c7972e54cc6af2aa0da51d84e25c95932873736"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/commits/2dadda7c98c962f2a20f113022f97f27662e45ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T02:57:46Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T02:57:46Z","email":"xiehust@163.com","name":"River Xie"},"message":"AgentCore evaluation & optimization console (sim wizard + live platform)\n\nAn interactive rebuild of the AWS Bedrock AgentCore Lab 4 optimization\njourney, in two modes:\n\n- Simulation: fully self-contained 9-step guided wizard (no AWS, no cost)\n- Live AWS: a generic agent evaluation & optimization console\n  - Agents: upload/edit any Python agent (CodeMirror), per-agent config\n    (system prompt + tool descriptions), deploy to AgentCore Runtime\n  - Datasets: {prompt, context?} items, table editor + JSON/JSONL upload\n  - Evaluators: 13 built-ins + custom LLM-as-a-judge CRUD\n  - Runs: traffic -> CloudWatch traces -> batch evaluation -> scores\n  - Experiments: guided optimization flow (AI recommendations -> config\n    bundles -> gateway + bundle A/B -> monitor -> promote -> target-routing\n    canary with any challenger agent + live weight ramping), resumable via\n    server-persisted artifacts\n  - Cleanup: per-experiment teardown of all AWS resources\n\nStack: React 18 + Vite 6 + Tailwind v4 frontend; FastAPI + boto3 backend\nwith SQLite persistence (jobs, sessions, agents, datasets, runs,\nexperiments). HR Assistant v1/v2 ship as clonable samples read from the\naws-samples lab4 repo (cloned separately, see README).\n\nVerified end-to-end against real AWS (us-west-2): deploy -> evaluate ->\nrecommend -> bundle A/B (20 sessions, GSR +9.1%) -> promote -> 90/10\ncanary -> 50/50 ramp -> full teardown with zero leftover resources.\n87 backend pytest + 127 frontend vitest, ruff/eslint/tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"526cafde96712151a29267a56a21b93a4d2d301c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/trees/526cafde96712151a29267a56a21b93a4d2d301c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xiehust/agentcore_eva_opt/git/commits/2dadda7c98c962f2a20f113022f97f27662e45ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19160090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xiehust","id":19160090,"login":"xiehust","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTYwMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiehust/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.