rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/603ad0593e01ad256ab3664a4078e76381d089c5"}],"sha":"fec6c7c83efe391c41fa90a2133d5cfd16615dff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/fec6c7c83efe391c41fa90a2133d5cfd16615dff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/603ad0593e01ad256ab3664a4078e76381d089c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:26:03Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:26:03Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(module-5): job-service on :8084 + job-mf\n\nBackend (job-service)\n- Job entity with title / company / location / description / jobType\n  (FULL_TIME / PART_TIME / CONTRACT / INTERN) / status (OPEN / CLOSED)\n  / postedAt / postedBy.\n- JobApplication entity with denormalised applicant name + jobId +\n  ApplicationStatus (APPLIED / REVIEWED / REJECTED / ACCEPTED);\n  unique constraint on (job_id, applicant_id) blocks re-apply.\n- Endpoints\n  - GET /jobs?q=&type=&location=       search + filter via Specification.\n  - GET /jobs/{id}                     detail.\n  - POST /jobs                         admin: post.\n  - PUT /jobs/{id}                     admin: update.\n  - PATCH /jobs/{id}/status            admin: open/close.\n  - DELETE /jobs/{id}                  admin.\n  - POST /jobs/{id}/apply              user: apply. 409 on duplicate,\n                                       400 when job is not OPEN.\n  - GET /jobs/applied                  user''s own applications, joined\n                                       with title/company for display.\n  - GET /jobs/{id}/applicants          admin: applicant list.\n- SessionHolder.requireAdmin() at the service layer for every\n  admin-only path — controller stays request-handling only.\n\nGateway\n- New route: /jobs/** → lb://job-service.\n\nFrontend (job-mf)\n- Three tabs: Browse | My applications | Manage (only rendered for\n  admins via data-admin-only + a paint pass on boot).\n- Browse: three-field filter form (q, type, location) with debounced\n  inputs and a live refetch; cards collapse to 3 lines with a\n  \"Show more\" toggle. Apply button flips to \"Applied\" without a\n  reload once applied.\n- Applications tab lists my applied jobs with title + company from the\n  server-side join.\n- Manage combines a shared post/edit form (single submit routes to\n  create or update based on a hidden id) with a list of every job.\n  Each row has Edit, Close/Reopen, Applicants, Delete — plus an\n  Applicants drawer that fetches on demand and scrolls into view.\n- Wired into shell:\n  - shared/constants.js grew ROUTES.JOBS = ''#/jobs''.\n  - shell manifest maps #/jobs to /job-mf/index.html.\n  - shell nav shows Jobs when authed.","tree":{"sha":"322057ea220adb04080c89b0bd777007fb78e924","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/322057ea220adb04080c89b0bd777007fb78e924"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/603ad0593e01ad256ab3664a4078e76381d089c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/603ad0593e01ad256ab3664a4078e76381d089c5","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKDYwM2FkMDU5M2UwMWFkMjU2YWIzNjY0YTQwNzhlNzYzODFkMDg5YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620","sha":"ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620"}],"sha":"603ad0593e01ad256ab3664a4078e76381d089c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/603ad0593e01ad256ab3664a4078e76381d089c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:25:44Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:25:44Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(module-4): connection-service on :8083 + connection-mf\n\nBackend (connection-service)\n- Connection entity with denormalised requester + receiver names so\n  the \"who am I connected with\" query doesn''t cross services.\n  ConnectionStatus (PENDING / ACCEPTED / REJECTED); unique\n  constraint on (requester_id, receiver_id) prevents duplicate pairs.\n- Endpoints\n  - POST /connections/request         send.  Rejects self-request and\n                                      any existing pair in either direction.\n  - GET /connections                  my accepted (either side of the pair).\n  - GET /connections/pending          incoming pending where I''m the receiver.\n  - PATCH /connections/{id}/accept    receiver-only; sets responded_at.\n  - PATCH /connections/{id}/reject    receiver-only.\n  - DELETE /connections/{id}          either side may remove.\n  - GET /connections/reports          admin: {total, pending, accepted, rejected}.\n- JPQL @Query for \"involves me\" so the OR isn''t split by JPA''s greedy\n  method-name parsing.\n\nGateway\n- New route: /connections/** → lb://connection-service.\n\nFrontend (connection-mf)\n- Three-tab layout: Find people | Requests (with a badge on the tab\n  showing pending count) | Connections.\n- Find people uses GET /users?q= from user-service — a Connect button\n  per row that flips to \"Requested\" without a reload; self is filtered out.\n- Requests panel: incoming pending rows with Accept / Reject.\n- Connections panel: accepted list — resolves the \"other party\" based\n  on whether I''m the requester or the receiver of the row.\n- Wired into shell:\n  - shared/constants.js grew ROUTES.CONNECTIONS = ''#/connections''.\n  - shell manifest maps #/connections to /connection-mf/index.html.\n  - shell nav shows Connections when authed.","tree":{"sha":"77cf53714be8601bdcd6bdae252a42faa4ec63e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/77cf53714be8601bdcd6bdae252a42faa4ec63e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKGNlZDIwZDYxMzljOGNlOGY0NDI0YTQwM2RlNDlmYzU3MTE5MWY2MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0","sha":"985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0"}],"sha":"ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/ced20d6139c8ce8f4424a403de49fc571191f620"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:25:28Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:25:28Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(module-3): post-service on :8082 + post-mf feed\n\nBackend (post-service)\n- Post entity with denormalised authorFirstName / authorLastName so\n  the feed doesn''t need a cross-service join; PostStatus enum\n  (ACTIVE / DELETED); soft delete via status flip.\n- Endpoints\n  - POST /posts               create — trims content, resolves author name\n                              from users table.\n  - GET /posts?q=             feed. LIKE on content + author name, sorted\n                              by createdAt desc. Filters DELETED rows.\n  - GET /posts/user/{userId}  author''s own posts.\n  - GET /posts/{id}           single post (404 if DELETED).\n  - PUT /posts/{id}           owner-or-admin edit.\n  - DELETE /posts/{id}        owner-or-admin soft delete.\n- SessionFilter reads user_sessions + users tables (read-only User\n  entity mapping the shared schema). No user-service HTTP call needed\n  because all services share the linkedin_lite DB.\n- Standard shape: constructor injection, @RestControllerAdvice\n  translating custom exceptions to the shared ErrorResponse envelope.\n\nGateway\n- New route: /posts/** → lb://post-service.\n\nRuntime\n- user-service application-h2.yml switched to a file-backed DB with\n  AUTO_SERVER=TRUE so post/connection/job services can share the same\n  physical H2 instance during dev without needing MySQL.\n\nFrontend (post-mf)\n- Compose card at the top of the feed (textarea + optional image URL).\n- Feed/My-posts tabs and a debounced search box in the toolbar.\n- Post cards render author avatar with initials, relative time\n  (just now / Xm / Xh / Xd), inline Edit and Delete for the author,\n  Delete-only for admins on other people''s posts.\n- Inline edit swaps the card''s content section for a textarea +\n  Save / Cancel row — no modal, no route change.\n- Single delegated click listener drives every button.\n- Wired into shell:\n  - shared/constants.js grew ROUTES.FEED = ''#/feed''.\n  - shell manifest maps #/feed to /post-mf/index.html.\n  - shell nav shows Feed alongside Home / Profile when authed.","tree":{"sha":"8cb41fd42ff2931551d40d40771d0e23dd42b9e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/8cb41fd42ff2931551d40d40771d0e23dd42b9e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKDk4NTIxMWU4YTk5YWVjZjA4YjNmMWQ2MzA3ZTlmODM1NDcyYjBmYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab","sha":"4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab"}],"sha":"985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/985211e8a99aecf08b3f1d6307e9f835472b0fc0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:02:13Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:02:13Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"docs: mark module 2 done and document the h2 fallback profile","tree":{"sha":"700d49bf4330e5a4a378c825172bf5bc8bf6ecb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/700d49bf4330e5a4a378c825172bf5bc8bf6ecb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKDRkYzJjZGM1YjJiYTQ0OTZiYjQ1ZmYyOTM5OGU4ZWM5MjIxMDlmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11","sha":"c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11"}],"sha":"4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/4dc2cdc5b2ba4496bb45ff29398e8ec922109fab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:01:44Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:01:44Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(frontend): module 2 — profile-mf\n\nWiring\n- shared/constants.js: new ROUTES.PROFILE (''#/profile'').\n- shell manifest: profile-mf owns #/profile; entry html only, MFE\n  self-describes its own CSS/JS list the way auth-mf does.\n- shell nav: authed nav grew Home + Profile anchors alongside the\n  user badge; guest nav unchanged.\n\nprofile-mf\n- index.html: view-mode and edit-mode DOM live side-by-side, each row\n  gated by a `data-view` attribute the app toggles by setting hidden.\n  No conditional HTML strings for view/edit — same DOM, different\n  visibility.\n- constants.js: endpoint helpers, message strings, empty-item\n  factories for skills / education / experience so each \"+ Add\" click\n  gets a fresh object reference.\n- validation.js: nested-path errors (\"experience.0.title\") so callers\n  can highlight the specific row that failed.\n- api.js: fetchMine, fetchOne, updateProfile, updatePicture — all via\n  shared HttpClient.\n- events.js: emits PROFILE_UPDATED with headline + picture URL so the\n  shell (and later MFEs) can refresh their cached view of the user.\n- app.js: caches every DOM lookup at boot, keeps two shapes of state\n  (serverData = last-fetched, editData = mutating draft). syncFromDom()\n  pulls live inputs back into editData before add/remove so re-rendering\n  one list doesn''t wipe values the user just typed in another.\n  Buttons dispatched via a single delegated click listener on document.\n  Avatar renders a real <img> when a URL is set, falling back to\n  initials on load error.\n- Styling uses only shared design tokens — no inline styles, no\n  bespoke colors.","tree":{"sha":"396e374d8121e8e65baa7e8fd7f2c03d0f4a780b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/396e374d8121e8e65baa7e8fd7f2c03d0f4a780b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKGM4ZTA4ODk3ZTc0NGU3ODNkYjI1NjAwOTg4OTMzYjI3NGE5ZTFjMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77","sha":"0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77"}],"sha":"c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/c8e08897e744e783db25600988933b274a9e1c11"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:01:21Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:01:21Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(user-service): module 2 — profile CRUD\n\nEndpoints\n- GET /profile/me            current user''s profile (via SessionHolder).\n- GET /profile/{userId}      any authed caller can read another profile.\n- PUT /profile/{userId}      owner or admin can update headline / about /\n                             location / picture URL / skills / education /\n                             experience. Fields left null on the request\n                             keep the existing DB value — no destructive\n                             clears from partial payloads.\n- POST /profile/{userId}/picture   dedicated endpoint that accepts {url}\n                                   for a picture-only update from a small UI.\n\nModel\n- Skill / Education / Experience DTOs with Bean Validation\n  (@NotBlank on required fields, @Size caps).\n- Profile.skills / education / experience switched from JSON to TEXT\n  columns; the type is dialect-portable (H2 and MySQL both accept TEXT),\n  and ProfileMapper handles the JSON serialisation via Jackson.\n- ProfileMapper.readList() swallows bad JSON with a WARN log and returns\n  an empty list — a corrupt row doesn''t 500 the endpoint.\n\nAuthorisation\n- ProfileServiceImpl.requireOwnerOrAdmin() lives in the service layer.\n  Controller stays request-handling only; access decisions are business\n  concerns.\n\nRuntime\n- New application-h2.yml profile boots against an in-memory H2 database\n  (MODE=MySQL for dialect compatibility, create-drop for isolation).\n  Enables the whole stack to run without MySQL installed for demos.","tree":{"sha":"b5fea23165b940e6d52c3936f2f5c10f50636bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/b5fea23165b940e6d52c3936f2f5c10f50636bf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKDBkMjU3NWFmY2Y2N2Q4MTk0ZDVkZTU3ZjQxNzk0NmI2NDUzZTVjNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4","sha":"cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4"}],"sha":"0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/0d2575afcf67d8194d5de57f417946b6453e5c77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:43:04Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:43:04Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(frontend): shell + shared + event-bus + auth-mf (module 1)\n\nShared (used by every MFE)\n- shared/constants.js: API_BASE_URL, EVENTS catalog, ROUTES,\n  SESSION_KEY, HEADERS.SESSION_ID.\n- shared/httpClient.js: fetch wrapper that attaches X-Session-Id from\n  sessionStorage, unwraps the {success,data,message} envelope, and\n  normalises errors (status, code, fieldErrors) for form-level display.\n- shared/ui-components.js: minimal toast helper (success / error / info).\n- shared/styles/tokens.css: colours, spacing, radii, typography — every\n  MFE styles against these variables.\n\nEvent bus\n- event-bus/eventBus.js: on() returns an unsubscribe fn; emit() snapshots\n  the subscriber set so a handler that mutates it mid-emit doesn''t skip\n  peers. Handlers that throw are logged, not propagated.\n\nShell\n- shell-app/index.html: header + nav + <main id=\"mfe-root\"> + footer.\n- js/constants.js: MFE_MANIFEST maps routes → the MFE that owns them.\n  Each MFE is self-describing (its own index.html lists its own CSS/JS),\n  so the manifest carries only the html entry path.\n- js/loader.js: fetches the MFE HTML, extracts stylesheets and scripts\n  from it, injects non-script body content into the mount point, and\n  re-loads scripts sequentially with cache-busted URLs so re-mounts\n  actually re-execute.\n- js/router.js: hash router. Guards protected routes when there is no\n  session; skips a re-mount when the same MFE owns the new hash so its\n  in-memory DOM state survives.\n- js/nav.js: renders guest vs authed nav based on the session in\n  sessionStorage. Delegated click listener bound once at boot so\n  re-renders don''t stack handlers. Handles logout end-to-end (server\n  call, local clear, USER_LOGOUT emit, redirect).\n\nauth-mf (module 1)\n- index.html: three <section data-view>s — login / register / home —\n  toggled by data-view + hidden attribute; no per-render HTML strings.\n- js/constants.js: endpoints, roles, VIEWS, ROUTE_TO_VIEW mapping,\n  messages, SEARCH_DEBOUNCE_MS.\n- js/validation.js: field validators return null or a message; login\n  and register aggregate to an errors object consumed by the form.\n- js/api.js: register / login / listUsers — everything through the\n  shared HttpClient.\n- js/events.js: emits USER_REGISTERED and USER_LOGIN via the event bus.\n- js/app.js: caches DOM lookups in an `els` object, wires form submits,\n  paints field-level errors from the backend''s fieldErrors payload,\n  hydrates the home view with the session user, and (for ADMIN)\n  renders the users table with a debounced search box. hashchange\n  handler is de-duped across mounts by storing the fn on window.","tree":{"sha":"64c5b03370abac4a6719433e7c619e8fd693bf2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/64c5b03370abac4a6719433e7c619e8fd693bf2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKGNjOTcwODcxZTUzMjBkNjkwN2QzZDllZmQ5OWEzYjBlY2EzMjA5YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0","sha":"47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0"}],"sha":"cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/cc970871e5320d6907d3d9efd99a3b0eca3209b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:42:35Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:42:35Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"feat(user-service): module 1 — auth + user listing\n\nEntities\n- User: email uk, BCrypt password_hash, role, status, created_at.\n- UserSession: sessionId (UUID) as PK, login/logout times, status.\n- Profile: 1:1 with User, created empty at register — Module 2 fills it.\n\nAuth flow\n- POST /auth/register: creates user + empty profile row. Rejects\n  duplicate email with 409. Password hashed with BCrypt from\n  spring-security-crypto (no Spring Security filter chain wired).\n- POST /auth/login: verifies credentials, inserts an ACTIVE row into\n  user_sessions, returns {sessionId, user}. Client stores the sessionId.\n- POST /auth/logout: flips the caller''s session to INACTIVE with a\n  logout_time stamp. Reads sessionId from ThreadLocal SessionContext.\n\nSession propagation\n- SessionFilter (OncePerRequestFilter) reads X-Session-Id, looks up an\n  ACTIVE session, and populates SessionHolder. Public prefixes\n  (/auth/register, /auth/login, /swagger-ui, /v3/api-docs, /actuator)\n  bypass the filter. SessionHolder.require() / requireAdmin() are used\n  by services to enforce access at the business layer.\n\nUser listing\n- GET /users?q=  uses JPA Specification to LIKE-match first/last/email.\n- GET /users/{id}\n- PATCH /users/{id}/status  admin-only, flips ACTIVE ↔ INACTIVE.\n\nCross-cutting\n- Global @RestControllerAdvice maps ResourceNotFound / Duplicate /\n  InvalidCredentials / Unauthorized / Forbidden / validation errors\n  to the shared ErrorResponse envelope with HTTP status + error code.\n- Constructor injection everywhere via @RequiredArgsConstructor.\n- OpenApiConfig declares X-Session-Id as an API-key security scheme\n  so Swagger UI can send it via the Authorize dialog.\n- application-dev.yml: MySQL (jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/linkedin_lite),\n  ddl-auto: update. H2 kept on the runtime classpath for future tests.","tree":{"sha":"0ec5537aaf03d9434890d9e8619ee2f131db841f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/trees/0ec5537aaf03d9434890d9e8619ee2f131db841f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/git/commits/47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0","node_id":"C_kwDOTO6dktoAKDQ3NTY2ZDcyYzVlZmE3NjgwN2UyMzFmMTE5OWU2ZTA0ZWQ2MWE3ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commit/18f75617892fc7621684dc7546670b10b11acc75","sha":"18f75617892fc7621684dc7546670b10b11acc75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/18f75617892fc7621684dc7546670b10b11acc75"}],"sha":"47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/47566d72c5efa76807e231f1199e6e04ed61a7e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120301380?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uvabd17","id":120301380,"login":"uvabd17","node_id":"U_kgDOByunRA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uvabd17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uvabd17/rahul_varun/commits/18f75617892fc7621684dc7546670b10b11acc75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:42:16Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T09:42:16Z","email":"120301380+uvabd17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"yuvaraj"},"message":"chore(backend): scaffold monorepo\n\n- Parent pom aggregates common-library, eureka-server, api-gateway,\n  user-service. Spring Boot 3.2.5, Spring Cloud 2023.0.1, Java 17.\n  Lombok wired via annotation-processor config.\n- common-library ships ApiResponse<T> envelope, ErrorResponse, and\n  SessionContext DTOs; SessionStatus / UserRole enums; ErrorCodes and\n  HttpHeaders constants (single source for \"X-Session-Id\").\n- eureka-server runs standalone on :8761 (register-with-eureka=false).\n- api-gateway on :8080 declares explicit routes: /auth/** and\n  /users/**, /profile/** → lb://user-service. Global CORS allows the\n  frontend dev origin http://localhost:3000.","tre