gical meaning as a small\n  chip below the temperature (same optics as the scale legend).\n- New per-widget \"Show temperature band\" option (Appearance group, default\n  on) so the user decides whether the chip is shown.\n- 10 localised band-meaning labels + the new option across all 11 languages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c9526d2af7011b56c82e792a5fc3367ad2d15c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/6c9526d2af7011b56c82e792a5fc3367ad2d15c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/f91255efd34b14732d34981a04dcea434d246ef2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/f91255efd34b14732d34981a04dcea434d246ef2","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKGY5MTI1NWVmZDM0YjE0NzMyZDM0OTgxYTA0ZGNlYTQzNGQyNDZlZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroke