e` (as CI does) no longer resolves them in a form the\nModule-Federation vite plugin accepts, so the production build failed with\n\"CacheProvider is not exported by @emotion/react\" and the v0.4.4 deploy was\nskipped. Declaring them explicitly fixes the clean-install build.\n\n- src-widgets-ts/package.json: add @emotion/react ^11.14.0, @emotion/styled ^11.14.1\n- rebuilt widgets/ bundle\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3ac89ae0d66a88e4fb187cf1cb1791acb4a276f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/a3ac89ae0d66a88e4fb187cf1cb1791acb4a276f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/4678c059846a4563c9be5fa172038aa168141d91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/4678c059846a4563c9be5fa172038aa168141d91","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKDQ2NzhjMDU5ODQ2YTQ1NjNj