{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/15fa7b5692b9ed91afc747ebf5196445a03d8e15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:31:39Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:31:39Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Release v0.4.3: FeedingAmount widgets use the adapter''s central feed list\n\nAdapts the feeding-amount widgets to iobroker.automatic-feeder v1.18.0\n(central feed list). Closes widget issue #33.\n\n- FeedingAmountSettings: the active feed is now chosen from the adapter''s\n  central feed list (native.feeds) via a dropdown, written id-based to\n  settings.activeFeed — replacing the deprecated per-switch feedProfiles\n  (which were index-based and broken since v1.18.0). New common helper\n  readFeedList + FeedDef; removed readFeedProfiles and the dead fas-seg CSS.\n- FeedingAmount: shows the active feed''s pellet size (status.activeFeedSize)\n  next to the name.\n- i18n: relabelled active_feed (dropped the stale \"dispense rate per pellet\"\n  note), added no_feed across all 11 languages.\n- rebuilt widgets/ bundle.\n\nRequires automatic-feeder v1.18.0+.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24476b50792059bcb156d2d29ec5aa9e2c662b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/24476b50792059bcb156d2d29ec5aa9e2c662b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/15fa7b5692b9ed91afc747ebf5196445a03d8e15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/15fa7b5692b9ed91afc747ebf5196445a03d8e15","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKDE1ZmE3YjU2OTJiOWVkOTFhZmM3NDdlYmY1MTk2NDQ1YTAzZDhlMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/db464d4abebacb1219dfebccd1faa0087ed5e0f0","sha":"db464d4abebacb1219dfebccd1faa0087ed5e0f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/db464d4abebacb1219dfebccd1faa0087ed5e0f0"}],"sha":"15fa7b5692b9ed91afc747ebf5196445a03d8e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/15fa7b5692b9ed91afc747ebf5196445a03d8e15"},{"author