se rate (settings.activeFeed,\n  needs automatic-feeder v1.17.0+).\n- FeedingAmount is a read-only display card again (edit mode removed); shows\n  the active feed-profile name (status.activeFeedName).\n- New fishIcons.ts (per-size icon data URIs) and fas-* editor styles.\n- README: sections 6.7/6.8, data-point rows, changelog; i18n +8/-4 keys x11.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"651dd003f0a045d201fade75ab6795b8fa0a79a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/651dd003f0a045d201fade75ab6795b8fa0a79a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/94e131b670939343c32e124edef2d8d52d091942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/94e131b670939343c32e124edef2d8d52d091942","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKDk0ZTEzMWI2NzA5MzkzNDNjMzJlMTI0ZWRlZjJkOGQ1MmQwOTE5NDI","parent