ce317433c6e4845022"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/b1dc11dc57e7a845fd86bed118b63a877c358f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:14:21Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:14:21Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Release v0.3.0: new editable FeedingAmount widget (adapter issue #24)\n\nNew widget FeedingAmount for the ioBroker.automatic-feeder feeding-amount\nmodel. It shows the recommended daily ration, the temperature percentage,\nthe estimated total weight and — in control mode — the per-feeding portion\nand motor run-times, using the adapter''s status.feedTargetPortionGrams /\nstatus.feedingsPerDayToday for an exact per-feeding amount.\n\nIt is also editable: an Edit toggle exposes the fish counts, the temperature\npercentages, the Phase-A/B switches and the dispense rate, writing to the\nadapter''s writable switches.<id>.settings.* states (automatic-feeder v1.16.0+).\n\n- src/FeedingAmount.tsx: edit mode + exact per-feeding DPs\n- src/styles.ts: editor styles (af-ed / af-grid / af-num / af-editlink)\n- i18n: +8 keys x 11 languages\n- rebuilt widgets/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aeddca52c3f9ee35ffee22fe6190d0d0fcbdc7f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/aeddca52c3f9ee35ffee22fe6190d0d0fcbdc7f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/b1dc11dc57e7a845fd86bed118b63a877c358f18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/b1dc11dc57e7a845fd86bed118b63a877c358f18","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKGIxZGMxMWRjNTdlN2E4NDVmZDg2YmVkMTE4YjYzYTg3N2MzNThmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/0b92018b5e529aa7a9004d41f88c7f2d0da0c9b1","sha":"0b92018b5e529aa7a9004d41f88c7f2d0da0c9b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/0b92018b5e529aa7a9004d41f88c7f2d0da0c9b1"}],"sha":"b1dc11dc57e7a845fd86bed118b63a877c358f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/b1dc11dc57e7a845fd86bed118b63a877c358f18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/0b92018b5e529aa7a9004d41f88c7f2d0da0c9b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:12:49Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:12:49Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"feat(widget): add FeedingAmount display widget\n\nNew vis-2 widget \"FeedingAmount\" that visualises the adapter''s\nfeeding-amount model (Phase A advisory / Phase B control) for one switch:\ndaily ration (hero), next portion in grams (control mode), estimated total\nfish weight, temperature-derived rate, and per-feeding / daily run-times.\nWarns on uncalibrated dispense rate and unknown water temperature.\n\nReads the real status.* states: fishTotalWeight, feedPercentToday,\nfeedTargetGramsToday, feedTargetSecondsToday, feedEffectiveDurationSec\n(mirrors lib/feeding-amount.js). Read-only for now — live editing of the\nmodel inputs needs the adapter to mirror them as writable settings.*\nstates (tracked in automatic-feeder#24); a high-temperature throttle for\nthe model is tracked in automatic-feeder#23.\n\n- new src-widgets-ts/src/FeedingAmount.tsx (extends FeederWidgetBase)\n- register in vite.config.ts exposes + io-package.json visWidgets.components\n- 13 new i18n keys across all 11 languages\n- rebuilt widgets/ bundle\n- src-widgets-ts/package.json version synced to 0.2.6 by the build tool\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2728d40884b4c4ff1b324a0bc3fae4b49173f5f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/2728d40884b4c4ff1b324a0bc3fae4b49173f5f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/0b92018b5e529aa7a9004d41f88c7f2d0da0c9b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github