@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"docs: rewrite README — comprehensive and accurate to 0.2.1\n\nDocuments all six widgets (FeederStatus, FeedControl, Environment, DynamicFeeding,\nSeasonBanner, AnimatedFeeder) with their real options/defaults and read/write data\npoints verified from source, plus a beginner walkthrough, bindings, and dev build.\nChangelog, badges, buy-me-a-coffee and license preserved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d51ca093a391212a1920101a9f4ab8af4308e09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/d51ca093a391212a1920101a9f4ab8af4308e09c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/a6199f6b887da9606ffaab7fdcdb8ad71027e78a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/a6199f6b887da9606ffaab7fdcdb8ad71027e78a","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKGE2MTk5ZjZiODg3ZGE5NjA2ZmZhYWI3ZmRjZGI4YWQ3MTAyN2U3OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/e3191a00a14b13c5b1b8ca8d3647fad17d3ad80f","sha":"e3191a00a14b13c5b1b8ca8d3647fad17d3ad80f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/e3191a00a14b13c5b1b8ca8d3647fad17d3ad80f"}],"sha":"a6199f6b887da9606ffaab7fdcdb8ad71027e78a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/a6199f6b887da9606ffaab7fdcdb8ad71027e78a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/e3191a00a14b13c5b1b8ca8d3647fad17d3ad80f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:46:50Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:46:50Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Release v0.2.1: AnimatedFeeder renders in Firefox\n\nThe built-in feeder image switched from a non-standard\n`data:image/svg+xml;utf8,` URI — which Firefox refuses to load (Chrome\ntolerated it) — to a base64 data URI. The canvas 2D context is now bound\nin the <canvas> ref callback (setupCanvas) instead of componentDidMount,\nso it initialises reliably regardless of mount order: the canvas can\nmount *after* componentDidMount once the channel resolves, which left\nctx null and the whole canvas blank. drawImage is wrapped in try/catch\nand an onerror handler was added, so a broken or zero-size custom image\n(e.g. a viewBox-only SVG that reports 0x0 in Firefox) can no longer blank\nthe ring/hint/pellets.\n\nDocs: changelog 0.2.1 (README), io-package news reduced to 0.2.1 only in\nall 11 languages (Rule 17). Rebuilt widgets/ bundle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec2774d6e9f926ee3735a67309136ebd30cabbab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/ec2774d6e9f926ee3735a67309136ebd30cabbab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/e3191a00a14b13c5b1b8ca8d3647fad17d3ad80f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}"