7T10:08:17Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T10:08:17Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"Release v0.2.0: new AnimatedFeeder widget\n\n* New sixth widget AnimatedFeeder — a large canvas animation of the feeder:\n  food pellets fall and a countdown ring fills while feeding, pause symbols\n  (manual / time-based / winter) otherwise, tap-to-feed via feedFor. The exact\n  countdown ring uses the adapter''s new status.feedingDurationSec (v1.6.0+);\n  older adapters derive the duration client-side. rAF loop stops when idle and\n  honours prefers-reduced-motion. Optional custom image + %-based geometry.\n* Built-in license-free stylized feeder graphic as the default image/fallback.\n* Full documentation (section 5.6, tables, requirements) in all 11 languages,\n  with self-rendered screenshots; 14 new i18n keys × 11 languages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c8d263e58fc3f6c9eab9274623dcd4ed8a4809b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/9c8d263e58fc3f6c9eab9274623dcd4ed8a4809b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/699f1f97f7f6aba52afaeb8c99820635018706ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_event