itzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:30:51Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"ci: adopt ioBroker standard workflow/automerge to satisfy repochecker\n\n- check-and-lint: use ioBroker/testing-action-check@v2 (lint: true); the\n  src-widgets-ts workspace is installed via install-command so eslint resolves\n  (W3013 / S3045)\n- deploy: use ioBroker/testing-action-deploy@v1 without npm-token, i.e. npm\n  trusted publishing (OIDC) with automatic provenance — keeps our token-less\n  publishing while satisfying the checker (W3017 / W3019 / S3018)\n- add a test:package script so testing-action-check''s default test command works\n  without overriding it (avoids W3048)\n- rename the dependabot automerge workflow to automerge-dependabot.yml and use\n  iobroker-bot-orga/action-automerge-dependabot@v1 with .github/auto-merge.yml\n  (S8913 / S8914; avoids the deprecated ahmadnassri action E8912)\n- add @alcalzone/release-script-plugin-manual-review devDependency (S5026)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2aba0779c9b284c65946d1cd54d667024878ac12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/2aba0779c9b284c65946d1cd54d667024878ac12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/9090c061fbaed021c84835b813d3393f05c5bf70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login"