mment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:43:39Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"9.1c: friendly switch selection (instance + switch-by-name) instead of a raw OID\n\nPicking the widget''s target no longer means selecting an obscure channel OID.\nBoth widgets now use a shared \"common\" attribute group:\n- \"Feeder instance\" — an instance dropdown (adapter automatic-feeder)\n- \"Switch\" — a custom dropdown listing the configured switches by their\n  friendly name (read from the instance''s native.switches), storing the id\n\nNew src/common.tsx (SwitchSelect custom component + channelOf/instanceNumber\nhelpers). FeederStatus/FeedControl derive the channel via channelOf(rxData).\ni18n: feeder_instance + switch. tsc/lint/build green; tarball repacked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8647878321e94b0880cdfb7c38012d332da64815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/8647878321e94b0880cdfb7c38012d332da64815"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/c12b066491c62c8882f29b7c9a4770d564b43640","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/c12b066491c62c8882f29b7c9a4770d564b43640","node_id":"C_kwDOTO9DftoAKGMxMmIwNjY0OTFjNjJjODg4MmYyOWI3YzlhNDc3MGQ1NjRiNDM2NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commit/0b238fec6fd69d621cb37409887499cfec95641d","sha":"0b238fec6fd69d621cb37409887499cfec95641d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/0b238fec6fd69d621cb37409887499cfec95641d"}],"sha":"c12b066491c62c8882f29b7c9a4770d564b43640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/c12b066491c62c8882f29b7c9a4770d564b43640"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/0b238fec6fd69d621cb37409887499cfec95641d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:19:27Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:19:27Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"9.1b: FeedControl widget (feed button, duration slider, master pause)\n\nSecond MVP widget:\n- \"Feed now\" button with a two-step confirmation, writes feedFor (the slider\n  seconds) as a one-off feeding without an instance restart\n- duration slider (1..maxDuration s)\n- master-pause toggle: writes settings.pauseNow, reflects status.pauseManual\n- shared card/slider/toggle CSS extracted into styles.ts (both widgets use it)\n- appearance attributes (accent, max duration, show pause, no card); i18n en+de\n- exposed via vite federation + io-package components [FeederStatus, FeedControl]\n- eslint: ignore the template''s src-icon-set helper so lint is fully clean\n\ntsc clean, lint clean, build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1106f5f02936eea1bf63854eec12ba6eb9c73002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/1106f5f02936eea1bf63854eec12ba6eb9c73002"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/0b238fec6fd69d621cb37409887499cfec95641d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ssbingo","id":47613800,"login":"ssbingo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NjEzODAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbi