ub.com/users/ssbingo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/commits/2e2658c894996664ec0ecbe399f01be6ecf175dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:09:33Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T07:09:33Z","email":"s.sternitzke@online.de","name":"ssbingo"},"message":"9.1: FeederStatus widget (animated feeder + runtime timer + countdown)\n\nFirst real widget, ported from the Phase-8 Teich status card:\n- one \"switch channel\" attribute (OID picker); the widget derives and\n  subscribes to the status.*/settings.* sub-states via context.socket\n- animated inline-SVG pontoon feeder with a fan that spins while feeding\n- runtime countdown badge (feedingEndsTs, position left/right), next-feeding\n  countdown, last feeding/result, astro window, block reason\n- appearance attributes (accent colour, timer position, animation, no card)\n- i18n keys (en + de complete, 9 languages English fallback for now)\n\nWired via vite federation (vis2AutomaticFeeder) + io-package visWidgets;\nDemoWidget removed. tsc clean, build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0569b86248a6471578f65e3244e45e87155eb939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/trees/0569b86248a6471578f65e3244e45e87155eb939"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ssbingo/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-automatic-feeder/git/commits/2e2658c894996664ec0ecbe399f01be6ecf175dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47613800?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssbingo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a