github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commits/59ed6af9859088aa09803163f52926b5e164f5eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:58:14Z","email":"3088506834@qq.com","name":"SiberianHusky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:58:14Z","email":"3088506834@qq.com","name":"SiberianHusky"},"message":"feat: 移动端应用化改版：主页注册内容流、域管理入口与应用模块加载修复\n\n- 全端「插件」改名「应用」；首页重构为 应用注册的主页内容流（mobile.home.cards）\n  + 我的应用图标网格，展示名/图标/描述来自清单\n- 新增域管理页（管理员）：站点域切换 + 应用可见性/排序（每域本地偏好 appPrefs）\n- /api/user/me admin 标志贯通登录与启动刷新，「我的」页显示管理员徽标\n- 修复插件远程加载全链路：\n  - remote 公共 publicPath:''auto'' 在 RN 无 document 时 eval 中断 → 显式留空\n  - 宿主 ScriptManager resolver 改纯字符串 URL（getRemoteURL 默认形态依赖\n    webpackContext.u 会抛错）；数字 chunkId 经 loadRemote 作用域归属回源；\n    expose 文件名优先取 remote 运行时 referenceUrl\n  - bundleCache 下载补域 origin（no protocol 崩溃）；入口改回源 + ScriptManager\n    原生缓存（file:// 路径 Hermes 稳定 ScriptEvalFailure）\n  - loadRemote 导出解析兼容 { default: 组件 } 包装；宿主注入 PluginMobileSdk\n    （api/storage/deeplink + 主题 token），PluginHost 透传应用内 route\n- 同步失败逐应用日志；pnpm-workspace 同步插件移动包","tree":{"sha":"2c2dae67aca757fc918095372b4a2ccb7ee03677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/trees/2c2dae67aca757fc918095372b4a2ccb7ee03677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/commits/59ed6af9859088aa09803163f52926b5e164f5eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72290399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YDHusky","id":72290399,"login":"YDHusky","node_id":"