ive/gradle-plugin 直接依赖\n  （pnpm 不会把 RN 传递依赖提升到 app 可解析位置，codegen 任务缺 combine-js-to-schema-cli）\n- gradle wrapper（8.10.2）jar/脚本落库；gradle.properties 构建架构收敛 x86_64（MuMu/主流模拟器）\n- 清单：图标改矢量 drawable（脚手架无 mipmap 资产）、dev 放行 cleartext；styles 移除模板\n  rn_edit_text_material 引用（资源在库内不可达导致 AAPT 链接失败）\n- 默认服务器地址改 127.0.0.1:8080 配合 adb reverse（10.0.2.2 在 MuMu 等模拟器不保证可用）\n- README 增补 Windows 构建环境实测流程：LongPathsEnabled 注册表 + 替换 SDK ninja 为\n  longPathAware 版本（≥1.12），并说明 junction/subst 绕短路径因 pnpm 相对软链不可行","tree":{"sha":"c294a83d6eb6f639ba551d1f0d5b3d2ac0cadfa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/trees/c294a83d6eb6f639ba551d1f0d5b3d2ac0cadfa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/commits/c14441cf5b15451c550604ae5e2144f374c91a4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72290399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YDHusky","id":72290399,"login":"YDHusky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMzk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commit/c14441cf5b15451c550604ae5e2144f374c91a4c","node_id":"C_kwDOTPBYUtoAKGMxNDQ0MWNmNWIxNTQ1MWM1NTA2MDRhZTVlMjE0NGYzNzRjOTFhNGM