ister|unregister、GET /api/mobile/devices（权限码 mobile:device:create/delete/view，末段落既定词表）\n- 插件元数据：plugin.yml mobile 块解析与注册期校验（platforms 仅 android/ios，缺省双端；minHostVersion 缺省 1.0.0），SPI PluginMobileSupport 镜像记录\n- 领域：MobilePluginSupport 过滤三判定值对象、MobileSemanticVersion 宽松版本比较、MobilePushChannel/发送端口，FCM/APNs 空实现占接口位\n- 移动产物下发约定 /api/platform/plugins/{code}/assets/mobile/** -> JAR 内 frontend-mobile/{code}/，含 remoteEntry SHA-256\n- 测试 23 例：domain/application/infra 定向测试全绿，含 iOS 过滤场景与 (userId,pushToken) 幂等 upsert","tree":{"sha":"9a20f871c75a75fe69f51e042415d586447c2be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/trees/9a20f871c75a75fe69f51e042415d586447c2be5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/commits/7acb1c528fd5068469b4d37f2b7c261c0adf2dfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72290399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YDHusky","id":72290399,"login":"YDHusky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMzk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commit/7acb1c528fd5068469b4d37f2b7c261c0adf2dfb","node_id":"C_kwDOTPBYUtoAKDdhY2IxYzUyOGZkNTA2ODQ2OWI0ZDM3ZjJiN2