ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commits/f1296cf612286b05481ed3ae028ef437cba73db8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:14:34Z","email":"3088506834@qq.com","name":"SiberianHusky"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:14:34Z","email":"3088506834@qq.com","name":"SiberianHusky"},"message":"feat: 插件流式 HTTP/WebSocket 端点与备份目录契约（SPI 2.33.0 / SDK 1.8.0）\n\nSPI 2.33.0 新增（default 方法，保持第三方 PluginContext 实现二进制兼容）\n- 流式 HTTP：PluginStreamingHttpHandler/Request/ResponseBody、PluginHttpBodyStream、\n  PluginHttpStreamingPart、@PluginStreamingHttpEndpoint，请求体与响应体真流式不整体缓冲，\n  超限抛 PluginHttpBodySizeExceededException（413）；注册随 disable/unload 回收\n- WebSocket：PluginWsHandler/Handshake/Session/CloseStatus，挂载\n  /api/platform/plugin-ws/{pluginCode}{path}，握手支持权限校验与票据，宿主在\n  disable/unload/reload 时强制关闭该插件全部会话\n- 备份：PluginBackupOperations.listScopeJobs + PluginBackupJobSummary，插件可查自己\n  范围的本机导出与异地推送任务摘要\n\n宿主实现\n- 运行时：PluginStreamingHttpBridge、RuntimeGatewayWsEndpointResolver、PluginWs 一套\n  （映射/握手/来源策略/会话适配/票据服务）、PluginBackupCatalogAppService 与控制器\n- 插件装配：PluginContextImpl/PluginAnnotationRegistrar 支持流式与 WS 注册，\n  JarPluginRuntimeGateway 停机时回收端点与会话\n- 插件恢复顺序改为按依赖深度（PluginDependencyGraph.restoreOrder）：软依赖 ClassLoader\n  链在消费方创建时一次性捕获，字母序会让消费方先于提供方加载而 NoClassDefFoundError\n\n前端：@yudream/plugin-sdk 1.8.0 注入 sdk.backup.targets()（异地目标目录，旧宿主空数组回落），\n宿主 SDK 常量与插件管理 API 同步\n\n文档：docs/plugin-system/spi-2.33.0-plugin-streaming-http.md、\nspi-2.33.0-plugin-websocket.md、docs/system/backup.md\n\n验证：mvn -pl yudream-domain,yudream-infrastructure,yudream-interfaces -am 定向测试\n30 项全绿（流式调度 21 项、WS 注册/装订/来源/票据、依赖图、Web 支持）","tree":{"sha":"38c6eb4501fbb9d32b5b94fe2b40f4c410b6a2e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/trees/38c6eb4501fbb9d32b5b94fe2b40f4c410b6a2e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/git/commits/f1296cf612286b05481ed3ae028ef437cba73db8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72290399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YDHusky","id":72290399,"login":"YDHusky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMzk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commit/f1296cf612286b05481ed3ae028ef437cba73db8","node_id":"C_kwDOTPBYUtoAKGYxMjk2Y2Y2MTIyODZiMDU0ODFlZDNhZTAyOGVmNDM3Y2JhNzNkYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commit/416c7bf4114af28ed80ffa4b3e4f564ee471a5da","sha":"416c7bf4114af28ed80ffa4b3e4f564ee471a5da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-Admin/commits/416c7bf4114af28ed80ffa4b3e4f564ee471a5da"}],"sha":"f1296cf612286b05481ed3ae028ef437cba73db8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/YuDream-A