ithubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e7a9a9542b1b804e2e34d5e227fbeb252c0c0ac0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:09:14Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:09:14Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"fix(members): ledger-backed demo seeds — honest qualifying points survive requalification\n\nThe e2e caught the requalification sweep downgrading demo-ada to MEMBER:\nthe seed wrote document-level qualifying points with no earn entries\nbehind them, and the honest rolling-window recompute said zero. Seeds\nnow come with matching earn ledger entries dated inside the 12-month\nwindow (ada 20k+12k, yusra 60k+36k; sources chosen to stay clear of the\nduplicate-delivery check''s stayinn count), and demo-erik deliberately\nstarts with an EMPTY window so his first purchase alone puts him at\nexactly 20 000. A seed test pins the invariant: a sweep over freshly\nseeded data changes nothing.","tree":{"sha":"a0591219c7440f8f27edf9e9ce3e74bf9c239a14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/a0591219c7440f8f27edf9e9ce3e74bf9c239a14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/e7a9a9542b1b804e2e34d5e227fbeb252c0c0ac0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/e7a9a9542b1b804e2e34d5e227fbeb252c0c0ac0","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGU3YTlhOTU0MmIxYjgwNGUyZTM0ZDVlMjI3ZmJlYjI1MmMwYzBhYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64","sha":"3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64"}],"sha":"e7a9a9542b1b804e2e34d5e227fbeb252c0c0ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e7a9a9542b1b804e2e34d5e227fbeb252c0c0ac0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:56:32Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:56:32Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"chore(ci,infra): lint gates for every language, secretRef datastore config, datastore NetworkPolicies\n\nESLint 9 flat configs (typescript-eslint recommended, framework plugins\nfor React hooks / Vue / Svelte) gate all seven TypeScript packages in CI\n— the TS7 native compiler required a lint-only TypeScript 5 shim behind\nnpm overrides in six of them; admin-portal''s TS 6 needed none. dotnet\nformat --verify-no-changes gates members (one-time normalization\nincluded) and a deliberately low-churn Spotless (unused imports,\ntrailing whitespace, final newline) gates both Java services. Datastore\nconnection strings move behind an osprey-datastores Secret via\nsecretKeyRef — the swap-one-manifest pattern, values stay demo-public —\nand ingress-only NetworkPolicies pin mongo/neo4j/rabbitmq/mailpit to the\nservices that own them. member-portal''s unwired oxlint config retired in\nfavor of the ESLint gate.","tree":{"sha":"00f471d9dd8ba5d74601ba1a83aaef027508353d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/00f471d9dd8ba5d74601ba1a83aaef027508353d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDNjZDM2YTQxZWE1MmVmZTNiN2Y2NGFhMmI0NjIwMzQwZmZjY2RlNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a","sha":"8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a"}],"sha":"3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/3cd36a41ea52efe3b7f64aa2b4620340ffccde64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:24:28Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:24:28Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(gateway,members,infra): dashboard degradation, upstream read retries, ingress rate limiting, business metrics\n\nThe gateway dashboard fan-out moves to allSettled: a downstream outage\ndegrades its section to empty and NAMES it in a new degraded field\ninstead of failing the whole query, and every idempotent read gets one\njittered retry (mutations never do — their retry safety is the caller''s\nidempotency key). Traefik gains a CRD-free file-provider rate-limit\nmiddleware (token bucket per source IP) applied to every ingress host,\nclosing the threat model''s request-flood gap. Members exposes business\ncounters (points earned/redeemed/expired, tier changes by direction),\nincremented only when a change actually applies, charted by a new\nGrafana Business dashboard in compose and k8s.","tree":{"sha":"40aea63ac4484f369e203dc5de2ddc41c6e91013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/40aea63ac4484f369e203dc5de2ddc41c6e91013"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDhiMTBkODQyNDE1NDRiZDc0MjQwNGRhNWE0MWFlZmNiNTVkMDk0M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927","sha":"f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927"}],"sha":"8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/8b10d84241544bd742404da5a41aefcb55d0943a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:17:47Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:17:47Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(members,gateway,member-portal): tier benefit activation with codes and QR\n\nBenefits stop being display-only: an entitled member activates one and\ngets a readable 8-character code (unambiguous alphabet) plus a QR to show\nat the counter. Entitlement and display share Tiers.BenefitsFor, so the\ndashboard''s list is exactly what can be activated; a retried activation\nreturns the ORIGINAL code via a unique idempotency index (the ADR-0002\nmechanism again). Flows members REST -> gateway GraphQL (activateBenefit\nmutation + benefitActivations query) -> dashboard benefit buttons, in all\nfive languages.","tree":{"sha":"16f41738831b6c82863449ff25db032914bf85da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/16f41738831b6c82863449ff25db032914bf85da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGY0Zjg1ODg2N2Y4MDM3MGYwODI0ZDJjZmNlZjRhZDk1MWUyYWQ5Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc","sha":"dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc"}],"sha":"f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/f4f858867f80370f0824d2cfcef4ad951e2ad927"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:08:33Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:08:33Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(members,gateway,portals): audit viewer, managed rewards catalog, CSV statements, server-side transaction filter\n\nThe audit trail written since ADR-0017 finally gets a reader: a paginated\nadmin endpoint plus an admin-portal panel. The reward catalog moves from\na hard-coded list to Mongo with admin CRUD (slug/name/cost validation,\nconflict on duplicate ids) — the three classics seed an EMPTY collection\nonly, so curation survives redeploys, and Redeem resolves the catalog\nfrom the collection. The transactions type filter becomes a query\nvariable filtered server-side in members so it spans the whole ledger,\nand a bounded CSV statement export flows members → gateway passthrough →\nmember-portal download button. All new UI text ships in five languages.","tree":{"sha":"f5fadbc06025d1994844e560942bdd274624706a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/f5fadbc06025d1994844e560942bdd274624706a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGRkNzAwYTUxOTdmMzc3OTJiMjkyYWI5YWJmMTg0OGRjMTE4YjU5ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad","sha":"e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad"}],"sha":"dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/dd700a5197f37792b292ab9abf1848dc118b59fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:53:18Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:53:18Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(partners,admin-portal): time-boxed promotion campaigns folded into the earn rate\n\nCampaigns live in partners with the PartnerCatalogue trade-off (in-memory,\nper-instance, defaults on restart): create/list/delete over REST, highest\nactive multiplier wins, never stacking. At purchase time the multiplier\nfolds into the effective rate so the earn-event contract stays untouched;\na fold that would breach the contract''s rate cap of 10 refuses the\npurchase with a localized message. The admin portal gets a campaigns\npanel (list, create with partner/multiplier/window, delete with confirm)\nin all five languages, and the compose smoke proves a 2x campaign doubles\na cardco earn end to end.","tree":{"sha":"067ab10ac6f94e4e4f565d895d627086b89f3991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/067ab10ac6f94e4e4f565d895d627086b89f3991"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGUwNThmNzlmNjVmNjk0Yjc0MWQ2NTYwOTNjMDkzZTI4YTE5MzU2YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883","sha":"884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883"}],"sha":"e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e058f79f65f694b741d656093c093e28a19356ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:45:38Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:45:38Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(members,gateway,route-explorer): book a searched trip with points end to end\n\nMembers gets a RedeemTrip slice with the same atomic conditional\ndecrement + idempotent-retry arbiter as Redeem, burning against a\ntrip:FROM-TO ledger source. The gateway''s bookTrip mutation prices\nserver-side — it re-runs routeSearch and passes ITS estimate to members,\nso the browser only ever names the route. Route explorer shows a Book\nwith points action on the shown route (auth sub or the demo identity,\nfresh idempotency key per click) with confirmed/already-applied/refused\nstates, localized in all five languages.","tree":{"sha":"187e10602eb39d0a0e4946e3a9723bd81ea6a9fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/187e10602eb39d0a0e4946e3a9723bd81ea6a9fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDg4NGY2ZGQyN2JhNjg0N2U5NGNmNWI3OTNiMTQxOGI5YjM4YmE4ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e","sha":"950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e"}],"sha":"884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/884f6dd27ba6847e94cf5b793b1418b9b38ba883"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:34:30Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:34:30Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(members,notifications,infra): member domain events over a transactional outbox and an email notifications service (ADR-0024)\n\nMembers gains a transactional outbox whose document id is the\ndeterministic event id (dedup by construction): tier changes from the\nearn path and requalification sweep, and once-per-lot 30-day expiry\nwarnings, publish to a new member-events topic exchange via a polling\nrelay with its own kill switch. Contracts (schemas + fixtures) follow\nthe earn-event pattern with producer- and consumer-side tests. A new\nTypeScript notifications service consumes the queue with earn-consumer\nsemantics (ack/dead-letter/requeue, quorum + delivery limit), resolves\nmember emails at send time (events carry no PII, erased members skip),\nand delivers over SMTP to Mailpit — exposed in compose and k8s with the\nfleet hardening baseline, asserted end to end in the compose smoke.","tree":{"sha":"5c8a1a5fe9a028b26eee30f6aaa2d4f4e653ba48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/5c8a1a5fe9a028b26eee30f6aaa2d4f4e653ba48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDk1MGI0MjFiMjdjMjRiZGJmZjZiZGRiMzUxNDY5NTk1MzgyMGVjNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/ed19f693fa309f84739545f67cf1a21a2ac70baf","sha":"ed19f693fa309f84739545f67cf1a21a2ac70baf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/ed19f693fa309f84739545f67cf1a21a2ac70baf"}],"sha":"950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/950b421b27c24bdbff6bddb3514695953820ec6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/ed19f693fa309f84739545f67cf1a21a2ac70baf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:16:17Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T09:16:17Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(members): tier requalification sweep with downgrade and versioned Mongo migrations\n\nApplyEarn recomputes the rolling 12-month window only when a new earn\narrives, so members who stopped earning kept stale tiers forever. A daily\nrequalification sweep (same cadence and failure contract as expiry) now\nrecomputes every member''s window from the ledger, applies downgrades and\ndrift corrections with convergent conditional writes, and reports tier\nchanges for the upcoming event publication. A minimal run-once migration\nrunner (markers in a migrations collection, idempotent bodies) recomputes\nall members at deploy so stale tiers correct immediately.","tree":{"sha":"82790d02d19434406dfd10a6ef6b6b5b25cc28cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/82790d02d19434406dfd10a6ef6b6b5b25cc28cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/ed19f693fa309f84739545f67cf1a21a2ac70baf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer