,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/a2e95b914abba917cc17136cdd4c0f5509dc5b6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:06:15Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:06:15Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(routes): order airport search by destination count, then name\n\nRelevance still gates the candidates (top 50 by lucene score, bounded); the\ntypeahead then surfaces hubs first — Heathrow before a similarly-scoring field\nstrip — with name as the tiebreak. Same behaviour lands in Explore and both\nroute-search pickers since they share the gateway query. Verified against a\nreal Neo4j via the seedAndQueries integration test.","tree":{"sha":"c460311cdb6d29a285969cb63c0a10c15645fb96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/c460311cdb6d29a285969cb63c0a10c15645fb96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/a2e95b914abba917cc17136cdd4c0f5509dc5b6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/a2e95b914abba917cc17136cdd4c0f5509dc5b6f","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGEyZTk1YjkxNGFiYmE5MTdjYzE3MTM2Y2RkNGMwZjU1MDlkYzViNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/e5dbd81f57e14f8d9f3488a01dfa55cad170f214","sha":"e5dbd81f57e14f8d9f3488a01dfa55cad170f214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e5dbd81f57e14f8d9f3488a01dfa55cad170f214"}],"sha":"a2e95b914abba917cc17136cdd4c0f5509dc5b6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/a2e95b914abba917cc17136cdd4c0f5509dc5b6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/e5dbd81f57e14f8d9f3488a01dfa55cad170f214/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T20:02:59Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-0