yLoyalty/commits/b04cb702c3e60e40e2cad95ceab7babbaadb34a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T17:25:51Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T17:25:51Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(route-explorer): i18n, map zoom, stateful tabs, field-guide UI\n\n- Five-language JSON catalogs (ADR-0009) resolved per property access off\n  localStorage(\"lang\"); locale-aware number formatting\n- Map island: wheel zoom at cursor, drag-to-pan, +/-/reset toolbar; warm\n  field-guide canvas palette; all user-facing text moved to the Svelte side\n- Clicking an airport shows name/city/country + destination count via the\n  existing airport(iata) query; stale picks race-guarded\n- Route search draws the found itinerary on an inline world map; map airport\n  payload memoized across islands\n- Tabs keep their state (hidden, not destroyed, once visited)\n- Destination lists page at 25 with a show-more button\n- Field-guide design system: Fraunces/Hanken Grotesk, bark/amber/cream tokens\n  inherited from the shell with standalone fallbacks, card panels, shared\n  table/button/badge patterns","tree":{"sha":"75ce10bdf77a29e8e1c1c7a4446aebb83b796803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/75ce10bdf77a29e8e1c1c7a4446aebb83b796803"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/b04cb702c3e60e40e2cad95ceab7babbaadb34a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/b04cb702c3e60e40e2cad95ceab7babbaadb34a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGIwNGNiNzAyYzNlNjBlNDBlMmNhZDk1Y2VhYjdiYWJiYWFkYjM0YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14","sha":"cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14"}],"sha":"b04cb702c3e60e40e2cad95ceab7babbaadb34a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/b04cb702c3e60e40e2cad95ceab7babbaadb34a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T14:01:07Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T14:01:07Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"chore(infra,ci,docs): k8s manifests, CI workflows and docs for the Route Explorer\n\nKubernetes: neo4j (StatefulSet on the mongo pattern, apoc enabled,\nmemory-bounded, cluster-internal only), routes (readiness /ready implies\nseeded+warm with generous first-boot thresholds), route-explorer (nginx\nremote), ingress hosts explorer./routes.osprey.localtest.me, and gateway\nROUTES_URL. run-local-k8s builds/loads the new images and bakes the\nshell with the explorer remote URL.\n\nCI: routes.yml (unit + build + ungated Testcontainers integration, the\nmembers precedent) and route-explorer.yml (npm tests + codegen drift\ncheck; a separate rust job runs cargo test and proves the wasm-pack +\nVite build from a clean tree). run-unit-tests gains routes, the\nroute-explorer suite, wasm-map cargo tests and the Docker-gated routes\nintegration step; e2e-smoke waits for routes readiness and asserts\nairport search plus a priced routeSearch through the gateway.\n\nDocs: README service/frontend tables, URLs, a route-network demo flow\nand an honest roadmap entry; architecture overview gains the routes and\nroute-explorer containers, Neo4j infra notes and updated diagram; new\nfrontends/route-explorer README; routes README catches up with\n/routes/search, dijkstra and the degrading points estimate.","tree":{"sha":"e5f7aaf2980dc1aa80c335d8cecdd92da1a1b6c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/e5f7aaf2980dc1aa80c335d8cecdd92da1a1b6c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGNiZTk2ZmJiODRmMzA5MmE4YWVhZjRlZWY3Y2RhYjc2NWZiMDZlMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca","sha":"de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca"}],"sha":"cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/cbe96fbb84f3092a8aeaf4eef7cdab765fb06e14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:37:59Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:37:59Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(route-explorer): interactive world map as a Rust/Leptos WASM island\n\nThe wasm-map crate (ADR-0022) exposes a single RouteMap handle behind a\ntyped-array boundary: Float32Array coordinates in, airport indices as the\nshared currency, metadata stays on the JS side. Pure geometry (equirect\nprojection, great-circle slerp sampling, antimeridian splitting, pick\nhit-testing) lives in geometry.rs under plain native cargo tests; Canvas\n2D drawing is the thin web-sys edge; Leptos renders the island-internal\nDOM (canvas + reactive status line) and is invisible to Svelte.\n\nMapPanel injects both the island loader and the data functions, so tests\nrun against a fake island and neither npm test nor npm run dev ever needs\na Rust toolchain — a missing pkg degrades to a visible build hint. A\nsearched itinerary flows from the route-search tab to the map through one\nlifted iata-sequence state. The Docker build gains a rust:1-slim stage\nthat wasm-packs the crate before the Vite build; the pkg is gitignored\nwith an ambient module declaration keeping tsc green on fresh clones.\nCodegen now excludes src/wasm and src/gql — wasm-pack .d.ts output chokes\nthe GraphQL document plucker.","tree":{"sha":"4dc6bf080a8485c9149327337f951bba130ea61c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/4dc6bf080a8485c9149327337f951bba130ea61c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGRlODVjNGYyNDBlNDU0NmM1OTNhZmU1YWNjY2IzMzUwZDVkM2QzY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e","sha":"f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e"}],"sha":"de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/de85c4f240e4546c593afe5acccb3350d5d3d3ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:17:29Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:17:29Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(routes,gateway,route-explorer): estimated Osprey points per itinerary via points-engine\n\nReuse over reimplement (ADR-0006): the routes service asks the Rust\npoints-engine to price a found itinerary (amount = totalKm, rate =\nROUTE_POINTS_PER_KM) and decorates the answer with estimatedPoints. The\nestimate is decoration, not dependency: its client gets a 600 ms budget —\nfar inside the BFF''s 2 s abort — and every failure mode (down, timeout,\n5xx, drifted shape) degrades to estimatedPoints: null with a warn log,\nverified by stopping the engine mid-flight and watching the search still\nanswer 200 in 0.7 s. The gateway passes the nullable field through the\nschema and the Svelte page shows it as a badge that simply disappears\nwhen the estimate is unavailable. Number formatting pinned to en-US so\ntests do not depend on the host locale.","tree":{"sha":"5473b7d381dab3a47696ec20a9aa9dcb22b23371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/5473b7d381dab3a47696ec20a9aa9dcb22b23371"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGYzZDQ0M2Y2NzhjNDY1MmYyNDBiYjIxYjQzMGNjNzUxNGNjYzQxMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/35765858369e89efed98f2b119eb8c3ac8de54a3","sha":"35765858369e89efed98f2b119eb8c3ac8de54a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/35765858369e89efed98f2b119eb8c3ac8de54a3"}],"sha":"f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/f3d443f678c4652f240bb21b430cc7514ccc410e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/35765858369e89efed98f2b119eb8c3ac8de54a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:10:53Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:10:53Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(routes,gateway,route-explorer): itinerary search A->B by distance, time or hops\n\nWeighted search runs apoc.algo.dijkstra over the directed ROUTE graph; the\noriginal plugin-free L..L+1 window heuristic tripped its own timing tripwire\non real data (thin 4-5-hop pairs enumerate the whole hub belt), so ADR-0021''s\ndocumented escape hatch was taken — history recorded in the ADR. apoc core\nships inside the neo4j image, so enabling it stays offline-friendly.\n\nTwo operational lessons are wired in rather than worked around: the service\nexecutes each search query shape once at startup so /ready implies warm\n(first execution costs 1-4s in plan compilation + JIT, later ones run in\nmilliseconds), and proving a pair unreachable gets its own 1.2s budget with\na transaction timeout mapped to \"no route found\" — the answer must beat the\nBFF''s 2s abort, because the bound is the product promise.\n\nGateway adds RoutePath/RouteLeg/RouteOptimize and the routeSearch query\n(unreachable resolves to null, not an error). The Svelte remote grows a\nroute-search slice: the typeahead is extracted into a reusable\nAirportPicker, and the page offers a km/min/hops toggle with legs, totals\nand the same one-visible-error degradation as the rest of the portal.","tree":{"sha":"298b9cb46f7dff9a0a95e80b01cd03e22a5f4116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/298b9cb46f7dff9a0a95e80b01cd03e22a5f4116"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/35765858369e89efed98f2b119eb8c3ac8de54a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"