s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/6a2ec92d48d65c954f7efb12c79ada25273cd6c8","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDZhMmVjOTJkNDhkNjVjOTU0ZjdlZmIxMmM3OWFkYTI1MjczY2Q2Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/8b2bb22e2981202c46153999205c452c9a15b9be","sha":"8b2bb22e2981202c46153999205c452c9a15b9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/8b2bb22e2981202c46153999205c452c9a15b9be"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a","sha":"4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a"}],"sha":"6a2ec92d48d65c954f7efb12c79ada25273cd6c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/6a2ec92d48d65c954f7efb12c79ada25273cd6c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T11:44:09Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T11:44:09Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"security: harden containers and app workloads, triage Trivy code-scanning alerts\n\nResolve the 66 open Trivy findings in the Security -> Code scanning tab by\nfixing everything we build and triaging the rest with a documented, path-scoped\nallowlist — the \"triage to a clean baseline\" step called for in SECURITY.md.\n\nFixed in code (31 findings):\n- DS-0002 (7 Dockerfiles): run every image as non-root. gateway -> USER node;\n  security/partners (temurin) and points-engine (debian) get a dedicated\n  uid 10001 app user; the three nginx frontends switch to\n  nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged (uid 101, serves on 8080).\n- KSV-0118 + KSV-0014 (8 first-party k8s deployments): add pod- and\n  container-level securityContext (runAsNonRoot, runAsUser, drop ALL caps,\n  allowPrivilegeEscalation:false, seccompProfile RuntimeDefault,\n  readOnlyRootFilesystem) plus a writable /tmp emptyDir. Frontends move their\n  containerPort/probes to 8080; the Service keeps port 80 so ingress and\n  in-cluster references are unchanged.\n\nTriaged, not changed (35 findings) via .trivyignore.yaml:\n- Required by design: node-exporter host access (KSV-0009/0010/0121),\n  prometheus/promtail nodes/proxy scrape RBAC (KSV-0047), kube-state-metrics\n  and traefik Secret read access (KSV-0041).\n- Third-party ops images (grafana, prometheus, loki, jaeger, alertmanager,\n  otel-collector, mongo, rabbitmq, traefik, promtail) KSV-0118/KSV-0014:\n  hardening these needs per-image UID + writable-path mapping verified against\n  the live cluster — a tracked infra follow-up, not shipped unverified.\n\ndevsecops.yml passes --ignorefile so the Trivy fs scan honours the allowlist.\n\nVerified: `trivy config` clears all fixed rules (66 Dockerfile+k8s -> 35, none\non our workloads); nginx-unprivileged, node and JRE images run read-only\nnon-root; the built member-portal image serves HTTP 200 read-only as uid 101;\nevery remaining alert path is covered by the allowlist (0 missing).","tree":{"sha":"5199e64e671d310f463060355b072892ae97fb62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/5199e64e671d310f463060355b072892ae97fb62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDQxNzRjMjgzNDBjODY3MDMzOGVhM2Q3MThhODJlZmU4OTIwMzE4MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/8b2bb22e2981202c46153999205c452c9a15b9be","sha":"8b2bb22e2981202c46153999205c452c9a15b9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/8b2bb22e2981202c46153999205c452c9a15b9be"}],"sha":"4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/4174c28340c8670338ea3d718a82efe89203180a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/dc481a579176a6f20f9a715f961918b724f86b0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T11:14:53Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T11:14:53Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(route-explorer): Svelte micro-frontend with airport explorer, wired into the shell\n\nThird remote per ADR-0004/0022: Svelte 5 (runes) + Vite 8 federation\nexposing the same mount(el) => unmount contract, the shared\nfederationCssMarkerFix, graphql-request + codegen against the gateway\nschema, and the shell-owned session token read from sessionStorage.\nThe explore slice ships a debounced airport typeahead and a destinations\ntable; data functions are props with real defaults so component tests\ninject fakes and never touch transport. English-only strings gathered in\none module (TODO ADR-0009); the shell nav label is localized in all five\nlocales. Shell gains the routeExplorer remote across its seven touch\npoints, visible to both roles, with a mount/teardown test.","tree":{"sha":"291fe9cf3a4e81cee7d53c70da6adf5a3aac4534","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/291fe9cf3a4e81cee7d53c70da6adf5a3aac4534"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/dc481a579176a6f20f9a715f961918b724f86b0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","