is readable\n\nDocker Desktop 29 + the current rabbitmq:3 image: the root entrypoint writes\n.erlang.cookie root-owned onto the fresh tmpfs, then the broker (uid 999)\ngets eacces reading it back and crash-loops. Starting the container as the\nrabbitmq user (with a uid-owned tmpfs) makes the cookie its own from the\nfirst write. Also picks up the new neo4j/routes/route-explorer services and\nthe gateway ROUTES_URL wiring on the same file.","tree":{"sha":"fbaf90ae46b6cdafd0ebaf35631b82f1a71fe074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/fbaf90ae46b6cdafd0ebaf35631b82f1a71fe074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/3db85a85c445bef89d69b0ac8f11b161d6465f09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/3db85a85c445bef89d69b0ac8f11b161d6465f09","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDNkYjg1YTg1YzQ0NWJlZjg5ZDY5YjBhYzhmMTFiMTYxZDY0NjVmMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/