MapAirport) and queries; snapshot\nrefreshed in the same change that introduces the consumers.\n\nTest debt paid down while extending Deps: resolver-level tests now build\ntheir dependency object through test/fakeDeps.ts overrides instead of\nfive hand-rolled literals per file, so the next fetcher added to Deps is\na one-line change.","tree":{"sha":"139cbce664cb603b8c2b328ed05eb87add8c1457","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/139cbce664cb603b8c2b328ed05eb87add8c1457"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/c023b09cdba652da6da7fe27ae2b6163b6b30efe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/c023b09cdba652da6da7fe27ae2b6163b6b30efe","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKGMwMjNiMDljZGJhNjUyZGE2ZGE3ZmUyN2FlMmI2MTYzYjZiMzBlZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/499babf7163394ef1a986bace46b2e8335a81d9f","sha":"499babf7163394ef1a986bace46b2e8335a81d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/499babf7163394ef1a986bace46b2e8335a81d9f"}],"sha":"c023b09cdba652da6da7fe27ae2b6163b6b30efe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/c023b09cdba652da6da7fe27ae2b6163b6b30efe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/499babf7163394ef1a986bace46b2e8335a81d9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T10:11:54Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T10:11:54Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(routes): airline route graph service on Neo4j — idempotent seed + airport queries\n\nNode 22 service mirroring the gateway skeleton (otel-first, prom-client\nhistogram with low-cardinality route labels, correlation ids, pino JSON,\nopt-in HS256/JWKS auth that never guards health/ready/metrics). The pure\nmiddle (dataset parsing, lucene escaping, carrier zipping) is mock-free\nunit-tested; the HTTP edge is tested handler-level against fake deps; a\nTestcontainers Neo4j proves seed idempotence, cypher and full-text search.\n\nSeeding is marker-gated (SeedMeta version node), batched (500 airports /\n1000 edges per bounded write tx) and crash-safe via MERGE; /ready flips\nonly once the graph exists so orchestrators hold traffic. All reads carry\na 2s server-side transaction timeout to match the BFF''s client abort.","tree":{"sha":"5423742ab397106c134776549b04535da203b041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/5423742ab397106c134776549b04535da203b041"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/499babf7163394ef1a986bace46b2e8335a81d9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/499babf7163394ef1a986bace46b2e8335a81d9f","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDQ5OWJhYmY3MTYzMzk0ZWYxYTk4NmJhY2U0NmIyZTgzMzVhODFkOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/b37a5333f8fa495101041aa049c70a5b28c89eda","sha":"b37a5333f8fa495101041