":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:56:20Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:56:20Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"feat(infra): expose points-engine through the ingress\n\nThe points-engine had a Service but no ingress route, so it was unreachable in\ningress mode. Add a points-engine.osprey.localtest.me host (covered by the existing\n*.osprey.localtest.me wildcard TLS cert) routing to the points-engine Service on\n8082, and print its URL from the run-local-k8s scripts in both ingress and\nport-forward modes. Verified: GET /health -> 200, POST /calculate -> {\"points\":40000}.","tree":{"sha":"9e86e76d2548b884e0192bee2749584e043eb031","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/9e86e76d2548b884e0192bee2749584e043eb031"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/47eb218c9886c9a5803ce0f3ab8e190882b3147e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"