 the GitHub community profile: a Contributor Covenant 2.1 Code of Conduct,\na CONTRIBUTING guide tailored to the repo''s toolchains/tests/conventions, bug and\nfeature issue templates (plus a config routing security reports to SECURITY.md and\nquestions to Discussions), and a pull request template with a Conventional-Commits\nand contract-compatibility checklist.","tree":{"sha":"d26b8516ddb340039c4e96000697deefb570bd08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/d26b8516ddb340039c4e96000697deefb570bd08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/18fc59ad72a05d8f887ba3a24b830125e8f89143","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/18fc59ad72a05d8f887ba3a24b830125e8f89143","node_id":"C_kwDOTPCIxtoAKDE4ZmM1OWFkNzJhMDVkOGY4ODdiYTNhMjRiODMwMTI1ZThmODkxNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commit/5be755d63d2d1c20d9fd72ad4b5709bd1495fe78","sha":"5be755d63d2d1c20d9fd72ad4b5709bd1495fe78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/5be755d63d2d1c20d9fd72ad4b5709bd1495fe78"}],"sha":"18fc59ad72a05d8f887ba3a24b830125e8f89143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/18fc59ad72a05d8f887ba3a24b830125e8f89143"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/commits/5be755d63d2d1c20d9fd72ad4b5709bd1495fe78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:35:34Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:35:34Z","email":"daniel.klingstedt@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Klingstedt"},"message":"fix(k8s): stop RabbitMQ liveness from killing a healthy broker\n\nrabbitmq-0 restarted 6x/22h and took the partners service down with it. Root cause\nwas probe flapping, not a broker fault: both probes ran ''rabbitmq-diagnostics -q ping'',\nwhich boots a fresh Erlang CLI node each call and took 7.5-10.5s under the 500m CPU\nlimit (73% CFS-throttled) — straddling timeoutSeconds: 10. When ping crossed 10s,\nkubelet SIGTERMed the broker (lastState Completed/exit 0), which force-closed every\nAMQP connection (''connection_forced ... shutdown''); partners'' actuator health then\nwent DOWN and kubelet SIGTERMed it too (exit 143).\n\nFix:\n- Liveness -> tcpSocket:5672. A socket check is instant and cannot time out, so a\n  slow-but-alive broker is never killed; ''is the listener accepting?'' is the right\n  liveness question anyway.\n- Readiness keeps the real ping check but timeoutSeconds 10->30 and periodSeconds\n  15->30, so a slow ping no longer pulls the node from the Service endpoints.\n- CPU limit 500m->1000m (request 100m->250m): halves ping time (~3.9s measured) and\n  drops throttling, so readiness has ~7x headroom.\n\nVerified on docker-desktop: restarts 0, ping 3.9s, throttling 73%->49% and falling,\npartners back to 1/1 ready.","tree":{"sha":"6a6eb5e63915c48a6f64a9e41d4ac9626ec1d220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/trees/6a6eb5e63915c48a6f64a9e41d4ac9626ec1d220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dankli/OspreyLoyalty/git/commits/5be755d63d2d1c20d9fd72ad4b5709bd1495fe78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138536?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dankli","id":138536,"login":"dankli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODUzNg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dankli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https