csIJA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayanraj864-cmyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayanraj864-cmyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayanraj864-cmyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayanraj864-cmyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayanraj864-cmyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nayanraj864-cmyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c3effc426a7882e339caac55fea4ad58a0b73cb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:45:30Z","email":"nayanraj864@gmail.com","name":"nayanraj864-cmyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T03:45:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(sponsors): Build a ''Real-Time \"Sponsor Lead\" CRM Webhook Rate Limit Backpressure'' (#5061) (#5481)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nThis PR implements the ''Real-Time \"Sponsor Lead\" CRM Webhook Rate Limit\nBackpressure'' (`sponsor_crm_backpressure_states`,\n`sponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressure.ts`, and\n`SponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressureWidget`), protecting target sponsor CRM\nendpoints (e.g., Salesforce) from IP blacklisting or DDoS throttling\nwhen dead-letter SQS queues process large hackathon lead volumes by\nparsing HTTP 429 `Retry-After` headers, dynamically pausing queue\nconsumers, and resuming dispatches at throttled rates (5 req/sec).\n\n### Key Highlights:\n- **Database Schema\n(`20260873000000_sponsor_crm_rate_limit_backpressure.sql`)**: Created\n`public.sponsor_crm_backpressure_states` table logging pause statuses,\nretry delays, and throttled queue rates.\n- **Backpressure & Throttling Engine\n(`sponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressure.ts`)**: `parseRetryAfterHeader`\nextracts delay seconds from `Retry-After` or `X-RateLimit-Reset`\nheaders; `processCrmWebhookResponse` pauses SQS queue consumers on HTTP\n429 and throttles dispatch rates to 5 req/sec.\n- **Sponsor Webhook Dashboard UI\n(`SponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressureWidget.tsx`)**: Features real-time\nconsumer status bar, Retry-After countdown timer, throttled rate gauge,\n1-click HTTP 429 simulator, and webhook response audit log card.\n\n---\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [x] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Refactor\n- [x] UI/UX Enhancement\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Other\n\n---\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #5061\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed:\n\n- [x] Tested locally via `npx vitest run\nsrc/lib/sponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressure.test.ts\nsrc/components/sponsors/SponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressureWidget.test.tsx`\n(**6/6 passed**)\n- [x] Verified HTTP 429 `Retry-After: 60` header parsing\n- [x] Verified SQS queue consumer pause (60s) & rate throttling (10 -> 5\nreq/sec)\n- [x] Verified HTTP 200 normal rate restoration (10 req/sec)\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n---\n\n## Screenshots\n\n*N/A — Real-Time Sponsor Lead CRM Webhook Rate Limit Backpressure added\nto Sponsor Webhook Management view.*\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"d0338d86104f620896a4d174a1f384320681354d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/d0338d86104f620896a4d174a1f384320681354d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/c3effc426a7882e339caac55fea4ad58a0b73cb7","verification":{"payload":"tree d0338d86104f620896a4d174a1f384320681354d\nparent c4efa32ed192e6be135060096fda5ceea4b9d808\nauthor nayanraj864-cmyk <nayanraj864@gmail.com> 1788320730 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788320730 +0530\n\nfeat(sponsors): Build a ''Real-Time \"Sponsor Lead\" CRM Webhook Rate Limit Backpressure'' (#5061) (#5481)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nThis PR implements the ''Real-Time \"Sponsor Lead\" CRM Webhook Rate Limit\nBackpressure'' (`sponsor_crm_backpressure_states`,\n`sponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressure.ts`, and\n`SponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressureWidget`), protecting target sponsor CRM\nendpoints (e.g., Salesforce) from IP blacklisting or DDoS throttling\nwhen dead-letter SQS queues process large hackathon lead volumes by\nparsing HTTP 429 `Retry-After` headers, dynamically pausing queue\nconsumers, and resuming dispatches at throttled rates (5 req/sec).\n\n### Key Highlights:\n- **Database Schema\n(`20260873000000_sponsor_crm_rate_limit_backpressure.sql`)**: Created\n`public.sponsor_crm_backpressure_states` table logging pause statuses,\nretry delays, and throttled queue rates.\n- **Backpressure & Throttling Engine\n(`sponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressure.ts`)**: `parseRetryAfterHeader`\nextracts delay seconds from `Retry-After` or `X-RateLimit-Reset`\nheaders; `processCrmWebhookResponse` pauses SQS queue consumers on HTTP\n429 and throttles dispatch rates to 5 req/sec.\n- **Sponsor Webhook Dashboard UI\n(`SponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressureWidget.tsx`)**: Features real-time\nconsumer status bar, Retry-After countdown timer, throttled rate gauge,\n1-click HTTP 429 simulator, and webhook response audit log card.\n\n---\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [x] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Refactor\n- [x] UI/UX Enhancement\n- [x] Tests\n- [ ] Other\n\n---\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #5061\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed:\n\n- [x] Tested locally via `npx vitest run\nsrc/lib/sponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressure.test.ts\nsrc/components/sponsors/SponsorCrmRateLimitBackpressureWidget.test.tsx`\n(**6/6 passed**)\n- [x] Verified HTTP 429 `Retry-After: 60` header parsing\n- [x] Verified SQS queue consumer pause (60s) & rate throttling (10 -> 5\nreq/sec)\n- [x] Verified HTTP 200 normal rate r