kgDODrvv4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahkhushi0307/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahkhushi0307/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahkhushi0307/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahkhushi0307/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahkhushi0307/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahkhushi0307","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/e869f0ffc8ee7d50acfc6f31143c6f98c5f1a25e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:31:35Z","email":"khushishah0318@gmail.com","name":"Khushi Shah"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:31:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Real-Time Campus Safety Emergency Door Locking (Biometric Duress via Continuous Authentication) (#5478)\n\nCloses #5455\n\n## Summary\nImplements **Continuous Authentication** for the Escrow ledger. After\nlogin (which handles point-in-time duress via #5369), the app now\ncontinuously monitors the device''s **gyroscope, accelerometer, and\ntyping/kinematic cadence** to detect a post-login \"snatch-and-run\" or\nstruggle scenario. If a **critical anomaly** is detected, the session is\n**instantly locked**, and a covert **duress PIN** can silently alert\ncampus security.\n\n## What was added\n- **Sensor pipeline** (`src/lib/sensor/`)\n- `SensorCollector.ts` — DeviceMotion/DeviceOrientation capture +\nfeature extraction\n- `KinematicProfiler.ts` — baseline capture/persist (gait, holding\nangle, typing rhythm)\n- `AnomalyDetector.ts` — TF.js autoencoder (VAE) trained on the user''s\nbaseline; weights in IndexedDB\n- `DuressDetector.ts` — threat classification: normal / elevated /\ncritical\n- **Orchestration** (`src/hooks/useContinuousAuth.ts`)\n  - Calibration → live inference → automatic lock pipeline\n- **Lock & alerting** (`src/lib/safety/EmergencyLock.ts`,\n`src/lib/SessionManager.ts`)\n- Cross-tab emergency lock broadcast + duress-PIN verification/silent\nalert\n- **UI** (`src/components/Safety/`)\n- `LockScreen` (indistinguishable from a normal prompt, even under\nduress)\n- `CalibrationOverlay`, `SafetyStatusBadge` (navbar),\n`DuressSetupDialog` (settings)\n- **Store** (`src/store/createSafetySlice.ts` + `globalState.ts`)\n- safety lock / threat level / calibration signals (follows existing\nslice pattern)\n- **Backend**\n- Migration: `escrow_locks`, `kinematic_profiles`, `safety_alerts`,\nRPCs, RLS, `duress_pin_hash`\n  - Edge Function: `emergency-lock/index.ts` (server-side lock + audit)\n\n## Verification\n- 9 unit tests pass (`DuressDetector.test.ts`,\n`KinematicProfiler.test.ts`)\n- `tsc --noEmit` clean on all feature files (only pre-existing repo\nerrors remain on main)\n- ESLint clean on all feature files\n- `@tensorflow/tfjs@^4.22.0` added (only dependency change)\n\n## Note on `Layout.tsx`\norigin/main''s `Layout.tsx` contained stray merge-artifact text (e.g.\n`feature/2986-event-audio-player`, `main`) that broke the JSX build. I\nremoved only those garbage lines while wiring in the feature — no real\ncomponents were changed.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added continuous authentication using device motion and typing\nsignals.\n  * Added first-time calibration with progress tracking and guidance.\n* Added safety status indicators for normal, elevated, critical, and\nreduced protection.\n* Added automatic emergency locking when suspicious activity is\ndetected, including cross-tab protection.\n  * Added lock-screen reauthentication and optional duress PIN support.\n* Added Safety & Emergency settings for configuring or clearing a duress\nPIN.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Removed stray merge-conflict text from the application layout.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"f5d442c3738bf5b47f728865e39b8666ba1e4f06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/f5d442c3738bf5b47f728865e39b8666ba1e4f06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/e869f0ffc8ee7d50acfc6f31143c6f98c5f1a25e","verification":{"payload":"tree f5d442c3738bf5b47f728865e39b8666ba1e4f06\nparent 01349fc9a4ee0e0ed87a1452cd01a3f8be58bd4e\nauthor Khushi Shah <khushishah0318@gmail.com> 1788269495 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788269495 +0530\n\nfeat: Real-Time Campus Safety Emergency Door Locking (Biometric Duress via Continuous Authentication) (#5478)\n\nCloses #5455\n\n## Summary\nImplements **Continuous Authentication** for the Escrow ledger. After\nlogin (which handles point-in-time duress via #5369), the app now\ncontinuously monitors the device''s **gyroscope, accelerometer, and\ntyping/kinematic cadence** to detect a post-login \"snatch-and-run\" or\nstruggle scenario. If a **critical anomaly** is detected, the session is\n**instantly locked**, and a covert **duress PIN** can silently alert\ncampus security.\n\n## What was added\n- **Sensor pipeline** (`src/lib/sensor/`)\n- `SensorCollector.ts` — DeviceMotion/DeviceOrientation capture +\nfeature extraction\n- `KinematicProfiler.ts` — baseline capture/persist (gait, holding\nangle, typing rhythm)\n- `AnomalyDetector.ts` — TF.js autoencoder (VAE) trained on the user''s\nbaseline; weights in IndexedDB\n- `DuressDetector.ts` — threat classification: normal / elevated /\ncritical\n- **Orchestration** (`src/hooks/useContinuousAuth.ts`)\n  - Calibration → live inference → automatic lock pipeline\n- **Lock & alerting** (`src/lib/safety/EmergencyLock.ts`,\n`src/lib/SessionManager.ts`)\n- Cross-tab emergency lock broadcast + duress-PIN verification/silent\nalert\n- **UI** (`src/components/Safety/`)\n- `LockScreen` (indistinguishable from a normal prompt, even under\nduress)\n- `CalibrationOverlay`, `SafetyStatusBadge` (navbar),\n`DuressSetupDialog` (settings)\n- **Store** (`src/store/createSafetySlice.ts` + `globalState.ts`)\n- safety lock / threat level / calibration signals (follows existing\nslice pattern)\n- **Backend**\n- Migration: `escrow_locks`, `kinematic_profiles`, `safety_alerts`,\nRPCs, RLS, `duress_pin_hash`\n  - Edge Function: `emergency-lock/index.ts` (server-side lock + audit)\n\n## Verification\n- 9 unit tests pass (`DuressDetector.test.ts`,\n`KinematicProfiler.test.ts`)\n- `tsc --noEmit` clean on all feature files (only pre-existing repo\nerrors remain on main)\n- ESLint clean on all feature files\n- `@tensorflow/tfjs@^4.22.0` added (only dependency change)\n\n## Note on `Layout.tsx`\norigin/main''s `Layout.tsx` contained stray merge-artifact text (e.g.\n`feature/2986-event-audio-player`, `main`) that broke the JSX build. I\nremoved only those garbage lines while wiring in the feature — no real\ncomponents were changed.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added continuous authentication using device motion and typing\nsignals.\n  * Added first-time calibration with progress tracking and guidance.\n* Added safety status indicators for normal, elevated, critical, and\nreduced protection.\n* Added automatic emergency locking when suspicious activity is\ndetected, including cross-tab protection.\n  * Added lock-screen reauthentication and optional duress PIN support.\n* Added Safety & Emergency settings for configuring or clearing a duress\nPIN.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Removed stray merge-conflict text from the application layout.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqltO3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJxwQAD/s9qykZb34MNK3TWrm3lQU\nurKG0Gr7iGGzBl+qgdukrz+jX5yKtbDKi1c3WdRg4IHru5/xxMklGWXuLl1hrl4v\n8EdP/KjcIgbl9Ow/F6/ErUVb4jWmDkZWZ0ZbNnYdZnhAEG+dqqotPEX69VULt