lization.\nStandardized synthetic probability detection reporting (is_synthetic,\nconfidence, reason).\nController Integration: Verified \n\nbackend/controllers/audio_upload_controller.py\nintegration for incoming audio verification and automatic quarantine\nrouting on synthetic audio flag.\n\n\ncloses #5367","tree":{"sha":"322fcaad229162c037aaa95b48d42a0911a2aab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/322fcaad229162c037aaa95b48d42a0911a2aab9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/01349fc9a4ee0e0ed87a1452cd01a3f8be58bd4e","verification":{"payload":"tree 322fcaad229162c037aaa95b48d42a0911a2aab9\nparent c92b4427a662c94c1b46a4cfb362889c03405fea\nauthor Aditya Mahajan <mahajan2005aditya@gmail.com> 1788269447 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788269447 +0530\n\nfeat: Deepfake Audio Detection (#5477)\n\nI have implemented the Automated \"Missing Photo\" Deepfake Audio\nDetection service.\n\nSummary of Implementation\nService Enhancement: \n\nbackend/services/audio_deepfake_detector.py\nImplemented Short-Time Fourier Transform (STFT) spectral variance and\nroot-mean-square (RMS) energy thresholding for noise floor analysis.\nAdded robust audio loading fallback (scipy.io.wavfile) for downsampled\narray normalization.\nStandardized synthetic probability detection reporting (is_synthetic,\nconfidence, reason).\nController Integration: Verified \n\nbackend/controllers/audio_upload_controller.py\nintegration for incoming audio verification and automatic quarantine\nrouting on synthetic audio flag.\n\n\ncloses #5367","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqltOHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFrAQAALqZ3cVPkd/szY9er7jWLg6\nvTUFPs6r7GgVdCM+Q6Rz2mUs8JO1f/3N+dXKCdj99f3VNcD6pW2tqQxxTZTCi0aT\nTYI1RfTL+gHp6b8lcgMWu0yHalgdDjmdxniDZI3CMyKSjK09Z4/0+4xACU8p5+gD\nnq8L6zF9zQXTm580UKSD7/TFbQud2DtM56aI0MuORdBehLaBEh2YD/1JT4ki6nMp\nIeZ7pTZ8O2R3BZo0TV3Yxj3PQFbpA+LBXHerWS5HpBRtzB2RQ44Q33yGI9zm