dge_waf).\n\n\ncloses #5366\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added dynamically generated, cryptographically secure honeypot links\nfor hidden trap URLs.\n* Added active token tracking to support validation of generated\nhoneypot links.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n* Improved honeypot handling when client connection information is\nunavailable by using a safe local fallback address.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"d3331ca05f315941590ec4c2f0a5267f0639e074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/d3331ca05f315941590ec4c2f0a5267f0639e074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/c92b4427a662c94c1b46a4cfb362889c03405fea","verification":{"payload":"tree d3331ca05f315941590ec4c2f0a5267f0639e074\nparent d2d3d8b02bd71f824543834fb8889529ccc70377\nauthor Aditya Mahajan <mahajan2005aditya@gmail.com> 1788269261 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788269261 +0530\n\nfeat: Dynamic Early Bird (#5476)\n\nI have built the Dynamic \"Early Bird\" Secret URL Honeypot service.\n\nSummary of Changes\nUpdated Service: Enhanced \n\nbackend/services/waf_honeypot.py\n with:\nDynamic token generation helper generate_dynamic_early_bird_url() for\ngenerating obfuscated, per-session Early Bird secret URLs to trap\nscraper bots.\nSafe client IP extraction handling (request.client.host if\nrequest.client else \"127.0.0.1\") to prevent null-dereference errors.\nIntegration with ML telemetry vectorization and dynamic AWS WAF IP\nquarantine (quarantine_ip_at_edge_waf).\n\n\ncloses #5366\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added dynamically generated, cryptographically secure honeypot links\nfor hidden trap URLs.\n* Added active token tracking to support validation of generated\nhoneypot 