s\n- **Rejection Reasons**: Detailed rejection reasons\n- **Manual Review**: Flag for manual review when needed\n- **Simulation**: Simulate consensus scenarios\n- **Statistics**: Track approval/rejection rates\n\n#### 6. Escrow Smart Contract Integration (500+ lines)\n- **Contract Creation**: Create and activate escrow contracts\n- **Fund Release**: Release funds when all oracles approve\n- **Fund Slashing**: Slash funds when any oracle rejects\n- **Transaction Tracking**: Track all transactions\n- **Slash Events**: Record all slash events\n- **Statistics**: Contract statistics\n\n#### 7. API Endpoints (400+ lines)\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|----------|--------|-------------|\n| `/api/escrow/contract` | POST | Create escrow contract |\n| `/api/escrow/contract/{id}/activate` | POST | Activate contract |\n| `/api/escrow/contract/{id}/evaluate` | POST | Evaluate with oracles |\n| `/api/escrow/contract/{id}` | GET | Get contract details |\n| `/api/escrow/contracts/vendor/{id}` | GET | Get vendor contracts |\n| `/api/escrow/contracts/client/{id}` | GET | Get client contracts |\n| `/api/escrow/consensus/simulate` | POST | Simulate consensus |\n| `/api/escrow/statistics` | GET | Get statistics |\n\n\nfixes #5643\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added escrow contract management, including creation, activation,\nevaluation, lookup, and statistics.\n* Added automated validation of delivery temperature, timing, and\nproduct integrity from images.\n  * Added consensus-based fund release when all validation checks pass.\n* Added protection against failed conditions through escrow slashing and\nrecorded evidence.\n  * Added consensus simulation and reporting capabilities.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n\nfixes #5463","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqll4wCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHscQAGvHKgL