manpreetkaur18/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/270ac1aae28c0144ec71f340bd780c29a9892674/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:02:01Z","email":"jasmeetkaurchwl@gmail.com","name":"Sukhmanpreet Kaur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:02:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Implement Automated Club Leadership Mandatory Phishing Simulati… (#5473)\n\n### 📝 Description\nThis PR implements hardware-based authentication using FIDO2/WebAuthn\nand Hardware Security Modules (HSMs) for all high-value escrow\ntransactions. JWTs are deprecated for financial operations, replaced\nwith cryptographic challenge-response requiring physical hardware tokens\n(YubiKey, FaceID, etc.).\n\n### 🚀 Features Added\n\n#### 1. FIDO2/WebAuthn Manager (500+ lines)\n- **Device Registration**: Register YubiKey, SoloKey, NitroKey, etc.\n- **Authentication**: Cryptographic challenge-response\n- **Credential Management**: Store and manage public keys\n- **Counter Management**: Track device usage\n- **Revocation**: Revoke compromised devices\n\n#### 2. HSM Integration (400+ lines)\n- **Key Generation**: Generate keys in HSM\n- **Signing**: Cryptographic signing\n- **Verification**: Signature verification\n- **Encryption/Decryption**: HSM-based encryption\n- **HMAC**: HMAC generation and verification\n- **Session Tokens**: HSM-signed session tokens\n\n#### 3. Challenge Handler (300+ lines)\n- **Challenge Generation**: Cryptographic challenges\n- **Challenge Verification**: Verify signatures\n- **Expiration Management**: Challenge timeout\n- **Session Token Generation**: Post-verification tokens\n\n#### 4. HSM Auth Middleware (300+ lines)\n- **Path Filtering**: Protect specific endpoints\n- **Header Validation**: Validate hardware auth headers\n- **JWT Integration**: Combine with JWT validation\n- **Request State**: Add verification state\n\n#### 5. Authentication Service (500+ lines)\n- **Device Management**: Register, list, revoke\n- **Escrow Auth**: Create and verify escrow auth\n- **JWT + Hardware**: Validate JWT with hardware\n- **Audit Logging**: Track all auth events\n- **Statistics**: Auth statistics\n\n#### 6. API Endpoints (400+ lines)\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|----------|--------|-------------|\n| `/api/auth/device/register` | POST | Register hardware |\n| `/api/auth/device/verify` | POST | Verify registration |\n| `/api/auth/escrow/challenge` | POST | Create challenge |\n| `/api/auth/escrow/verify` | POST | Verify challenge |\n| `/api/auth/device/list` | GET | List devices |\n| `/api/auth/device/{id}` | DELETE | Revoke device |\n| `/api/auth/statistics` | GET | Get stats |\n| `/api/auth/challenge/status/{id}` | GET | Get status |\n| `/api/auth/hsm/status` | GET | Get HSM status |\n\nfixes #5462","tree":{"sha":"0cab4decf1c9e1442c51025b138f5cae66ef830f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/0cab4decf1c9e1442c51025b138f5cae66ef830f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/270ac1aae28c0144ec71f340bd780c29a9892674","verification":{"payload":"tree 0cab4decf1c9e1442c51025b138f5cae66ef830f\nparent 027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc\nauthor Sukhmanpreet Kaur <jasmeetkaurchwl@gmail.com> 1788238921 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788238921 +0530\n\nfeat: Implement Automated Club Leadership Mandatory Phishing Simulati… (#5473)\n\n### 📝 Description\nThis PR implements hardware-based authentication using FIDO2/WebAuthn\nand Hardware Security Modules (HSMs) for all high-value escrow\ntransactions. JWTs are deprecated for financial operations, replaced\nwith cryptographic challenge-response requiring physical hardware tokens\n(YubiKey, FaceID, etc.).\n\n### 🚀 Features Added\n\n#### 1. FIDO2/WebAuthn Manager (500+ lines)\n- **Device Registration**: Register YubiKey, SoloKey, NitroKey, etc.\n- **Authentication**: Cryptographic challenge-response\n- **Credential Management**: Store and manage public keys\n- **Counter Management**: Track device usage\n- **Revocation**: Revoke compromised devices\n\n#### 2. HSM Integration (400+ lines)\n- **Key Generation**: Generate keys in HSM\n- **Signing**: Cryptographic signing\n- **Verification**: Signature verification\n- **Encryption/Decryption**: HSM-based encryption\n- **HMAC**: HMAC generation and verification\n- **Session Tokens**: HSM-signed session tokens\n\n#### 3. Challenge Handler (300+ lines)\n- **Challenge Generation**: Cryptographic challenges\n- **Challenge Verification**: Verify signatures\n- **Expiration Management**: Challenge timeout\n- **Session Token Generation**: Post-verification tokens\n\n#### 4. HSM Auth Middleware (300+ lines)\n- **Path Filtering**: Protect specific endpoints\n- **Header Validation**: Validate hardware auth headers\n- **JWT Integration**: Combine with JWT validation\n- **Request State**: Add verification state\n\n#### 5. Authentication Service (500+ lines)\n- **Device Management**: Register, list, revoke\n- **Escrow Auth**: Create and verify escrow auth\n- **JWT + Hardware**: Validate JWT with hardware\n- **Audit Logging**: Track all auth events\n- **Statistics**: Auth statistics\n\n#### 6. API Endpoints (400+ lines)\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|----------|--------|-------------|\n| `/api/auth/device/register` | POST | Register hardware |\n| `/api/auth/device/verify` | POST | Verify registration |\n| `/api/auth/escrow/challenge` | POST | Create challenge |\n| `/api/auth/escrow/verify` | POST | Verify challenge |\n| `/api/auth/device/list` | GET | List devices |\n| `/api/auth/device/{id}` | DELETE | Revoke device |\n| `/api/auth/statistics` | GET | Get stats |\n| `/api/auth/challenge/status/{id}` | GET | Get status |\n| `/api/auth/hsm/status` | GET | Get HSM status |\n\nfixes #5462","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqllxJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/fwQACeSxI8EQvu+w0laEl+Wci/X\nCmLiof6rofWV2aUpG0ygqRR7lsHMMQoEPZr37RFRqTe1DGidME/gMEsEZHW0XXjh\n0x06B3+7ZiMp9zqLpfTMN4e4pWzDWP0k1QsDqEugfmJ1PSUGiPOJTZrDgIonM0hw\npg0P7zt+Fa0LGoq1XAri58i4mZ8+iUTrUUbwkGtuglzYjIBTuLxwN4slKD3bH1M5\nzwRXo1/wa8Jj7uzQcaKtlXAFhNzxIdLLql2Jskn76acSQKudJ0LQ6k5TRjnV8J2f\nG+kHdHzzKl4SKj6edxXuiIrspvkxCrVkCUnm9+67j2385Aq3qAnfCU34JMg+SQvv\njCHSNv2UW7/E6Is6Y5TaqnbJsUCKM182u/PDq9EbGbeZk63u3B8YkqqfFsP6cXmE\nH7+k33a/cQ5sNFTiIQRU+IjWRmYptGoJ1yFoLnziXlzX4+EExj6RpVjmF5+FYn8n\npPlCq6tQUMFZHSIQPrjiX6HX7ZaCa6EPodgaioIlxNTr0GcZyIIivoqQD0rDgDZt\nVjb4sd3eRECO/SLLSYelrgGRoEb5OtCYshBTERL/z+ZrnjrCixoOSfBKH678tdz9\nh738r+SCpTjI/r5z6Ru0wTn7hwVfTAvSFYME3yF2K+iRT92Ioz86eiZO8q4k4swr\nMwYC4X/qvGjv2DacCEfk\n=BhCW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T05:02:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/270ac1aae28c0144ec71f340bd780c29a9892674","node_id":"C_kwDOTPF5RdoAKDI3MGFjMWFhZTI4YzAxNDRlYzcxZjM0MGJkNzgwYzI5YTk4OTI2NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc","sha":"027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc"}],"sha":"270ac1aae28c0144ec71f340bd780c29a9892674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/270ac1aae28c0144ec71f340bd780c29a9892674"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220594134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annukumar123","id":220594134,"login":"annukumar123","node_id":"U_kgDODSX_1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:01:58Z","email":"annu83175@gmail.com","name":"Annu Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:01:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(payments): implement automated tax exempt sales tax exemption certificate auto filer (#4823) (#5474)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4823 by implementing an Automated Tax-Exempt Sales Tax Exemption\nCertificate Auto-Filer. When an organizer accepts a vendor contract, it\nautomatically appends the University''s digitized ST-5 $501(\\text{c})(3)$\nTax Exemption certificate to the contract payload and requires vendor\nlegal acknowledgement. If a vendor invoice attempts to include\n`tax_amount > 0`, the engine intercepts and blocks the payment.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260901000000_create_tax_exempt_certificate_filer.sql`\nextending `vendor_contracts` and establishing\n`acknowledge_tax_exemption` RPC.\n* **Tax Exemption Module**: Created `src/lib/taxExemptionAutoFiler.ts`\nproviding `injectTaxExemptionCertificate` and\n`validateVendorInvoiceTaxCompliance`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/taxExemptionAutoFiler.test.ts` testing ST-5 certificate payload\ninjection, tax violation rejection ($80 tax block), and zero-tax\ncompliant approvals.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4823\n* /Resolves #4823\n* /Fixes #4823\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/taxExemptionAutoFiler.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `injects ST-5 certificate and acknowledgement clause into contract\npayload` (Passed)\n* ✅ `blocks payment and throws compliant error when invoice includes\ntax_amount > 0` (Passed)\n* ✅ `approves payment when invoice has zero sales tax` (Passed)","tree":{"sha":"0da3165b37294a49907222c06b5da5ad962f829a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/0da3165b37294a49907222c06b5da5ad962f829a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 0da3165b37294a49907222c06b5da5ad962f829a\nparent 702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3\nauthor Annu Kumar <annu83175@gmail.com> 1788238918 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788238918 +0530\n\nfeat(payments): implement automated tax exempt sales tax exemption certificate auto filer (#4823) (#5474)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4823 by implementing an Automated Tax-Exempt Sales Tax Exemption\nCertificate Auto-Filer. When an organizer accepts a vendor contract, it\nautomatically appends the University''s digitized ST-5 $501(\\text{c})(3)$\nTax Exemption certificate to the contract payload and requires vendor\nlegal acknowledgement. If a vendor invoice attempts to include\n`tax_amount > 0`, the engine intercepts and blocks the payment.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260901000000_create_tax_exempt_certificate_filer.sql`\nextending `vendor_contracts` and establishing\n`acknowledge_tax_exemption` RPC.\n* **Tax Exemption Module**: Created `src/lib/taxExemptionAutoFiler.ts`\nproviding `injectTaxExemptionCertificate` and\n`validateVendorInvoiceTaxCompliance`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/taxExemptionAutoFiler.test.ts` testing ST-5 certificate payload\ninjection, tax violation rejection ($80 tax block), and zero-tax\ncompliant approvals.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4823\n* /Resolves #4823\n* /Fixes #4823\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/taxExemptionAutoFiler.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `injects ST-5 certificate and acknowledgement clause into contract\npayload` (Passed)\n* ✅ `blocks payment and throws compliant error when invoice includes\ntax_amount > 0` (Passed)\n* ✅ `approves payment when invoice has zero sales tax` (Passed)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqllxGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnRMQAGVunLi62pj8xEOeD8VljOJ4\nDrFluDlJ9RGHePSVkcyBNxf1KB