,"sha":"702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3"}],"sha":"027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/027775b4f6bc3db87723660aae7d203e72cb51fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202644253?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sukhmanpreetkaur18","id":202644253,"login":"Sukhmanpreetkaur18","node_id":"U_kgDODBQbHQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sukhmanpreetkaur18","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:54:13Z","email":"jasmeetkaurchwl@gmail.com","name":"Sukhmanpreet Kaur"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:54:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Implement Dynamic Mental Health Thermal Overcrowding Detection … (#5471)\n\n### 📝 Description\nThis PR implements a privacy-preserving overcrowding detection system\nusing acoustic density triangulation with Fully Homomorphic Encryption\n(FHE). Edge ML processes audio data locally, encrypts density scores\nbefore transmission, and the backend performs mathematical operations on\nencrypted data without ever decrypting individual readings.\n\n### 🚀 Features Added\n\n#### 1. FHE Engine (500+ lines)\n- **Encryption**: Encrypt integer values using FHE\n- **Decryption**: Decrypt ciphertexts (admin only)\n- **Homomorphic Addition**: Add encrypted values without decryption\n- **Homomorphic Multiplication**: Multiply encrypted values by scalars\n- **Homomorphic Average**: Calculate averages on encrypted data\n- **Batch Operations**: Encrypt/decrypt multiple values\n- **Operation Cache**: Cache results for performance\n\n#### 2. FHE Key Management (300+ lines)\n- **Key Generation**: Generate public/private key pairs\n- **Key Rotation**: Automatic key rotation\n- **Key Revocation**: Revoke compromised keys\n- **Key Storage**: Secure key storage with encryption\n- **Key Cleanup**: Remove expired keys\n- **Active Key Management**: Track active key\n\n#### 3. Density Models (300+ lines)\n- **DensityReading**: Raw density reading from IoT\n- **EncryptedDensityReading**: Encrypted reading\n- **AggregatedDensity**: Aggregated density data\n- **DensityLevel**: Empty, Low, Medium, High, Critical\n- **PrivacyLevel**: Raw, Aggregated, Encrypted, Homomorphic\n- **DensityAlert**: Overcrowding alerts\n\n#### 4. Density Service (500+ lines)\n- **Reading Processing**: Process IoT density readings\n- **Encrypted Readings**: Handle encrypted readings\n- **Building Aggregation**: Aggregate by building\n- **Homomorphic Aggregation**: FHE-based aggregation\n- **Alert Management**: Generate and track alerts\n- **Statistics**: Service statistics\n\n#### 5. IoT Microphone Processor (300+ lines)\n- **Audio Processing**: Process raw audio data\n- **Density Detection**: Detect density from audio\n- **Position Triangulation**: Triangulate device position\n- **Encryption**: Encrypt density scores\n- **Overcrowding Detection**: Detect overcrowding\n- **Device Status**: Track device health\n\n#### 6. API Endpoints (400+ lines)\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|----------|--------|-------------|\n| `/api/density/reading` | POST | Submit density reading |\n| `/api/density/reading/encrypted` | POST | Submit encrypted reading |\n| `/api/density/building/{building}` | GET | Get building density |\n| `/api/density/alerts` | GET | Get density alerts |\n| `/api/density/alerts/{id}/acknowledge` | POST | Acknowledge alert |\n| `/api/density/statistics` | GET | Get statistics |\n| `/api/density/decrypt` | POST | Decrypt data (admin) |\n| `/api/density/fhe/keys` | GET | Get FHE key info |\n\nfixes #5464","tree":{"sha":"28f5a7e4948c4e0bcc8420e24460312207e8270a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/28f5a7e4948c4e0bcc8420e24460312207e8270a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3","verification":{"payload":"tree 28f5a7e4948c4e0bcc8420e24460312207e8270a\nparent c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499\nauthor Sukhmanpreet Kaur <jasmeetkaurchwl@gmail.com> 1788238453 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788238453 +0530\n\nfeat: Implement Dynamic Mental Health Thermal Overcrowding Detection … (#5471)\n\n### 📝 Description\nThis PR implements a privacy-preserving overcrowding detection system\nusing acoustic density triangulation with Fully Homomorphic Encryption\n(FHE). Edge ML processes audio data locally, encrypts density scores\nbefore transmission, and the backend performs mathematical operations on\nencrypted data without ever decrypting individual readings.\n\n### 🚀 Features Added\n\n#### 1. FHE Engine (500+ lines)\n- **Encryption**: Encrypt integer values using FHE\n- **Decryption**: Decrypt ciphertexts (admin only)\n- **Homomorphic Addition**: Add encrypted values without decryption\n- **Homomorphic Multiplication**: Multiply encrypted values by scalars\n- **Homomorphic Average**: Calculate averages on encrypted data\n- **Batch Operations**: Encrypt/decrypt multiple values\n- **Operation Cache**: Cache results for performance\n\n#### 2. FHE Key Management (300+ lines)\n- **Key Generation**: Generate public/private key pairs\n- **Key Rotation**: Automatic key rotation\n- **Key Revocation**: Revoke compromised keys\n- **Key Storage**: Secure key storage with encryption\n- **Key Cleanup**: Remove expired keys\n- **Active Key Management**: Track active key\n\n#### 3. Density Models (300+ lines)\n- **DensityReading**: Raw density reading from IoT\n- **EncryptedDensityReading**: Encrypted reading\n- **AggregatedDensity**: Aggregated density data\n- **DensityLevel**: Empty, Low, Medium, High, Critical\n- **PrivacyLevel**: Raw, Aggregated, Encrypted, Homomorphic\n- **DensityAlert**: Overcrowding alerts\n\n#### 4. Density Service (500+ lines)\n- **Reading Processing**: Process IoT density readings\n- **Encrypted Readings**: Handle encrypted readings\n- **Building Aggregation**: Aggregate by building\n- **Homomorphic Aggregation**: FHE-based aggregation\n- **Alert Management**: Generate and track alerts\n- **Statistics**: Service statistics\n\n#### 5. IoT Microphone Processor (300+ lines)\n- **Audio Processing**: Process raw audio data\n- **Density Detection**: Detect density from audio\n- **Position Triangulation**: Triangulate device position\n- **Encryption**: Encrypt density scores\n- **Overcrowding Detection**: Detect overcrowding\n- **Device Status**: Track device health\n\n#### 6. API Endpoints (400+ lines)\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|----------|--------|-------------|\n| `/api/density/reading` | POST | Submit density reading |\n| `/api/density/reading/encrypted` | POST | Submit encrypted reading |\n| `/api/density/building/{building}` | GET | Get building density |\n| `/api/density/alerts` | GET | Get density alerts |\n| `/api/density/alerts/{id}/acknowledge` | POST | Acknowledge alert |\n| `/api/density/statistics` | GET | Get statistics |\n| `/api/density/decrypt` | POST | Decrypt data (admin) |\n| `/api/density/fhe/keys` | GET | Get FHE key info |\n\nfixes #5464","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqllp1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr6QQAHRja3y6FJd3EmX3fOLQFfk9\nyDjGpyBH9v9+yS+XhmA3TInnlUAX6jfV3GY7GV9tEb+XgNkEPoIVgUsIBQ6rS3Sm\ntaLv19JbhWutrX9tCxHSV7+nqWIU6m4g+8DrxrngBJUiF7Lfg2NDBzxc1gSObL/k\n4X7ykTKKtvyJtJ5J8zOXZ1LJ64avh21G+fTfMUnok4NY3BL8BHbMwFeZBaBzHn+E\nWQT0G6RWGgzu5LwhqkdL/ZkvyppQtGT26QUBiPGPyRmHIANCDiIh/mPLenOD4Qm+\n5NZiFmYejx1GLwN2Pp2tDb4JJVWpaSZymRXd2yRHgTe7oK2iaXfqz0Vlv3hELQEh\n2mSpcMJo+JOxNahfqvsINPULdLBvXm9Afj21JX5mg1mpltHIMLHUytKJuXhlkE35\n7sIkmgBhKdijFu3KWG4xq8Tuu9iuOGqRU5R8tvCc480ENzBn31Fxw241EN7scLvE\ngfChzXkdA8+drMIjn0VTXFdEk+pOHRZGDfppmNSjrJheH1/q2RX07ubOxNN7lR80\nuijy2LJV2aE8MdZzw9lPmVCsBkLs9HSuBlbPesKhjmNuFG8HkZHRc/1MSVeYTB0o\nZptCMCZrveycyN+kG/vIgthkuB6tJzl468RWxsMzHu+eVuHti251/5ANbXyDInHd\nlIcVml28+He6qaGJATER\n=TdWg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T04:54:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3","node_id":"C_kwDOTPF5RdoAKDcwMmIzOTI1NjZlZWY2MTc5NDFiMzNhNDI1NTJiNjFlNzcxMTdkYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499","sha":"c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499"}],"sha":"702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/702b392566eef617941b33a42552b61e77117da3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220594134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annukumar123","id":220594134,"login":"annukumar123","node_id":"U_kgDODSX_1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:54:10Z","email":"annu83175@gmail.com","name":"Annu Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:54:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(payments): build interactive vendor bidding escrow milestone payouts (#4821) (#5472)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4821 by implementing an Interactive \"Vendor Bidding\" Escrow\nMilestone Payout system for multi-day, high-capital contracts. Allows\nvendors and organizers to agree on percentage milestones (e.g.\n30%/30%/40%). Once deliverable photo evidence is countersigned, releases\nfractional Stripe Connect transfers (e.g. exactly 30% of locked funds)\nwhile keeping the remaining balance locked and rendering a real-time\nFinancial Progress Bar.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260899000000_create_escrow_milestone_payouts.sql`\nestablishing `vendor_contract_milestones` and\n`release_escrow_milestone_payout` RPC.\n* **Escrow Milestone Module**: Created\n`src/lib/escrowMilestonePayouts.ts` providing\n`validateMilestonesDefinition`, `generateContractMilestones`,\n`calculateFinancialProgressBar`, and `executeMilestoneRelease`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/escrowMilestonePayouts.test.ts` testing 100% total validation,\nproportional dollar distribution, Stripe transfer payload creation, and\nunverified evidence blocking.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4821\n* /Resolves #4821\n* /Fixes #4821\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/escrowMilestonePayouts.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `validates milestone percentages summing to 100%` (Passed)\n* ✅ `generates milestone records with proportional monetary payout\namounts` (Passed)\n* ✅ `releases partial milestone 1 (30%) via Stripe Connect transfer\nwhile leaving 70% locked` (Passed)\n* ✅ `blocks release if photo evidence has not been verified` (Passed)","tree":{"sha":"126ea44eff502df0187d30122587bbf87df7f489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/126ea44eff502df0187d30122587bbf87df7f489"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499","verification":{"payload":"tree 126ea44eff502df0187d30122587bbf87df7f489\nparent 3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350\nauthor Annu Kumar <annu83175@gmail.com> 1788238450 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788238450 +0530\n\nfeat(payments): build interactive vendor bidding escrow milestone payouts (#4821) (#5472)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4821 by implementing an Interactive \"Vendor Bidding\" Escrow\nMilestone Payout system for multi-day, high-capital contracts. Allows\nvendors and organizers to agree on percentage milestones (e.g.\n30%/30%/40%). Once deliverable photo evidence is countersigned, releases\nfractional Stripe Connect transfers (e.g. exactly 30% of locked funds)\nwhile keeping the remaining balance locked and rendering a real-time\nFinancial Progress Bar.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260899000000_create_escrow_milestone_payouts.sql`\nestablishing `vendor_contract_milestones` and\n`release_escrow_milestone_payout` RPC.\n* **Escrow Milestone Module**: Created\n`src/lib/escrowMilestonePayouts.ts` providing\n`validateMilestonesDefinition`, `generateContractMilestones`,\n`calculateFinancialProgressBar`, and `executeMilestoneRelease`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/escrowMilestonePayouts.test.ts` testing 100% total validation,\nproportional dollar distribution, Stripe transfer payload creation, and\nunverified evidence blocking.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4821\n* /Resolves #4821\n* /Fixes #4821\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/escrowMilestonePayouts.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `validates milestone percentages summing to 100%` (Passed)\n* ✅ `generates milestone records with proportional monetary payout\namounts` (Passed)\n* ✅ `releases partial milestone 1 (30%) via Stripe Connect transfer\nwhile leaving 70% locked` (Passed)\n* ✅ `blocks release if photo evidence has not been verified` (Passed)","reason":"val