ZGRmMTc0NWVjMzQ5ZGY0OTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350","sha":"3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350"}],"sha":"c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c44a717efb58961402393e3ddf1745ec349df499"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220594134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annukumar123","id":220594134,"login":"annukumar123","node_id":"U_kgDODSX_1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:42:12Z","email":"annu83175@gmail.com","name":"Annu Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:42:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(payments): build real time dynamic pricing flash crowd surge logic (#4818) (#5469)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4818 by implementing a Real-Time Dynamic Pricing Flash Crowd\nSurge engine. Monitors the real-time velocity ratio of active checkout\nviewers to remaining ticket inventory. When demand ratio breaches $\\ge\n5.0$, it automatically activates \"Surge Mode\", dynamically scales base\nticket prices by $1.5\\times$ to $2.0\\times$, displays an interactive UI\nbanner warning, and reverts prices when demand subsides.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260898000000_create_flash_crowd_surge_pricing.sql`\nextending `events` and creating `evaluate_event_surge_pricing` RPC.\n* **Flash Crowd Surge Module**: Created\n`src/lib/flashCrowdSurgePricing.ts` providing `calculateSurgeMultiplier`\nand `evaluateEventSurgePricing`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/flashCrowdSurgePricing.test.ts` testing baseline pricing\npreservation, 1.5x threshold triggering, 2.0x viral surge escalation,\nand automatic reversion.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4818\n* /Resolves #4818\n* /Fixes #4818\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/flashCrowdSurgePricing.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `maintains base price when viewer to ticket inventory ratio is below\n5.0` (Passed)\n* ✅ `triggers 1.5x surge pricing when demand ratio reaches 5.0\nthreshold` (Passed)\n* ✅ `escalates to 2.0x surge pricing multiplier during viral traffic\nspikes` (Passed)\n* ✅ `automatically reverts price when active viewers drop back to\nnormal` (Passed)","tree":{"sha":"9809d60afb6ceb1ff75017d8e4842dd91a2eb15d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/9809d60afb6ceb1ff75017d8e4842dd91a2eb15d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350","verification":{"payload":"tree 9809d60afb6ceb1ff75017d8e4842dd91a2eb15d\nparent 854773e80821e5ddf9deb314866f3110959e82d8\nauthor Annu Kumar <annu83175@gmail.com> 1788237732 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788237732 +0530\n\nfeat(payments): build real time dynamic pricing flash crowd surge logic (#4818) (#5469)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4818 by implementing a Real-Time Dynamic Pricing Flash Crowd\nSurge engine. Monitors the real-time velocity ratio of active checkout\nviewers to remaining ticket inventory. When demand ratio breaches $\\ge\n5.0$, it automatically activates \"Surge Mode\", dynamically scales base\nticket prices by $1.5\\times$ to $2.0\\times$, displays an interactive UI\nbanner warning, and reverts prices when demand subsides.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260898000000_create_flash_crowd_surge_pricing.sql`\nextending `events` and creating `evaluate_event_surge_pricing` RPC.\n* **Flash Crowd Surge Module**: Created\n`src/lib/flashCrowdSurgePricing.ts` providing `calculateSurgeMultiplier`\nand `evaluateEventSurgePricing`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/flashCrowdSurgePricing.test.ts` testing baseline pricing\npreservation, 1.5x threshold triggering, 2.0x viral surge escalation,\nand automatic reversion.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4818\n* /Resolves #4818\n* /Fixes #4818\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/flashCrowdSurgePricing.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `maintains base price when viewer to ticket inventory ratio is below\n5.0` (Passed)\n* ✅ `triggers 1.5x surge pricing when demand ratio reaches 5.0\nthreshold` (Passed)\n* ✅ `escalates to 2.0x surge pricing multiplier during viral traffic\nspikes` (Passed)\n* ✅ `automatically reverts price when active viewers drop back to\nnormal` (Passed)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqllekCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuWoQAH6jIRERs8+cKF7b5rUtJhUl\neYTByUjGTGUq18yyiLgj9u9K+FxFMcy5E1+APSZ+y5ZaqRj4WN7TJRitgu6lIoJT\nzPyY6/AbgLN8vRbh8U2mYC925FOHvvkdlweI1C87vw9uKYq3F5pEEzkr+FVUlwBM\nQd5vDYkgOezO795HkrOyuwFOlArZcLdH4UohEHI084WzqABlm7NS1rpQfUGENTrB\noxuBQZ52P7ezXoEy7tkP2UA