ec79c4bd7baa1350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/3670a19f3c26e8328e50f0fdec79c4bd7baa1350"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220594134?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/annukumar123","id":220594134,"login":"annukumar123","node_id":"U_kgDODSX_1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/annukumar123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/854773e80821e5ddf9deb314866f3110959e82d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:41:44Z","email":"annu83175@gmail.com","name":"Annu Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:41:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ai): implement automated event feedback biometric emotion tracking (#4817) (#5468)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4817 by implementing an Automated \"Event Feedback\" Biometric\nEmotion Tracking system for WebRTC keynote broadcasts. Focus group\nattendees process video locally via WebAssembly Edge AI to detect\nmicro-expressions (`joy`, `surprise`, `boredom`), transmitting only\nanonymized, aggregate sentiment scores every 5 seconds. Compiles peak\nemotion timestamps to generate video overlay timeline graphs for\norganizers.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260897000000_create_biometric_emotion_tracking.sql`\nestablishing `event_focus_group_participants`,\n`stream_biometric_emotion_snapshots`, and\n`ingest_aggregated_biometric_emotions` RPC.\n* **Biometric Emotion Module**: Created\n`src/lib/biometricEmotionTracking.ts` providing\n`formatSecondsToTimestamp`, `aggregateEmotionBatch`, and\n`computeEmotionTimelineSummary`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/biometricEmotionTracking.test.ts` testing MM:SS timestamp\nformatting, privacy-preserving batch aggregation, and peak joy/boredom\ntimeline summary calculations.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4817\n* /Resolves #4817\n*/Fixes #4817\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/biometricEmotionTracking.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `formats seconds into MM:SS video timeline timestamps` (Passed)\n* ✅ `aggregates privacy-preserving client emotion readings and\ndetermines dominant emotion` (Passed)\n* ✅ `computes peak joy and boredom timestamps with accurate organizer\nsummary` (Passed)","tree":{"sha":"d36560f624875306b2d96c12f165d59c26f690f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/d36560f624875306b2d96c12f165d59c26f690f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/854773e80821e5ddf9deb314866f3110959e82d8","verification":{"payload":"tree d36560f624875306b2d96c12f165d59c26f690f2\nparent 5f60cb50cce0c716ceb5f334338836554015942f\nauthor Annu Kumar <annu83175@gmail.com> 1788237704 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788237704 +0530\n\nfeat(ai): implement automated event feedback biometric emotion tracking (#4817) (#5468)\n\n### **Overview & Summary**\nCloses #4817 by implementing an Automated \"Event Feedback\" Biometric\nEmotion Tracking system for WebRTC keynote broadcasts. Focus group\nattendees process video locally via WebAssembly Edge AI to detect\nmicro-expressions (`joy`, `surprise`, `boredom`), transmitting only\nanonymized, aggregate sentiment scores every 5 seconds. Compiles peak\nemotion timestamps to generate video overlay timeline graphs for\norganizers.\n\n---\n\n### **Key Changes**\n* **Database Schema Migration & Stored Procedure**: Created\n`supabase/migrations/20260897000000_create_biometric_emotion_tracking.sql`\nestablishing `event_focus_group_participants`,\n`stream_biometric_emotion_snapshots`, and\n`ingest_aggregated_biometric_emotions` RPC.\n* **Biometric Emotion Module**: Created\n`src/lib/biometricEmotionTracking.ts` providing\n`formatSecondsToTimestamp`, `aggregateEmotionBatch`, and\n`computeEmotionTimelineSummary`.\n* **Automated Unit Tests**: Created\n`src/lib/biometricEmotionTracking.test.ts` testing MM:SS timestamp\nformatting, privacy-preserving batch aggregation, and peak joy/boredom\ntimeline summary calculations.\n\n---\n\n### **Linked Issues**\n* /Closes #4817\n* /Resolves #4817\n*/Fixes #4817\n\n---\n\n### **Testing & Verification**\nRan `npx vitest run src/lib/biometricEmotionTracking.test.ts`:\n* ✅ `formats seconds into MM:SS video timeline timestamps` (Passed)\n* ✅ `aggregates privacy-preserving client emotion readings and\ndetermines dominant emotion` (Passed)\n* ✅ `computes peak joy and boredom timestamps with accurate organizer\nsummary` (Passed)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlleICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOQUQAA9x710R0Yn1o/yD+KrVs2J/\nxOV5XTYXSmxC7EUpkanUdaKVbGly9liEYzO7tBN93u6nPxYu5dmJK1gwgPlaGJov\nFsJbU0zFI/+YHSdwn/FWJiTl9NfsgXv+Qwizq9VZVQencjR1kzBNTLpi6yrgn493\nVfIQNV4clrzqTTf+KxalgYrPkoosumGmiuoVZRgnZjpDVoPIX4JnAXfddT1nGq36\nnGiH5tOBEBPt3Idhm/V6BiqOM1AI7jmIp5g8flLAYmyC8F3Wqu1ZCtGHGWpgtEJu\n3B/B6i2KE3p5lVCN2Bbbokg6wJKOPzrbhawa3DCdkdNcqlcY5W7rCiZFoqKazxfS\nbwc4GEcSQWJMkGGSTStIKY06PQvXvHoBtyG1AMtTWEuz0zDMiX6knkT1d4Q7Jv8J\ndjteuMWnSbMHVNSSIM39AFAr8uWohHkEjPQzxIIh3/9VN+VGuJhTBBjHM+E36HpW\nPSIeIcj0O/GSpKs8aYz/Q4680AgyzKZ2MiN4Px