ithub.com/users/sushmitakoti661-prog/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushmitakoti661-prog/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushmitakoti661-prog/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushmitakoti661-prog","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/58be1024aeef47c4bf14f4d1784e5f4cd4703192/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:31:05Z","email":"sushmitakoti661@gmail.com","name":"Sushmita K"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:31:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(vending): implement interactive dietary restriction smart vendin… (#5432)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nImplements an automated, globally synchronized food safety recall and\nhardware lockout pipeline for campus smart vending machines (Issue\n#5357).\n\nWhen the FDA/USDA issues a recall, the system ingests the enforcement\ndata, registers the recall on-chain via the Polygon supply chain ledger,\nresolves affected inventory lots to physical machine coils, and\ndispatches real-time MQTT lockout payloads. The interactive Smart\nVending UI immediately locks compromised coils, renders an emergency red\nLED acrylic warning display, and enforces hardware interlocks on the POS\nkeypad to prevent unsafe transactions.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [x] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #5357\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed.\n\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n### Test Details:\n* **Automated Test Suite\n(`backend/services/fdaRecallPipeline.test.js`):** Passed 7/7 tests\ncovering FDA API parsing, Polygon smart contract recording, machine lot\nmapping, and MQTT payload serialization.\n* **TypeScript Compilation:** Ran `npx tsc\ncomponents/SmartVendingRecallAlert.tsx` with 0 errors.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nDetailed visual interaction states, component layouts, and execution\nlogs are documented in `walkthrough.md`.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"748e20761d3ef7154b23809dc754013f66fd4692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/748e20761d3ef7154b23809dc754013f66fd4692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/58be1024aeef47c4bf14f4d1784e5f4cd4703192","verification":{"payload":"tree 748e20761d3ef7154b23809dc754013f66fd4692\nparent db2994da174b42203ca5e69a7de2ca81ee980911\nauthor Sushmita K <sushmitakoti661@gmail.com> 1788201065 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788201065 +0530\n\nfeat(vending): implement interactive dietary restriction smart vendin… (#5432)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nImplements an automated, globally synchronized food safety recall and\nhardware lockout pipeline for campus smart vending machines (Issue\n#5357).\n\nWhen the FDA/USDA issues a recall, the system ingests the enforcement\ndata, registers the recall on-chain via the Polygon supply chain ledger,\nresolves affected inventory lots to physical machine coils, and\ndispatches real-time MQTT lockout payloads. The interactive Smart\nVending UI immediately locks compromised coils, renders an emergency red\nLED acrylic warning display, and enforces hardware interlocks on the POS\nkeypad to prevent unsafe transactions.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [x] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #5357\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed.\n\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing f