I\n- Adds focused cryptographic tests\n- Keeps private ledger details hidden from the verification result\n\n## Security / Privacy\n\n- Uses synthetic/demo ledger data\n- Does not integrate with real Stripe accounts\n- Does not process real Tax IDs or vendor PII\n- Does not move or authorize real funds\n- Clearly distinguishes accounting consistency verification from a\nreal-world financial audit\n\n## Testing\n\n- Focused proof tests added\n- Lint/typecheck/tests verified","tree":{"sha":"6699c5f95771973e919eb4f65cb341d075603124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/6699c5f95771973e919eb4f65cb341d075603124"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/9c463ad5ee521d366bee8374f1a0107d23b53813","verification":{"payload":"tree 6699c5f95771973e919eb4f65cb341d075603124\nparent 283b9e12294f2d4f6b94496ec0a5f763f204628f\nauthor Suprita Naik <supritanaik717@gmail.com> 1788200714 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788200714 +0530\n\nFeat/5353 club budget zk proofs (#5428)\n\nCloses #5353\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds a privacy-preserving club budget accounting proof prototype.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Adds club budget accounting consistency proof functionality\n- Adds privacy-preserving recipient verification\n- Adds Treasurer proof generation UI\n- Adds proof verification UI\n- Adds focused cryptographic tests\n- Keeps private ledger details hidden from the verification result\n\n## Security / Privacy\n\n- Uses synthetic/demo ledger data\n- Does not integrate with real Stripe accounts\n- Does not process real Tax IDs or vendor PII\n- Does not move or authorize real funds\n- Clearly distinguishes accounting consistency verification from a\nreal-world financial audit\n\n## Testing\n\n- Focused proof tests added\n- Lint/typecheck/tests verified","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlccKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYpAQAC6594eVD1u3wDVwc39aGOtz\nZJ5RuRH+d3YjghUe84jLKprhlWoz9UYXxDCwjOiA8N0Jq