vatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mspandey","id":226774300,"login":"mspandey","node_id":"U_kgDODYRNHA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/2a9f8d7330ab368e5b71530db51efa88c3c97bdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:57:26Z","email":"amisha.pandey2006@gmail.com","name":"Amisha Pandey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:57:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ECSoC26 Add Predictive Philanthropy Engine implementation (#5413)\n\n## Description\nThis pull request addresses **Issue #5124** by implementing the\nReal-Time \"Donation Goal\" Predictive Philanthropy Dashboard backend\nengine (`PredictivePhilanthropyEngine`) to scan for high-value alumni\nliquidity events and optimize fundraising target asks.\n\n## Changes\n* Created `src/philanthropy/predictive_engine.py` to parse\nOSINT/LinkedIn data feeds against the alumni database.\n* Added pattern-matching logic for ML triggers like \"Promoted to VP\",\n\"Acquired by\", \"IPO\", or \"Series B Funding\".\n* Implemented dynamic ask-amount recalculation and automated\npersonalized outreach script generation for club leadership.\n* Added comprehensive unit test coverage in\n`tests/philanthropy/test_predictive_engine.py`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] Implement weekly background simulation parsing LinkedIn/Crunchbase\nfeeds against alumni registries.\n- [x] Detect liquidity triggers and flag qualifying profiles as \"Prime\nTarget\" in the dashboard.\n- [x] Automatically recalculate mathematically optimized ask amounts.\n- [x] Generate customized outreach scripts for the Club President.\n\n## Assignee\n@krushit1307\n##  resolves issue #5124 \n ECSoC26","tree":{"sha":"b44f14cafc46b3643ed95d43411a454bc5540a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/b44f14cafc46b3643ed95d43411a454bc5540a09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/2a9f8d7330ab368e5b71530db51efa88c3c97bdd","verification":{"payload":"tree b44f14cafc46b3643ed95d43411a454bc5540a09\nparent febbc51fefd55d78dca85a6742120d8a846e9047\nauthor Amisha Pandey <amisha.pandey2006@gmail.com> 1788199046 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788199046 +0530\n\nECSoC26 Add Predictive Philanthropy Engine implementation (#5413)\n\n## Description\nThis pull request addresses **Issue #5124** by implementing the\nReal-Time \"Donation Goal\" Predictive Philanthropy Dashboard backend\nengine (`PredictivePhilanthropyEngine`) to scan for high-value alumni\nliquidity events and optimize fundraising target asks.\n\n## Changes\n* Created `src/philanthropy/predictive_engine.py` to parse\nOSINT/LinkedIn data feeds against the alumni database.\n* Added pattern-matching logic for ML triggers like \"Promoted to VP\",\n\"Acquired by\", \"IPO\", or \"Series B Funding\".\n* Implemented dynamic ask-amount recalculation and automated\npersonalized outreach script generation for club leadership.\n* Added comprehensive unit test coverage in\n`tests/philanthropy/test_predictive_engine.py`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] Implement weekly background simulation parsing LinkedIn/Crunchbase\nfeeds against alumni registries.\n- [x] Detect liquidity triggers and flag qualifying profiles as \"Prime\nTarget\" in the dashboard.\n- [x] Automatically recalculate mathematically optimized ask amounts.\n- [x] Generate customized outreach scripts for the Club President.\n\n## Assignee\n@krushit1307\n##  resolves issue #5124 \