ps://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect)) by\nimplementing the Automated \"Club Leadership\" AI Co-Pilot for Contract\nNegotiation (`ContractNegotiationCopilot`).\n\n## Changes\n* Created `src/compliance/contract_negotiation_copilot.py` to handle OCR\ncontract text extraction and LLM-driven legal analysis against\nUniversity General Counsel templates.\n* Implemented pattern matching and warning generators for predatory\nclauses (e.g., \"Non-refundable deposit\", \"Unlimited indemnification\",\n\"Absolute Liability\").\n* Configured UI red-highlight payloads with plain-English warnings and\nautomated professional counter-proposal email generation.\n* Added unit test coverage in\n`tests/compliance/test_contract_copilot.py`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] Pipe PDF contracts through OCR and LLM analysis before signing.\n- [x] Compare extracted text against standard University General Counsel\ntemplates.\n- [x] Flag predatory clauses, highlight paragraphs in red, and generate\nplain-English warnings.\n- [x] Automatically draft a professional counter-proposal email for the\nClub President.\n\n## Assignee\n* @krushit1307\nResolves issue #5123","tree":{"sha":"6706966be549a8ea0d4654d00acdc7219cb5f5a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/6706966be549a8ea0d4654d00acdc7219cb5f5a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/febbc51fefd55d78dca85a6742120d8a846e9047","verification":{"payload":"tree 6706966be549a8ea0d4654d00acdc7219cb5f5a6\nparent 73bf67fa25e796f06c30d3c5ad8a6dfe238ef23a\nauthor Amisha Pandey <amisha.pandey2006@gmail.com> 1788199042 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788199042 +0530\n\nECSoC26 Add ContractNegotiationCopilot for contract analysis (#5414)\n\n## Description\nThis pull request addresses [Issue\n#5123](https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/issues/5123)\n([CampusConnect](https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect)) by\nimplementing the Automated \"Club Leadership\" AI Co-Pilot for Contract\nNegotiation (`ContractNegotiationCopilot`).\n\n## Changes\n* Created `src/compliance/contract_negotiation_copilot.py` to handle OCR\ncontract text extraction and LLM-driven legal analysis against\nUniversity General Counsel templates.\n* Implemented pattern matching and warning generators for predatory\nclauses (e.g., \"Non-refundable deposit\", \"Unlimited indemnification\",\n\"Absolute Liability\").\n* Configured UI red-highlight payloads with plain-English warnings and\nautomated professional counter-proposal email generation.\n* Added unit test coverage in\n`tests/compliance/test_contract_copilot.py`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] Pipe PDF contracts through OCR and LLM analysis before signing.\n- [x] Compare extracted text against standard University General Counsel\ntemplates.\n- [x] Flag predatory clauses, highlight paragraphs in red, and generate\nplain-English warnings.\n- [x] Automatically draft a professional counter-proposal email for the\nClub President.\n\n## Assignee\n* @krushit1307\nResolves issue #5123","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlcCCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZvYQALASMoiHMtIMIVrGgJxIAZnp\nBozOnCttxczP2P4Y4kpWW7IpwVbcANQSLRiyrUSC48hV6SAdpjeD9TZ4nlXoHx5L\nY1D0B1qks2bW0eO84kBBPnp+hcy1fCSs6uznM6Wz+/6s3sGiTPn1qcE5cPShv25Q\nhwd7VBTM9fvIRymswcrwWBp8fpPBcs00EX0hJfwk6kubxuzlVt8krJYlzc3L1H4A\nO2jHpzSBH+W8sLMCUQL2pp5KHxkxHnw6OSHS14HJSHQ40Krm+febGFqGZiOuH7hi\nhvED1YY/m52YU8p3vSv4WOGE6zHbpDhJVbBB5DjMU9bzUP8gsHmOU7gezakVJUa2\nnlhLCVtiqduNv9agXt82//9A3OiEV1PC0cKtQh217AYCdP9yRnnr6vM9t8rhczlX\nCDO3X+6c0OYB9zHXVBQhFhQ5vlAtaij3U7mjGadclRH5h3W0M8syOYhPZ9wpu22X\noTibIaMRyQdHez9qIHxlUPXXIMLOryctC4Iad6tjJw4QhnReoQ4CLyEG8kRajirK\nMmj8rbA+5fgtQG0l/8kMEpbCbJjVXe1Ak1chcvEIIL+42cBickNFpjTNneFP2Bl4\ncVo3KCt7N/4Dq/3AWSY5dy11fZq5Tiya5CD982AdZSobfgRRK5xPXi/ggVOzWLTY\nM7y2gb7198pCb2V6X7Dy\n=6Knq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T17:57:23Z"}},"committer