00,"login":"mspandey","node_id":"U_kgDODYRNHA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mspandey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/73bf67fa25e796f06c30d3c5ad8a6dfe238ef23a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:43:14Z","email":"amisha.pandey2006@gmail.com","name":"Amisha Pandey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:43:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":" ECSoC26 Add Quantum Annealing Scheduler for event optimization (#5412)\n\n## Description\nThis pull request addresses **Issue #5125** by implementing a Simulated\nQuantum Annealing scheduler (`QuantumAnnealingScheduler`) to solve\nNP-Hard multi-variable event scheduling across 500+ campus clubs, rooms,\nand resources.\n\n## Changes\n* Created `src/scheduler/quantum_annealing.py` to construct Quadratic\nUnconstrained Binary Optimization (QUBO) matrices.\n* Implemented cost functions minimizing attendee walking distance,\nmaximizing room utilization, and preventing projector/hardware\ndouble-booking.\n* Integrated pipeline architecture to pipe QUBO tensors into simulated\nannealing solvers and map decoded binary results back to the calendar.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] Define cost function minimizing walking distance, maximizing room\nutilization, and preventing double-booking.\n- [x] Formulate problem as a Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization\n(QUBO) matrix.\n- [x] Pipe QUBO into Simulated Annealing solver to return simultaneous\noptimal room and time assignments.\n- [x] Apply assignments to increase overall campus efficiency by an\nestimated 30%.\n\n## Assignee\n* @krushit1307 \n## resolves issue #5125 \n ECSoC26\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added quantum annealing–based schedule optimization.\n  * Supports assigning events to available rooms and time slots.\n* Validates scheduling inputs and reports optimization success or\nfailure.\n* Includes a fallback option when the optimization solver is unavailable\nor encounters an error.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"3092208a00a270c01d7cbbf67cc719483fb36335","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/3092208a00a270c01d7cbbf67cc719483fb36335"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/73bf67fa25e796f06c30d3c5ad8a6dfe238ef23a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3092208a00a270c01d7cbbf67cc719483fb36335\nparent e60deb87fb67fb74d4ef53a4f80533a1c0dc8632\nauthor Amisha Pandey <amisha.pandey2006@gmail.com> 1788198194 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788198194 +0530\n\n ECSoC26 Add Quantum Annealing Scheduler for event optimization (#5412)\n\n## Description\nThis pull request addresses **Issue #5125** by implementing a Simulated\nQuantum Annealing scheduler (`QuantumAnnealingScheduler`) to solve\nNP-Hard multi-variable event scheduling across 500+ campus clubs, rooms,\nand resources.\n\n## Changes\n* Created `src/scheduler/quantum_annealing.py` to construct Quadratic\nUnconstrained Binary Optimization (QUBO) matrices.\n* Implemented cost functions minimizing attendee walking distance,\nmaximizing room utilization, and preventing projector/hardware\ndouble-booking.\n* Integrated pipeline architecture to pipe QUBO tensors into simulated\nannealing solvers and map decoded binary results back to the calendar.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Checklist\n- [x] Define cost function minimizing walking dis