s via `librosa`.\n- Implemented `audio_upload_controller.py` handling file routing,\nscanning, and secure quarantine segregation.\n- Added `test_audio_detector.py` isolating detection thresholds using\nmock signals.\n\nCloses #5294","tree":{"sha":"e77c7ffadfdccd9b1f9a1d140e9338a65490f46c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/e77c7ffadfdccd9b1f9a1d140e9338a65490f46c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/e60deb87fb67fb74d4ef53a4f80533a1c0dc8632","verification":{"payload":"tree e77c7ffadfdccd9b1f9a1d140e9338a65490f46c\nparent 18a9fcb036489db306f3dd948aebd4eda2b1d5e3\nauthor Milan <milanrathod5201@gmail.com> 1788197820 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788197820 +0530\n\nfeat: implement STFT noise floor consistency checks to quarantine syn… (#5423)\n\n…thetic deepfake audio #5294\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nProvide a brief description of the changes introduced in this pull\nrequest.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed.\n\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] Existing functionality verified\n- [ ] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Screenshots\n\nIf applicable, add screenshots of the changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Code follows project conventions\n- [ ] Documentation updated where required\n- [ ] No unnecessary files included\n- [ ] Changes have been tested\n- [ ] Ready for review\n## Description\nImplements an Acoustic Environment Consistency analyzer designed to\ndetect and isolate synthetic deepfake audio uploads. By parsing\nshort-time Fourier transform (STFT) frames during speech pauses, the\nengine identifies mathematically sterile or digitally silent noise\nfloors and quarantines suspicious files.\n\n## Changes\n- Created `audio_deepfake_detector.py` parsing spectro