n## Changes\n- Created `ParametricInsurancePool.sol` incorporating\n`POLICY_ACTIVATION_DELAY` constraints blocking flash lifecycle triggers.\n- Formulated an automated `deploy_pool.py` script structure using\n`Web3.py` mapped to native Polygon parameters.\n- Designed a Mocha security framework test package asserting transaction\nrejections on immediate sub-block invocation attempts.\n\nCloses #5301","tree":{"sha":"651a2b8326992e2011092a14b53ae9d0e53f8d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/651a2b8326992e2011092a14b53ae9d0e53f8d1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/9ffc30ed6892d3d3bb214f5364a01b7f0129549e","verification":{"payload":"tree 651a2b8326992e2011092a14b53ae9d0e53f8d1c\nparent 78de46ec8c9c0982d9b67583182c5a602ccab8bd\nauthor Milan <milanrathod5201@gmail.com> 1788197801 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788197801 +0530\n\nsecurity: implement 72-hour temporal state-locking to prevent flash l… (#5421)\n\n…oan exploitation #5301\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nProvide a brief description of the changes introduced in this pull\nrequest.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed.\n\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] Existing functionality verified\n- [ ] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Screenshots\n\nIf applicable, add screenshots of the changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Code follows project conventions\n- [ ] Documentation updated where required\n- [ ] No unnecessary files included\n- [ ] Changes have been tested\n- [ ] Ready for review\n\n## Description\nAddresses a catastrophic vulnerability vector where flash loan actors\ncan leverage atomic single-block transaction spaces to arbitrage\nparametric weather insurance payouts precisely as weather anomalies\noccur. It builds a hard 72-hour `policy_activation_delay` state wall on\nnewly minted items.\n\n## Changes\n- Created `ParametricInsurancePool.sol` incorporating\n`POLICY_ACTIVATION_DELAY` constraints blocking flash lifecycle triggers.\n- Formulated an automated `deploy_pool.py` script structure using\n`Web3.py` mapped to native Polygon parameters.\n- Designed a Mocha security framework test package asserting transaction\nrejections on immediate sub-block invocation attempts.\n\nCloses #5301","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlbupCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0KcQADAfrimLWilHsFPgjXZI88kw\nQJU+rz4dbezOGXk9U2zD9HmEgLucFvsUt+l9fbYfnwZCTGlEE+Z9HJ+Dpa6A2LA7\nhaioUtt5HWpYtQdrA7c0FL35i9HWCGew2AIkP8t1hsv0vemzOkQ5lApUhIOPOVse\nMkLCDnt5rCXBoFc5JlakpuY+KGlJk9aLqZzTL7GTXm4PB+WCoJrr10CVQyZibhls\nLAwqiffylSpRTljTxqk02Sa6pmEofeIIg+VX13rI5neHAyU1wdzUSnYJgDwXyH4g\nth4C4s4EuzVzf3ptyvM4msCBe5pohq/TDwGMAkffh1/PHHwuKXm2sZZYE+07//Q2\nHGWRnwr5X2wYO42W2DNMC8Umw/90TNilpv2RWGKmAy9UBd804Kn490Htpd/lvw9+\nYks4BuKMRFZ4HVu6aZ4gnjWDe7dvBxEwPrRXsLEmyHn/MShsoBt+xczQJwy1uf+Z\n4oi1cwHBr+HtzVK+UhEaH4rxoHzgNwCOdWIIoo2Qk6CtUR8edsC++2XeO+EW2/zA\nEshXdceC5rXbbwHSv3zS3xsoLeQkbR97DM0IQMOiXp6ppyJEvLIdsySmfcnqYAdo\nSqO9tTZcgKIJGvIl1WNR0NbO0cAWuhyE1nswaJxiK+84MGqPmshhkzrEQ3kNvseo\nhRziEvUv+0zydOYnuHGe\n=u+WK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T17:36:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we