/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/78de46ec8c9c0982d9b67583182c5a602ccab8bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:36:38Z","email":"milanrathod5201@gmail.com","name":"Milan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:36:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): implement ZK-Proof RADIUS accounting interception and … (#5422)\n\n…automated Stripe B2B invoicing #5300\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nProvide a brief description of the changes introduced in this pull\nrequest.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed.\n\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] Existing functionality verified\n- [ ] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Screenshots\n\nIf applicable, add screenshots of the changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Code follows project conventions\n- [ ] Documentation updated where required\n- [ ] No unnecessary files included\n- [ ] Changes have been tested\n- [ ] Ready for review\n## Description\nImplements an anonymous multi-campus RADIUS accounting packet\ninterceptor and aggregation pipeline. This allows institutions (e.g.,\nMIT) to recover bandwidth usage fees generated by anonymous federated\nusers (via ZK-Proofs) by charging their parent institutions (e.g.,\nHarvard) dynamically via Stripe B2B invoices.\n\n## Changes\n- Created `radius_interceptor.py` running an asynchronous UDP packet\nparsing server using `pyrad`.\n- Built local metrics collection layers isolating traffic metrics while\nretaining absolute identity privacy boundaries.\n- Built `billing_engine.py` using `stripe` to compile consumption\nmetrics into automated institutional invoicing objects.\n\nCloses #5300","tree":{"sha":"82db4269a79bbc79b356f31623237d6116c4c321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/82db4269a79bbc79b356f31623237d6116c4c321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/78de46ec8c9c0982d9b67583182c5a602ccab8bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 82db4269a79bbc79b356f31623237d6116c4c321\nparent d7c599440bf2dc165aea3f79d0a49fd2843cb101\nauthor Milan <milanrathod5201@gmail.com> 1788197798 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788197798 +0530\n\nfeat(billing): implement ZK-Proof RADIUS accounting interception and … (#5422)\n\n…automated Stripe B2B invoicing #5300\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nProvide a brief description of the changes introduced in this pull\nrequest.\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #\n\n## Testing\n\nDescribe the testing performed.\n\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] Existing functionality verified\n- [ ] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Screenshots\n\nIf applicable, add screenshots of the changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Code follows project conventions\n- [ ] Documentation updated where required\n- [ ] No unnecessary files included\n- [ ] Changes have been tested\n- [ ] Ready for review\n## Description\nImplements an anonymous multi-campus RADIUS accounting packet\ninterceptor and aggregation pipeline. This allows institutions (e.g.,\nMIT) to recover bandwidth usage fees generated by anonymous federated\nusers (via ZK-Proofs) by charging their parent institutions (e.g.,\nHarvard) dynamically via Stripe B2B invoices.\n\n## Changes\n- Created `radius_interceptor.py` running an asynchronous UDP packet\nparsing server using `pyrad`.\n- Built local metrics collection layers isolating traffic metrics while\nretaining absolute identity privacy boundaries.\n- Built `billing_engine.py` using `stripe` to compile consumption\nmetrics into automated institutional invoicing objects.\n\nCloses #5300","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN