arents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/d7c599440bf2dc165aea3f79d0a49fd2843cb101","sha":"d7c599440bf2dc165aea3f79d0a49fd2843cb101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/d7c599440bf2dc165aea3f79d0a49fd2843cb101"}],"sha":"78de46ec8c9c0982d9b67583182c5a602ccab8bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/78de46ec8c9c0982d9b67583182c5a602ccab8bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/265290994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Babin123456","id":265290994,"login":"Babin123456","node_id":"U_kgDOD9AE8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Babin123456","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/d7c599440bf2dc165aea3f79d0a49fd2843cb101/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:47:33Z","email":"265290994+Babin123456@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Babin Bid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:47:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Implement Automated Club Leadership Mandatory Phishing Simulation (#5420)\n\n# feat: Implement Automated Club Leadership Mandatory Phishing\nSimulation (#5146)\n\n## Summary\nResolves #5146\n\nIntegrates automated Deepfake Video generation (Synthesia / HeyGen AI\nVideo APIs) into the cybersecurity simulation pipeline to train campus\nclub presidents against multimodal AI social engineering attacks\n(Deepfake CEO/Dean Fraud sent via SMS).\n\n## Problem\nTraditional text spear-phishing training is obsolete against generative\nAI multimodal attacks. Club leaders who ignore suspicious emails often\nfall victim when receiving a personalized video on SMS featuring a\nhigh-authority figure (e.g. Dean of Students) demanding an emergency\nfinancial transfer.\n\n## Solution & Architecture\n- **Digital Avatar Pipeline**: Uses pre-trained digital avatar profiles\nof opted-in authority figures (e.g., Dean of Students, University\nPresident).\n- **Personalized Video & SMS Dispatch**: Generates lip-synced video\npayloads referencing the specific club''s activity and demanding an\nurgent wire transfer, dispatched via SMS gateway to the Club President''s\nregistered mobile number.\n- **Mandatory Cyber Debriefing**: If the president falls for the scam or\nexecutes the fake transfer, they are immediately routed to a mandatory\ndebriefing portal on deepfake social engineering realities.\n\n## Key Changes\n1. **Simulation Service\n(`src/services/deepfakePhishingSimulationService.ts`)**:\n- Manages digital avatar profiles, personalized script compilation,\nHeyGen / Synthesia AI video generation API integration, SMS message\ndispatching, and simulation state tracking (`DRAFT`, `SMS_DISPATCHED`,\n`FAILED_SIMULATION`, `PASSED_SIMULATION`, `DEBRIEFED`).\n\n2. **Database Migration\n(`supabase/migrations/20280909000000_deepfake_phishing_simulations.sql`)**:\n- Created `authority_avatar_profiles`, `phishing_simulations`, and\n`phishing_debriefing_logs` tables.\n- Created `record_phishing_simulation_action` RPC to record simulation\noutcomes and assign vulnerability risk scores.\n\n3. **Debrief & Simulation Portal\n(`src/components/security/DeepfakePhishingDebriefPortal.tsx`)**:\n- Dashboard to configure deepfake campaigns, preview generated video\nscripts, simulate SMS payloads, test target responses, and render\nmandatory deepfake education debrief modals.\n\n4. **Unit Tests\n(`src/components/security/DeepfakePhishingDebriefPortal.test.tsx`)**:\n- Vitest suite testing avatar script compilation, SMS dispatch, failed\ntransfer detection, debriefing completion, and UI modal flows.\n\n## Tests\n```bash\nnpx vitest run src/components/security/DeepfakePhishingDebriefPortal.test.tsx","tree":{"sha":"dac0a144529d3af7341867041a9611816d55b6e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/dac0a144529d3af7341867041a9611816d55b6e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/d7c599440bf2dc165aea3f79d0a49fd2843cb101","verification":{"payload":"tree dac0a144529d3af7341867041a9611816d55b6e4\nparent 24a0db0688966b333ae6e7bdae89e9f9260ae6da\nauthor Babin Bid <265290994+Babin123456@users.noreply.github.com> 1788194853 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788194853 +0530\n\nfeat: Implement Automated Club Leadership Mandatory Phishing Simulation (#5420)\n\n# feat: Implement Automated Club Leadership Mandatory Phishing\nSimulation (#5146)\n\n## Summary\nResolves #5146\n\nIntegrates automated Deepfake Video generation (Synthesia / HeyGen AI\nVideo APIs) into the cybersecurity simulation pipeline to train campus\nclub presidents against multimodal AI social engineering attacks\n(Deepfake CEO/Dean Fraud sent via SMS).\n\n## Problem\nTraditional text spear-phishing training is obsolete against generative\nAI multimodal attacks. Club leaders who ignore suspicious emails often\nfall victim when receiving a personalized video on SMS featuring a\nhigh-authority figure (e.g. Dean of Students) demanding an emergency\nfinancial transfer.\n\n## Solution & Architecture\n- **Digital Avatar Pipeline**: Uses pre-trained digital avatar profiles\nof opted-in authority figures (e.g., Dean of Students, University\nPresident).\n- **Personalized Video & SMS Dispatch**: Generates lip-synced video\npayloads referencing the specific club''s activity and demanding an\nurgent wire transfer, dispatched via SMS gateway to the Club President''s\nregistered mobile number.\n- **Mandatory Cyber Debriefing**: If the president falls for the scam or\nexecutes the fake transfer, they are immediately routed to a mandatory\ndebriefing portal on deepfake social engineering realities.\n\n## Key Changes\n1. **Simulation Service\n(`src/services/deepfakePhishingSimulationService.ts`)**:\n- Manages digital avatar profiles, personalized script compilation,\nHeyGen / Synthesia AI video generation API integration, SMS message\ndispatching, and simulation state tracking (`DRAFT`, `SMS_DISPATCHED`,\n`FAILED_SIMULATION`, `PASSED_SIMULATION`, `DEBRIEFED`).\n\n2. **Database Migration\n(`supabase/migrations/20280909000000_deepfake_phishing_simulations.sql`)**:\n- Created `authority_avatar_profiles`, `phishing_simulations`, and\n`phishing_debriefing_logs` tables.\n- Created `record_phishing_simulation_action` RPC to record simulation\noutcomes and assign vulnerability risk scores.\n\n3. **Debrief & Simulation Portal\n(`src/components/security/DeepfakePhishingDebriefPortal.tsx`)**:\n- Dashboard to configure deepfake campaigns, preview generated video\nscripts, simulate SMS payloads, test target responses, and render\nmandatory deepfake education debrief modals.\n\n4. **Unit Tests\n(`src/components/security/DeepfakePhishingDebriefPortal.test.tsx`)**:\n- Vitest suite testing avatar script compilation, SMS dispatch, failed\ntransfer detection, debriefing completion, and UI modal flows.\n\n## Tests\n```bash\nnpx vitest run src/components/security/DeepfakePhishingDebriefPortal.test.tsx","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlbAlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtRgQAIZOwI6kFl6nh26ner+w7bIs\nToREjDQSc/JFhURaQ4UPW8s40N60cHnW9kCLKUgMw8pMo3EGi3KnV92OJZGovZww\n1X3KlyRPNotUwRrfeH+iKROC6YQ6CnkDka+h1PIC45C/6VlIgSKARF