bd654afa018902660df46e2"}],"sha":"f2bc5d79c9de5b964db65051a4a07e25251466fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f2bc5d79c9de5b964db65051a4a07e25251466fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273169945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aryanbuha890","id":273169945,"login":"Aryanbuha890","node_id":"U_kgDOEEg-GQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/09a896888cf56346cbd654afa018902660df46e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:17:59Z","email":"aryan.buha89@gmail.com","name":"Aryan Buha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:17:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(caterer): #5381 Implement zk-SNARK Food Safety Compliance Verification (#5411)\n\n📝 Summary\nThis PR implements a Zero-Knowledge Proof (zk-SNARK) compliance\nvalidation framework for caterer temperature deliveries. Instead of\npublishing raw, proprietary GPS coordinates or temperature logs directly\nonto the public Polygon blockchain, the caterer constructs a local\nzk-SNARK proof asserting that none of their readings exceeded the 40°F\nFDA danger threshold. This proof is sent on-chain and verified in\nreal-time, releasing Stripe holds while maintaining logistics\nconfidentiality.\n\n🏷️ Type of Change\n- [x] New feature (zk-SNARK food safety compliance)\n- [x] Test improvement\n\n🔗 Related Issue\nCloses #5381\n\n✨ Changes Made\n- **Database Schema & Oracle RPC\n(`20271004000000_caterer_zk_snark_compliance.sql`)**:\n- Created `caterer_zk_proofs` table to store submitted proofs, lot\nnumbers, verified status, and timestamps.\n  - Added `zk_compliance_status` to `event_caterer_contracts` table.\n- Implemented `submit_caterer_zk_proof` RPC executing verification on\nPolygon.\n- **Client Service Wrapper (`catererZkService.ts`)**:\n- Supports fetching ZK proofs, submitting proofs to the database, and\ngenerating mock Groth16 proofs from raw IoT datasets by checking if max\ntemperature <= 40°F.\n- **zk-SNARK Compliance Panel UI (`DietaryForecastPanel.tsx`)**:\n- Renders lot numbers, cryptographic proof hashes, total readings\ncertified, and verify status.\n- Supports simulated proof generation (mathematically proving safety\nwith hidden GPS/temp details).\n- **Unit Test Suites**:\n- **pgTAP database tests (`caterer_zk_snark_compliance.test.sql`)**:\nVerifies schema changes, RLS rules, vault ratios, and Stripe releases.\n- **React component tests (`DietaryForecastPanel.test.tsx`)**: Verifies\nzk-SNARK rendering, compile click events, and RPC mock triggers.\n\n🧪 Testing\n- [x] Tests pass\n- [x] Linters run successfully\n- [x] Tested locally\n\nTesting Details:\nRun Unit Tests:\n```bash\nnpx vitest run src/components/events/DietaryForecastPanel.test.tsx","tree":{"sha":"abd11b4a36dd046dc8788fc0215871e349e1bbb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/abd11b4a36dd046dc8788fc0215871e349e1bbb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/09a896888cf56346cbd654afa018902660df46e2","verification":{"payload":"tree abd11b4a36dd046dc8788fc0215871e349e1bbb4\nparent 1a2c3be9e0fb1bdeccdf3d80cc139d92acc2f8ea\nauthor Aryan Buha <aryan.buha89@gmail.com> 1788189479 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788189479 +0530\n\nfeat(caterer): #5381 Implement zk-SNARK Food Safety Compliance Verification (#5411)\n\n📝 Summary\nThis PR implements a Zero-Knowledge Proof (zk-SNARK) compliance\nvalidation framework for caterer temperature deliveries. Instead of\npublishing raw, proprietary GPS coordinates or temperature logs directly\nonto the public Polygon blockchain, the caterer constructs a local\nzk-SNARK proof asserting that none of their readings exceeded the 40°F\nFDA danger threshold. This proof is sent on-chain and verified in\nreal-time, releasing Stripe holds while maintaining logistics\nconfidentiality.\n\n🏷️ Type of Change\n- [x] New feature (zk-SNARK food safety compliance)\n- [x] Test improvement\n\n🔗 Related Issue\nCloses #5381\n\n✨ Changes Made\n- **Database Schema & Oracle RPC\n(`20271004000000_caterer_zk_snark_compliance.sql`)**:\n- Created `caterer_zk_proofs` table to store submitted proofs, lot\nnumbers, verified status, and timestamps.\n  - Added `zk_compliance_status` to `event_caterer_contracts` table.\n- Implemented `submit_caterer_zk_proof` RPC executing verification on\nPolygon.\n- **Client Service Wrapper (`catererZkService.ts`)**:\n- Supports fetching ZK proofs, submitting proofs to the database, and\ngenerating mock Groth16 proofs from raw IoT datasets by checking if max\ntemperature <= 40°F.\n- **zk-SNARK Compliance Panel UI (`DietaryForecastPanel.tsx`)**:\n- Renders lot numbers, cryptographic proof hashes, total readings\ncertified, and verify status.\n- Supports simulated proof generation (mathematically proving safety\nwith hidden GPS/temp details).\n- **Unit Test Suites**:\n- **pgTAP database tests (`caterer_zk_snark_compliance.test.sql`)**:\nVerifies schema changes, RLS rules, vault ratios, and Stripe releases.\n- **React component tests (`DietaryForecastPanel.test.tsx`)**: Verifies\nzk-SNARK rendering, compile click events, and RPC mock triggers.\n\n🧪 Testing\n- [x] Tests pass\n- [x] Linters run successfully\n- [x] Tested locally\n\nTesting Details:\nRun Unit Tests:\n```bash\nnpx vitest run src/components/events/DietaryForecastPanel.test.tsx","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlZsnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjJcQAFJhGqYLN78ErEXGwaetVgmh\n08OQKa7LhnVsSImR92g/nBHcM/pO5L1//fyYvJxSgDGt63pUMOhijnwDTox7Fr1X\nJ/K1KbPZ4yD+CxHSAWCl3vjoA1VCS+9prU9XIvIQQTKeEBpEbhyZwEAYdN2dj8Sm\n1bLw7UaxxCpZaXrLi+YDI7p7b97YBiuSJ/NGBY/DF17zgrdH7E5LKK1vU1v6Xanu\nEW+2kN3eCVk+I/2LOT4t65bAZQaQoJ6wDhekoZAktFfwW7wBfhIZmdrfErDbV5ZT\npG98gOtjzy7oE7Ls9lV55iRrL/5zUYhNLLgzRF5VUADum6lmPnz9XnpqstUY2TLV\nNcLxOWOS7uPfIJ6I6BAAmwcqqtLWxfVSeVTYj6I5mGOlayUMi3qYfWTVVk2FxvLH\ni/mU1atYUR9xzS/8DRTbGoh2kSDPik81LXy7mcKy/ZOXlsuqKxiNxJ0NAgMc7M6w\nOS9xSyu9A81fSb3KDDEQPfiRV+jvb20IKSQek5OJD0bqHAVIOWcA6SJZf6M1jPVm\n9dx3Ak+CucpXL/B8q9aah55dXhel57cV+qZ5xqmDSUHPKFtkPAKLs8dW0n8FBckt\nBWqg32q9qawjMEIq4hmVU9/IohaEY0c49tcwRnoP3FUoYJvqbRnLvoeGrsFHHhl+\nFDo7Zfu2pcNwNr8hAhRI\n=FHk5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T15:18:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/09a896888cf56346cbd654afa018902660df46e2","node_id":"C_kwDOTPF5RdoAKDA5YTg5Njg4OGNmNTYzNDZjYmQ2NTRhZmEwMTg5MDI2NjBkZjQ2ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/1a2c3be9e0fb1bdeccdf3d80cc139d92acc2f8ea","sha":"1a2c3be9e0fb1bdeccdf3d80cc139d92acc2f8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/1a2c3be9e0fb1bdeccdf3d80cc139d92acc2f8ea"}],"sha":"09a896888cf56346cbd654afa018902660df46e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/09a896888cf56346cbd654afa018902660df46e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273169945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aryanbuha890","id":273169945,"login":"Aryanbuha890","node_id":"U_kgDOEEg-GQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/1a2c3be9e0fb1bdeccdf3d80cc139d92acc2f8ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:17:56Z","email":"aryan.buha89@gmail.com","name":"Aryan Buha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:17:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(finances): #5380 Implement MakerDAO CDP Leveraged Yield Donations (#5410)\n\n📝 Summary\nThis PR implements a leveraged MakerDAO Collateralized Debt Position\n(CDP) yield donation manager. Donors can lock collateral assets (e.g.\nETH) to flash-mint stablecoin loans (DAI) and stake them in yield\nprotocols (Spark/Aave) to generate sustainable charitable streams for\nstudent clubs. It also features a Tax-Exempt Capital Gains Calculator\nevaluating avoidances on direct asset sales.\n\n🏷️ Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [x] New feature\n- [ ] Documentation update\n- [ ] Performance improvement\n- [ ] Refactoring\n- [x] Test improvement\n- [ ] CI/CD or build change\n\n🔗 Related Issue\nCloses #5380\n\n✨ Changes Made\n- **Database Schema & Oracle RPC\n(`20271002000000_defi_leveraged_yield_donations.sql`)**:\n- Upgraded the `lossless_yield_donations` table to track collateral\nquantities, stablecoin borrow debts, leverage factors, liquidation\nratios, and tax savings.\n- Implemented `simulate_maker_cdp_leverage` RPC to calculate liquidation\nmetrics (e.g. 150% threshold limit) and tax-exempt savings offsets based\non current market indices.\n- **Client Service Wrapper (`defiLeverageService.ts`)**:\n- Handles queries for donor active vaults and triggers backend MakerDAO\nCDP leveraging simulations.\n- **Tax-Exempt Yield Tracker UI\n(`LosslessYieldDonationDashboard.tsx`)**:\n- Upgraded the dashboard with input parameters for asset type,\ncollateral size, and DAI stablecoin borrow sliders.\n- Computes real-time liquidation warnings if the collateralization ratio\nfalls below the 150% minimum safety threshold.\n- Displays avoiding offsets (capital gains rates maximum threshold) and\ntotal tax savings.\n- **Unit Test Suites**:\n- **pgTAP database tests (`defi_leveraged_yield_donations.test.sql`)**:\nVerifies schema upgrades, RLS rules, vault ratios, liquidation\nthresholds, and simulation RPC math.\n- **React component tests (`defiLeverage.test.tsx`)**: Verifies asset\nfields, borrow limits, and tax saving computations.\n\n🧪 Testing\n- [x] Tests pass\n- [x] Linters run successfully\n- [x] Tested locally\n\nTesting Details:\nRun Vitest unit tests:\n```bash\nnpx vitest run src/routes/defiLeverage.test.tsx","tree":{"sha":"93b5bf716f01ac59633867ce8b0ae415939e0574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/93b5bf716f01ac59633867ce8b0ae415939e0574"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/1a2c3be9e0fb1bdeccdf3d80cc139d92acc2f8ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 93b5bf716f01ac59633867ce8b0ae415939e0574\nparent 836e26a27a4cd659b782ec4e329ad86ee177e83a\nauthor Aryan Buha <aryan.buha89@gmail.com> 1788189476 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788189476 +0530\n\nfeat(finances): #5380 Implement MakerDAO CDP Leveraged Yield Donations (#5410)\n\n📝 Summary\nThis PR implements a leveraged MakerDAO Collateralized Debt Position\n(CDP) yield donation manager. Donors can lock collateral assets (e.g.\nETH) to flash-mint stablecoin loans (DAI) and stake them in yield\nprotocols (Spark/Aave) to generate sustainable charitable streams for\nstudent clubs. It also features a Tax-Exempt Capital Gains Calculator\nevaluating avoidances on direct asset sales.\n\n🏷️ Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [x] New feature\n- [ ] Documentation update\n- [ ] Performance improvement\n- [ ] Refactoring\n- [x] Test improvement\n- [ ] CI/CD or build change\n\n🔗 Related Issue\nCloses #5380\n\n✨ Changes Made\n- **Database Schema & Oracle RPC\n(`20271002000000_defi_leveraged_yield_donations.sql`)**:\n- Upgraded the `lossless_yield_donations` table to track collateral\nquantities, stablecoin borrow debts, leverage factors, liquidation\nratios, and tax savings.\n- Implemented `simulate_maker_cdp_leverage` RPC to calculate liquidation\nmetrics (e.g. 150% threshold limit) and tax-exempt savings offsets based\non current market indices.\n- **Client Service Wrapper (`defiLeverageService.ts`)**:\n- Handles queries for donor active vaults and triggers backend MakerDAO\nCDP leveraging simulations.\n- **Tax-Exempt Yield Tracker UI\n(`LosslessYieldDonationDashboard.tsx`)**:\n- Upgraded the dashboard with input parameters for asset type,\ncollateral size, and DAI stablecoin borrow sliders.\n- Computes real-time liquidation warnings if the collateralization ratio\nfalls below the 150% minimum safety threshold.\n- Displays avoiding offsets (capital gains rates maximum threshold) and\ntotal tax savings.\n- **Unit Test Suites**:\n- **pgTAP database tests (`defi_leveraged_yield_donations.test.sql`)**:\nVerifies schema upgrades, RLS rules, vault ratios, liquidation\nthresholds, and simulation RPC math.\n- **React component tests (`defiLeverage.test.tsx`)**: Verifies asset\nfields, borrow limits, and tax saving computations.\n\n🧪 Testing\n- [x] Tests pass\n- [x] Linters run successfully\n- [x] Tested locally\n\nTesting Details:\nRun Vitest unit tests:\n```bash\nnpx vitest run src/routes/defiLeverage.test.tsx","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlZskCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN1YQAAeq4rNYoQh5icBvT0gOHwqR\ngA9JZ4LKADgXVbZwUk/CERmTBOkeag9kjBp7E5P1Lg2RjLuk1VH7gP8pf91dzMuF\nSQAEYJlaS3cR3GP5m7TkW1U1t3JoV2rJO9aAQzeIpFDySu324lt5s69ICJJAFJ61\nVQUKHJ44Lm2NnRm/f/0RhqRZRAgEwd5OAqsvBJxVdBODS+rNsm4mrjllymvirUqk\nMohHa+jFz1uWAXOxZd5INq+TYCKsc2XkQ/wguk7KaWsmEW23d07YS/Q1WyevxtPy\nbA3ZtzFIic9pXheyBJd2q3vCge/j82PZiYq0hwXZ6coUG+fJ0GxpI1zTm76CoAtr\n5Z9NTMIAzrji6tAvhZy4iRCkGozt2qhpP+Yns9YGKQ9YNN91bfu3CmxrVEBSnKLx\n8sgCE9bpWjypEUxjq63HZujS3yfsnXNNPKItwu7Hyn3CWFgEM1HFS7ciMqLEETtq\njanoFKsCPnWQGIxpmLSFHlcRj2fH4OcxZ6gEgsoL/jCNCRs5fAC+F1vRFZfocW/J\nh//06f6YzgaY/VDXgKihBArHY8vTxcBX6U3WcI2oMWlAUZhiLLeRMRRlTGVbklSx\n5pOhcZwouup8a73uLfe6KXyJHZ9EZ3MCbXwQ3xq4MP75ehWyq2jVKVMx8gV4N5OL\nJVkoS46S9NW3zOvTLgAd\n=yRLs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T15:18:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git