nbuha890","node_id":"U_kgDOEEg-GQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aryanbuha890","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/836e26a27a4cd659b782ec4e329ad86ee177e83a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:17:55Z","email":"aryan.buha89@gmail.com","name":"Aryan Buha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:17:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(moderation): #5379 Implement Event Feedback Anonymization Logs (#5409)\n\n📝 Summary\nThis PR implements safe database schema updates and validation tests to\nrecord aggregated, anonymized event feedback sentiment drift metrics.\nThis allows facility managers and organizers to track review-bombing and\nvocabulary drift without collecting or leaking client network telemetry\n(WebRTC/VPN IP leakage).\n\n🏷️ Type of Change\n- [x] New feature (Safe Schema Integration)\n- [x] Test improvement\n\n🔗 Related Issue\nCloses #5379\n\n✨ Changes Made\n- **Database Schema\n(`20270930000000_event_feedback_anonymization.sql`)**:\n- Created the `feedback_anonymized_drifts` table to track aggregated\ndrift metrics (event_id, drift_delta, and total review counts).\n- Configured Row Level Security (RLS) policies and fast lookup indexes.\n- **pgTAP test suite (`event_feedback_anonymization.test.sql`)**:\n- Verifies table configuration, column constraints, and metric logging.","tree":{"sha":"17e6fb5f65f41c6c38bf9dfd3e8bda5d48886d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/17e6fb5f65f41c6c38bf9dfd3e8bda5d48886d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/836e26a27a4cd659b782ec4e329ad86ee177e83a","verification":{"payload":"tree 17e6fb5f65f41c6c38bf9dfd3e8bda5d48886d8e\nparent 601aa8cd7b085473c97b2ba48dbff36c79f5fc77\nauthor Aryan Buha <aryan.buha89@gmail.com> 1788189475 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788189475 +0530\n\nfeat(moderation): #5379 Implement Event Feedback Anonymization Logs (#5409)\n\n📝 Summary\nThis PR implements safe database schema updates and validation tests to\nrecord aggregated, anonymized event feedback sentiment drift metrics.\nThis allows facility managers and organizers to track review-bombing and\nvocabulary drift without collecting or leaking client network telemetry\n(WebRTC/VPN IP leakage).\n\n🏷️ Type of Change\n- [x] New feature (Safe Schema Integration)\n- [x] Test improvement\n\n🔗 Related Issue\nCloses #5379\n\n✨ Changes Made\n- **Database Schema\n(`20270930000000_event_feedback_anonymization.sql`)**:\n- Created the `feedback_anonymized_drifts` table to track aggregated\ndrift metrics (event_id, drift_delta, and total review counts).\n- Configured Row Level Security (RLS) policies and fast lookup indexes.\n- **pgTAP test suite (`event_feedback_anonymization.test.sql`)**:\n- Verifies table configuration, column constraints, and metric logging.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlZsjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh44QAJ/2FjjdBfjLVcQTiR3SOwB/\nDoRCa8r9EHDFNs+RlBYp4ujPMm5hoDIx+QL/3MGMKrHWjZORPq+uelu0jPAcCIMB\nvbYLfF8Y9/Yfd/T40QC67HS1HsK1pM5SdbXdW9U9BEPT2v8V9aEhE+GiX7HevZnm\nEyZsoayNKQeh6IWHBLCPj8HLi1QYnS8iLfRC2PuVhwLuNnHGbcXR9Ynu4tsGDzLh\ngKpTucEJs4QNtKPnugBvGTKFDVZFWNBWI7YIm6UXX/6NG2A/be3dk9qauCQnEign\n3OUhT+2XLKusUE8Cv67Ig/M0f4nwW5agzl3JutGD6oTau3jAvwR8oqLc+9wGVn2X\ndelZZ+wq082PqHfsvgsyKTRKV113ePfLWXEZ7glJpap4pye89tpMM9vC5kjjVzy/\nPWUjT380/71SI+aDbxo2lal+IEjIX0moDJeDxKkyFOhzkHT/w4Q7Z4o1MOjpVjZs\ngFHTD4maoYHHSEO8bLmxnXRvhnySWGsculQwfdNG7HNM52gRkdsaWjj4tuC8ZC/B