sts{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rishab11250","id":224525950,"login":"rishab11250","node_id":"U_kgDODWH-fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishab11250/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishab11250/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishab11250/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishab11250/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishab11250/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rishab11250","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/6be1b8c4b85779369abb47b6d967ca7b513f4f0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T08:29:07Z","email":"rishab.chandgothia.cg@gmail.com","name":"Rishab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T08:29:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(security): implement president incapacity dead man''s switch (#5346)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nImplements Automated \"Club Leadership\" President Incapacity Protocol\n(Dead Man''s Switch) for issue #5280. Monitors `Last_Active_Timestamp`\n(`profiles.last_active_at`) for users with `President` or `SuperAdmin`\nroles. At 21 consecutive days of inactivity triggers automated\nhigh-priority warning email \"Warning: Impending Executive Lockout.\" At\n30 days automatically executes succession protocol: cryptographically\nrevokes President''s Stripe Connect and Escrow signing keys\n(`club_signing_keys` vault, partial unique active index), promotes `Vice\nPresident` to `President` (role_id swap, demotes old President to\nMember), mints fresh access keys for new President, and notifies Dean of\nStudents (`system_admin` notifications + `club_audit_logs` entry). Adds\npure state-machine lib (`evaluateIncapacityStatus`,\n`shouldSendWarning`/`shouldExecuteSuccession`, `decideNextAction`),\n`20260528000000` migration with `club_leadership_incapacity_state`\ntracking and\n`execute_president_succession_protocol`/`send_incapacity_warning` RPCs,\nand `president-incapacity-monitor` cron edge function (daily,\nidempotent, handles `SuperAdmin`/`President` titles and\n`no_president`/`no_vice_president` edge cases).\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #5280\n\n## Testing\n\nVerified state machine, key rotation, and RBAC workflow without manual\npublish.\n\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\nDetails:\n- `npx vitest run src/lib/clubPresidentIncapacity.test.ts` — 9 passed\n(daysSinceLastActive 21/30, status thresholds\nhealthy/warning_pending/succession_pending, idempotent\nwarning/succession, `decideNextAction`, warning email subject/body with\nStripe/Vice President, succession audit `revoked_keys`/`dean_notified`,\ndeterministic `pk_live_`/`escrow_pub_` mint, role detection, constants).\n- `npx eslint --fix` on new files — 0 errors after fix; `npx tsc\n--noEmit` — 0 new errors filtered for `clubPresidentIncapacity`\n(pre-existing `EventSeriesAnalyticsDashboard`/`AttendeeVenueMap` errors\nunrelated).\n- Migration syntax checked via `git diff`; edge function follows\n`process-reminders-cron` SendGrid mock pattern and uses `verifyAuth`\nguard.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nN/A — Backend/RBAC/cryptographic key rotation workflow. State visible\nvia `club_leadership_incapacity_state` table and notifications to\nPresident/Vice President/Dean; no UI screenshot required.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"f4ba2ab0a00291177bd15ea97c9d3aed4fe3fd03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/f4ba2ab0a00291177bd15ea97c9d3aed4fe3fd03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/6be1b8c4b85779369abb47b6d967ca7b513f4f0b","verification":{"payload":"tree f4ba2ab0a00291177bd15ea97c9d3aed4fe3fd03\nparent 7bbe815a657c49a7aa931c17f13a333a3db2ce90\nauthor Rishab <rishab.chandgothia.cg@gmail.com> 1788164947 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788164947 +0530\n\nfeat(security): implement president incapacity dead man''s switch (#5346)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nImplements Automated \"Club Leadership\" President Incapacity Protocol\n(Dead Man''s Switch) for issue #5280. Monitors `Last_Active_Timestamp`\n(`profiles.last_active_at`) for users with `President` or `SuperAdmin`\nroles. At 21 consecutive days of inactivity triggers automated\nhigh-priority warning email \"Warning: Impending Executive Lockout.\" At\n30 days automatically executes succession protocol: cryptographically\nrevokes President''s Stripe Connect and Escrow signing keys\n(`club_signing_keys` vault, partial unique active index), promotes `Vice\nPresident` to `President` (role_id swap, demotes old President to\nMember), mints fresh access keys for new President, and notifies Dean of\nStudents (`system_admin` notifications + `club_audit_logs` entry). Adds\npure state-machine lib (`evaluateIncapacityStatus`,\n`shouldSendWarning`/`shouldExecuteSuccession`, `decideNextAction`),\n`20260528000000` migration with `club_leadership_incapacity_state`\ntracking and\n`execute_president_succession_protocol`/`send_incapacity_warning` RPCs,\nand `president-incapacity-monitor` cron edge function (daily,\nidempotent, handles `SuperAdmin`/`President` titles and\n`no_president`/`no_vice_president` edge cases).\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #5280\n\n## Testing\n\nVerified state machine, key rotation, and RBAC workflow without manual\npublish.\n\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\nDetails:\n- `npx vitest run src/lib/clubPresidentIncapacity.test.ts` — 9 passed\n(daysSinceLastActive 21/30, status thresholds\nhealthy/warning_pending/succession_pending, idempotent\nwarning/succession, `decideNextAction`, warning email subject/body with\nStripe/Vice President, succession audit `revoked_keys`/`dean_notified`,\ndeterministic `pk_live_`/`escrow_pub_` mint, role detection, constants).\n- `npx eslint --fix` on new files — 0 errors after fix; `npx tsc\n--noEmit` — 0 new errors filtered for `clubPresidentIncapacity`\n(pre-existing `EventSeriesAnalyticsDashboard`/`AttendeeVenueMap` errors\nunrelated).\n- Migration syntax checked via `git diff`; edge function follows\n`process-reminders-cron` SendGrid mock pattern and uses `verifyAuth`\nguard.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nN/A — Backend/RBAC/cryptographic key rotation workflow. State visible\nvia `club_leadership_incapacity_state` table and notifications to\nPresident/Vice President/Dean; no UI screenshot required.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlTtTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjcgQAI4GqimF1Ypn+LybHAd75rNj\nLN0AqEfBzdE2pdvLPlI9qVnogZHwk8rgDo1l8V4ZtIMHYjWvx2jXl2BKBsEpFT+m\nZJd4PwMM2euE8D+caIj1/D4MwtsV1OSCwonKCgj+xYn8KvBCxzrtleSkwmm4Fb+J\nljknNs93B6wnhoaTCTJnC2he0X+x59HGkhEha24icmMSHC4V9VC9BOenFd0x+1cM\nSkTIjIDwa9eIpkJAj5a4dYT9imBmg7KPSQ105HIBFc0l4ua1cx0vOsOIf2Fd6qN4\nCBWwP78ZawX/1ecA7Y50w8+aszqlf27GEXAjmBqeAYbC260J3NlzKXqNvAogngyI\nS7Hytxop321EHseEKfM/5bsNqOOs4e/MwcAwqJCM9Pr52aHFlFX1SK4VBeC+mM11\nSsMvVusUekq/h5C+q5479Vi7xUtCKjK2Nx6AJxjCbDTjHqo00Wmtr+L7XsTiMdWj\nrDXUvgPFtYd8gBfEkkJMNTL0PpW0N6Pay0fLiLuzQcIK18cWT8+hoCOdXDQx/n07\negBef+m