ling\n- Reviewed the implementation for unrelated changes\n\nCloses #5070","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlShMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAieQQACJilXlS7pVnZR4Y8Ctd7Vzc\nv/z/T3MOIfOhHkGNl0kZyzfyQLKeBBIcUC/8zUlQbDvsCz+BjzlV78moCvD8MswL\nP5PJR9lVGEZYMJxts6yNKIt+7gN/H/yvD8spyJ6wwzAUrd3wC6TutPC0fg4hjxah\nLRput/CTjLKq9dbQIPcHcCh+QFRfqZSrzpa0AVBb8f56N/FgJGYNy0egFXArWFhg\n6kCJKjal9Ljz73QpT7R3nUmY19ixWfkjAe3mnEotczmqhfwN6+weZUjuNwnV9JJ3\nfDMQBJyLdqAwSFFXLO4M8RnTnKJakX2J8xc+1SnEWyKICdRglcwmCWmva1b8zQI5\nAz+1GgokEw5yCCVWVrzAMxyXe9LK9uTky/uYRWaMUkes8R99g0M1D1TnQHpgFfhb\nbVPmdCQNMFcm2O2doMdBAvpcUVinkradxqhhf+ZOCjFYJ8QTPWcawI1S7M297Slp\nTDkGBl+AijsuCSd80RND3yzDJwu2fhvKBUTt49vA/VERGEtP7XqZvE6Vze618frL\npcGMKcLK2ar7VaDM/aiFTTvTne6DOmJpOoW1x+itmpxW5oIgldJzTEHYGYC69hKG\nb32qQxOgW8hquM1oT62ZqPAkuJqIfA3mioQhbHazwFeBr4FMYrwDp1d5d4C2zp5L\nn302jCSqyOt1Sd2TJR4Y\n=HVTk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T07:07:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/7bbe815a657c49a7aa931c17f13a333a3db2ce90","node_id":"C_kwDOTPF5RdoAKDdiYmU4MTVhNjU3YzQ5YTdhYTkzMWMxN2YxM2EzMzNhM2RiMmNlOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/f7355921c2ad3dcb4ac008b82148ad8481b198f8","sha":"f7355921c2ad3dcb4ac008b82148ad8481b198f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f7355921c2ad3dcb4ac008b82148ad8481b198f8"}],"sha":"7bbe815a657c49a7aa931c17f13a333a3db2ce90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/7bbe815a657c49a7aa931c17f13a333a3db2ce90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219442049?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PrathamReddy888","id":219442049,"login":"PrathamReddy888","node_id":"U_kgDODRRrgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PrathamReddy888","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f7355921c2ad3dcb4ac008b82148ad8481b198f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:05:58Z","email":"dprathamreddy3@gmail.com","name":"PrathamReddy888"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:05:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Dynamic Skill Endorsement System with attendance-verified, trust-weighted credentials (#3677) (#5343)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nImplements Issue #3677 — a LinkedIn-style Dynamic \"Skill Endorsement\"\nSystem that converts informal club volunteering into verified,\nrecruiter-facing professional credentials. A student who ran the A/V\nmixing board for 10 events can now have the event organizer officially\nendorse them for \"Audio Engineering\", with the endorsement\ncryptographically linked to the event they actually attended.\n\n### Architecture\n\n#### Database\n(`supabase/migrations/20280921000000_skill_endorsement_system.sql`)\n\n* **`skill_endorsements` table:** `(user_id, endorser_user_id, event_id,\nskill_tag, comment)` plus `endorser_weight`, `attendance_proof`, and\n`proof_digest`. `UNIQUE (user_id, endorser_user_id, skill_tag)` enforces\none endorsement per skill per endorser (re-endorsement upserts).\n* **Fake review prevention:** RLS grants no `INSERT`/`UPDATE` policies —\nthe only write path is the `endorse_volunteer_skill()` `SECURITY\nDEFINER` RPC. The RPC verifies that the volunteer actually attended\n(checked-in `event_rsvps` or an attended/late `shift_attendance_records`\noutcome), the event has ended, the endorsement happens within the 30-day\nwindow, the caller is the event organizer, and there is no\nself-endorsement.\n* **Cryptographic integrity:** Every row stores a `proof_digest`\ncomputed via SHA-256 over the canonical payload\n`skill_endorsement:v1|user|endorser|event|skill`. The\n`enforce_skill_endorsement_integrity` trigger recomputes it on every\nwrite and rejects any inconsistent row — even service-role writes.\n* **Trust weighting (`endorser_trust_weight()`):** Club\npresident/owner/admin = `1.00`, officer-tier = `0.85`, member = `0.60`,\nnon-member = `0.50` — an endorsement from the Club President outweighs a\npeer''s.\n* **Read RPCs:** `get_endorseable_volunteers()` (verified attendees for\nthe organizer UI), `get_user_skill_endorsements()` (public profile\nfeed), `get_skill_endorsement_summary()` (per-skill aggregate).\n* **Runtime adaptability:** Handles deployment drift gracefully\n(`club_roles.permissions_level` vs legacy `club_members.role`, optional\n`shift_attendance_records`).\n\n#### Frontend\n\n* **`src/lib/skillEndorsements.ts`:** Pure, unit-tested helpers for tag\nvalidation, trust weights, endorsement window checking, canonical digest\ncomputation (WebCrypto SHA-256 with a pure-JS FIPS 180-4 fallback),\naggregation, and recruiter link/summary builders.\n* **`src/components/events/SkillEndorsementPanel.tsx`:** Prompt\ndisplayed to organizers after an event ends (\"Would you like to endorse\nyour volunteers?\"). Enables selecting a verified volunteer,\nchoosing/entering a skill tag (e.g., \"Audio Engineering\"), and adding a\nnote (\"Alex ran the 32-channel mixer flawlessly\"). Displays the\norganizer''s live endorsement weight.\n* **`src/components/profile/SkillEndorsementsSection.tsx`:** Public\nprofile display featuring per-skill weighted scores with strength badges\n(*Emerging* / *Verified* / *Highly Verified*), endorser details with\nevent links, and client-side cryptographic proof re-verification (shield\nbadge).\n* **Recruiter Sharing:** Adds \"Copy Profile Link\" and \"Copy for\nRecruiters\" (resume-ready text summary) buttons on the student''s profile\ntailored for recruiter outreach.\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Coverage\n\n* [x] `skill_endorsements` table created with required schema\n* [x] Organizer prompted to endorse volunteers after event conclusion\n* [x] Organizer selects volunteer, skill tag, and adds optional note\n* [x] Public profile displays endorsements weighted by endorser trust\nscore (President > peer)\n* [x] \"Copy Profile Link\" tailored for recruiter sharing added\n* [x] Informal volunteering converted into verified, professional\ncredentials\n* [x] Endorsements cryptographically linked to actual event attendance\n(SHA-256 proof digest + attendance verification + integrity trigger) —\npreventing fake reviews\n* [x] Student employability enhanced through weighted, verified,\nshareable skills\n\n## Type of Change\n\n* [x] New Feature\n* [ ] Bug Fix\n* [ ] Documentation Update\n* [ ] Refactor\n* [ ] Performance Improvement\n* [x] Security Improvement\n* [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\n\nCloses #3677 \n\n## Testing\n\n* **Unit Tests:**\n`npx vitest run src/lib/skillEndorsements.test.ts`\n* Result: `Test Files 1 passed (1)` — `Tests 51 passed (51)`\n* Verified: Tag validation, trust tiers, 30-day window, SHA-256 against\nFIPS 180-4 reference vectors, tamper detection, aggregation, and\nrecruiter summary generation.\n\n\n* **Linting:**\n`npx eslint src/lib/skillEndorsements*.ts*\nsrc/components/events/SkillEndorsementPanel.tsx\nsrc/components/profile/SkillEndorsementsSection.tsx`\n* Result: `0 problems`\n\n\n* **Type Checking:**\n`npx tsc --noEmit`\n* Result: `0 errors` across all new and updated files.\n\n\n\n* [x] Tested locally\n* [x] Existing functionality verified\n* [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Screenshots\n\n*N/A (UI elements verified locally via test scenarios and component\ntests)*\n\n## Checklist\n\n* [x] Code follows project conventions\n* [x] Documentation updated where required\n* [x] No unnecessary files included\n* [x] Changes have been tested\n* [x] Ready for review\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added verified skill endorsements for volunteers after eligible\nevents.\n* Event organizers can endorse attendees with skill tags and optional\nnotes within 30 days.\n* Profiles now display weighted skill endorsements, verification\nstrength, endorsers, and related events.\n* Profile owners can copy recruiter-ready profile links and endorsement\nsummaries.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n* Added validation and verification for endorsement timing, attendance,\ncontent, and proof integrity.\n\n* **Tests**\n* Added coverage for endorsement validation, scoring, verification,\naggregation, and recruiter sharing.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"d493a3d09d7785d271464b28dbd45d538d83b6c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/d493a3d09d7785d271464b28dbd45d538d83b6c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/f7355921c2ad3dcb4ac008b82148ad8481b198f8","verification":{"payload":"tree d493a3d09d7785d271464b28dbd45d538d83b6c4\nparent ee3b716f50602e8475f86261f34155f456eeb104\nauthor PrathamReddy888 <dprathamreddy3@gmail.com> 1788159958 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788159958 +0530\n\nfeat: Dynamic Skill Endorsement System with attendance-verified, trust-weighted credentials (#3677) (#5343)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\n\nImplements Issue #3677 — a LinkedIn-style Dynamic \"Skill Endorsement\"\nSystem that converts informal club volunteering into verified,\nrecruiter-facing professional credentials. A student who ran the A/V\nmixing board for 10 events can now have the event organizer officially\nendorse them for \"Audio Engineering\", with the endorsement\ncryptographically linked to the event they actually attended.\n\n### Architecture\n\n#### Database\n(`supabase/migrations/20280921000000_skill_endorsement_system.sql`)\n\n* **`skill_endorsements` table:** `(user_id, endorser_user_id, event_id,\nskill_tag, comment)` plus `endorser_weight`, `attendance_proof`, and\n`proof_digest`. `UNIQUE (user_id, endorser_user_id, skill_tag)` enforces\none endorsement per skill per endorser (re-endorsement upserts).\n* **Fake review prevention:** RLS grants no `INSERT`/`UPDATE` policies —\nthe only write path is the `endorse_volunteer_skill()` `SECURITY\nDEFINER` RPC. The RPC verifies that the volunteer actually attended\n(checked-in `event_rsvps` or an attended/late `shift_attendance_records`\noutcome), the event has ended, the endorsement happens within the 30-day\nwindow, the caller is the event organizer, and