, and widget\nstate\n- Added comprehensive unit and integration tests\n\n## Testing\n\n- Distance calculation tests\n- Walking-distance threshold tests\n- Scooter radius tests\n- Scooter availability/battery tests\n- Provider error and timeout tests\n- Malformed-response tests\n- Deep-link tests\n- UI state tests where applicable\n\nCloses #5069","tree":{"sha":"391f58d5105a30f254c690d45357b3d9f95f5886","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/391f58d5105a30f254c690d45357b3d9f95f5886"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/b0cfb93a34dc0a216a822b5b8344d1b37e39071f","verification":{"payload":"tree 391f58d5105a30f254c690d45357b3d9f95f5886\nparent f1701695ad1ef700856974f7cbf69c8704646527\nauthor Lakshdeep Singh <lakshdeepofficial@gmail.com> 1788154771 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788154771 +0530\n\nIssue 5069 last mile scooter sync (#5341)\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements Issue #5069 by adding interactive last-mile micromobility\nsupport to event transit schedules.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added final-stop to venue walking-distance calculations\n- Added 0.5-mile last-mile threshold handling\n- Added 200-foot scooter discovery radius\n- Added Bird/Lime-compatible provider abstraction\n- Added scooter availability and battery filtering\n- Added actionable last-mile itinerary widget\n- Added provider-specific deep-link support\n- Added robust API/error handling\n- Added geographic coordinate validation\n- Added TypeScript types for transit, scooters, providers, and widget\nstate\n- Added comprehensive unit and integration tests\n\n## Testing\n\n- Distance calculation tests\n- Walking-distance threshold tests\n- Scooter radius tests\n- Scooter availability/battery tests\n- Provider error and timeout tests\n- Malformed-response tests\n- Deep-link tests\n- UI state tests where applicable\n\nCloses #5069","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlROTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfEo