oning and directional configuration\n- Added ray generation and intersection calculations\n- Added reflection and attenuation simulation\n- Added reverb/reflection warning detection\n- Added organizer recommendations for severe reflections\n- Added supporting types, utilities, and tests\n- Integrated the simulator with the existing event layout architecture\n\nCloses #5064","tree":{"sha":"3c60734519f1b79cce2b88cbe3bf1280f904e3f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/3c60734519f1b79cce2b88cbe3bf1280f904e3f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/f1701695ad1ef700856974f7cbf69c8704646527","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c60734519f1b79cce2b88cbe3bf1280f904e3f2\nparent d2a901043aff6ad772b471991896f50bff888c2e\nauthor Lakshdeep Singh <lakshdeepofficial@gmail.com> 1788150722 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788150722 +0530\n\nIssue 5064 3d acoustic ray tracing (#5340)\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements the interactive 3D acoustic ray-tracing simulator for event\nlayouts.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added acoustic surface absorption/reflection modeling\n- Added speaker positioning and directional configuration\n- Added ray generation and intersection calculations\n- Added reflection and attenuation simulation\n- Added reverb/reflection warning detection\n- Added organizer recommendations for severe reflections\n- Added supporting types, utilities, and tests\n- Integrated the simulator with the existing event layout architecture\n\nCloses #5064","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlQPCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVMAQACgT0Ce/hk1a1vfw2p9XoT40\n3F5hmJkCtJHNjjBcMPEp9rWxDwR2WBwu9zQN04yIoCa4ddYjY8Rgzacn2ftxmCRc\nIUAJPzcCYUrgoJhsetPfTKJ2Sg1Y+fXYfoI0M/XAg2pfAapFGqzH5EAS+pIxt68V\nKLkAkKbUlS70lUMgRGBQeEOR2DYO6hTyAyd0X/fw6E5Re6cxpKxw0pZOXlsGWSK3\nS7NIQs7rQTzv1TSnX2X6BMdlD+yBOmEc2FExIJuryFs5m7Ejx9g8v4BbkO1D2uzI\nF6Ch4k/ABfKwV3ttUINLnBazertmccNB2v31fKOm3sd5R+3lZ+QO16XNcjd33X49\nJ6ee/QqRVx