704646527"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159609181?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aakif-Kohari","id":159609181,"login":"Aakif-Kohari","node_id":"U_kgDOCYNxXQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/d2a901043aff6ad772b471991896f50bff888c2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:29:22Z","email":"kohariaakif@gmail.com","name":"Aakif Kohari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T04:29:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement automated data privacy video face blurring pipeline with audio redaction sync (Closes #5072) (#5339)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nSynchronizes the facial blurring pipeline with NLP Audio Redaction to\nensure complete PII removal. Pipes the video''s audio track through a\nSpeech-to-Text engine to generate a timestamped transcript, searches for\nthe deleted user''s name, extracts exact millisecond timestamps, and uses\nFFmpeg to surgically apply a `-af volume=0` mute filter to the audio\ntrack for that exact range. The final MP4 contains both a blurred face\nand a perfectly timed silence gap.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #5072\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"d59c222f589bba7192f198ef2282263f4675d8bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/d59c222f589bba7192f198ef2282263f4675d8bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/d2a901043aff6ad772b471991896f50bff888c2e","verification":{"payload":"tree d59c222f589bba7192f198ef2282263f4675d8bf\nparent c3ac2789a67c49e98d07b298633fdbbf859de836\nauthor Aakif Kohari <kohariaakif@gmail.com> 1788150562 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788150562 +0530\n\nfeat: implement automated data privacy video face blurring pipeline with audio redaction sync (Closes #5072) (#5339)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nSynchronizes the facial blurring pipeline with NLP Audio Redaction to\nensure complete PII removal. Pipes the video''s audio track through a\nSpeech-to-Text engine to generate a timestamped transcript, searches for\nthe deleted user''s name, extracts exact millisecond timestamps, and uses\nFFmpeg to surgically apply a `-af volume=0` mute filter to the audio\ntrack for that exact range. The final MP4 contains both a blurred face\nand a perfectly timed silence gap.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #5072\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project convention