ge":"Issue 5055 donation churn modeler (#5252)\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements #5055 — Real-Time \"Donation Goal\" Predictive Churn Modeler.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added donor engagement metric aggregation.\n- Added rolling 90-day interaction velocity tracking.\n- Added historical engagement baseline calculation.\n- Added churn-risk scoring and classification.\n- Added high-value donor eligibility checks.\n- Added configurable churn thresholds.\n- Added handling for insufficient and missing historical data.\n- Added donor churn-risk dashboard/API integration.\n- Added contributing-factor and engagement metrics.\n- Added automated high-risk donor follow-up workflow.\n- Added duplicate notification/task safeguards.\n- Added validation and authorization checks.\n- Added error handling for database and service failures.\n- Added comprehensive unit and integration tests.\n- Added edge-case coverage for zero baselines and boundary thresholds.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Ran linting and formatting.\n- Ran TypeScript/type checks.\n- Ran relevant automated tests.\n- Verified churn-risk calculations and notification safeguards.\n\nCloses #5055","tree":{"sha":"c0256f5e13c8f15d54a2580ab92e98ef6972ac34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/c0256f5e13c8f15d54a2580ab92e98ef6972ac34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/c3ac2789a67c49e98d07b298633fdbbf859de836","verification":{"payload":"tree c0256f5e13c8f15d54a2580ab92e98ef6972ac34\nparent 0f30c3e26386b42f793b3332203fb4b22a6d3557\nauthor Lakshdeep Singh <lakshdeepofficial@gmail.com> 1788147376 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788147376 +0530\n\nIssue 5055 donation churn modeler (#5252)\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements #5055 — Real-Time \"Donation Goal\" Predictive Churn Modeler.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Added donor engagement metric aggregation.\n- Added rolling 90-day interaction velocity tracking.\n- Added historical engagement baseline calculation.\n- Added churn-risk scoring and classification.\n- Added high-value donor eligibility checks.\n- Added configurable churn thresholds.\n- Added handling for insufficient and missing historical data.\n- Added donor churn-risk dashboard/API integration.\n- Added contributing-factor and engagement metrics.\n- Added automated high-risk donor follow-up workflow.\n- Added duplicate notification/task safeguards.\n- Added validation and authorization checks.\n- Added error handling for database and service failures.\n- Added comprehensive unit and integration tests.\n- Added edge-case coverage for zero baselines and boundary thresholds.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Ran linting and formatting.\n- Ran TypeScript/type checks.\n- Ran relevant automated tests.\n- Verified churn-risk calculations and notification safeguards.\n\nCloses #5055","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlPawCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT7MQAERie8SnVlGGJqG4E2W3Kl7q\nvo7qseuWy6/oLCL6D+EcEl7ZaCr5fPMda6PlQX5CVHGhWyhy2AaTWnR4PVfsuLI7\nABdvJQf7HvjXVRALD76vhm+i3Os+DvNxZfS5G1aMpesarWWduKLbglyJC+AxcLL5\nid+e048Owcp/GYxvhYXM17OdP5Ipj19JO8XoKRz6K01k5GYoPRFoLzfUKfwpiJTo\n7WPW5kf67It9mcZXfhSaEv4r8GZMcX/4oVdR4TSKoKsATC0DPvavX4hwp6tsRiOv\nVYrkiHD6d1dbO9/RpzhYvNd0zR2dQv1YVK2V+PYi7GntBq+KjO6BL87lYbR3clHa\nb28bF0v/4Z4py19NQyLbTLWqnAvJllRcaG/vtcxPzWX9GrqKURpL34BPdmvJU3dE\nr/zRHG9jTta8yQvIrmWoGc+HpUHT7e6d8gPjqNFHg9eJ5m16Gjozz2UhsYlttVwc\nR97hsiF9O2jf41J4BxEGAGJwoNayYcHYRjPNrm9GxT9vyo+dH42cKOHI84qF65gi\n8hq1KtmeZ7WCNdFVW8QRGOqGej9MgNLR4gg0CRyrCFRSr3W7oAhuLUvXhM9CK1MG\nYsK98DsTE4izMrksv6f6ckO5zFHcq31CPYctSuTo8BD3VeYjvpFnNbsh/IRWxQq6\nH6X2+NAw0KexJNQA39G9\n=B0na\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T03:36:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_