pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/0f30c3e26386b42f793b3332203fb4b22a6d3557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:36:12Z","email":"kohariaakif@gmail.com","name":"Aakif Kohari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:36:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement real-time accessibility need closed captioning sync for vods with speaker diarization (Closes #5066) (#5338)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nImplements Deepgram''s Speaker Diarization to automatically segment and\ncolor-code subtitles by speaker for multi-party events. Enables the\n`diarize=true` flag, parses the JSON response to group sentences by\nspeaker, and injects CSS classes into the VTT cues. The frontend Video\nPlayer applies distinct colors to each speaker class, providing deaf\nstudents with a visually distinct, conversational transcript.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [ ] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #5066\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"398e712a5fb1d4dea89d21fbd6354b6c7f9ca7eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/398e712a5fb1d4dea89d21fbd6354b6c7f9ca7eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/0f30c3e26386b42f793b3332203fb4b22a6d3557","