/users/Aakif-Kohari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aakif-Kohari","id":159609181,"login":"Aakif-Kohari","node_id":"U_kgDOCYNxXQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f0efa6faf8678f509e8afd99c81b30863bb04bff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:27:01Z","email":"kohariaakif@gmail.com","name":"Aakif Kohari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:27:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement automated waitlist promotion secondary ticket market price cap (Closes #4985) (#5337)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nEnforces an algorithmic \"Anti-Scalping\" Price Cap on the internal Ticket\nTransfer marketplace. Hardcodes a strict rule where the listing price\ncannot exceed 120% of the original face value. Processes transfers\nsecurely via Stripe Connect (refunding original, charging new), and\ninvalidates the original QR code while generating a cryptographically\nnew one to eliminate double-spend fraud at the door.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #4985\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"c5838e57e54a4ead8d9e6bfec90d2536c950c085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/c5838e57e54a4ead8d9e6bfec90d2536c950c085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/f0efa6faf8678f509e8afd99c81b30863bb04bff","verification":{"payload":"tree c5838e57e54a4ead8d9e6bfec90d2536c950c085\nparent 8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed\nauthor Aakif Kohari <kohariaakif@gmail.com> 1788146821 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788146821 +0530\n\nfeat: implement automated waitlist promotion secondary ticket market price cap (Closes #4985) (#5337)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nEnforces an algorithmic \"Anti-Scalping\" Price Cap on the internal Ticket\nTransfer marketplace. Hardcodes a strict rule where the listing price\ncannot exceed 120% of the original face value. Processes transfers\nsecurely via Stripe Connect (refunding original, charging new), and\ninvalidates the original QR code while generating a cryptographically\nnew one to eliminate double-spend fraud at the door.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #4985\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlPSFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHnEQAE7MtKEIqfO8tfbKLpzTCdgd\nTsHmDai6nHjoKUeVrXCTxBFdPGSBSFLs220c3QbLlwluhkUQ+j03IqaTba4L4Vqj\nSihpcxyNbMA2ergvAqNa