ps://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed"}],"sha":"f0efa6faf8678f509e8afd99c81b30863bb04bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f0efa6faf8678f509e8afd99c81b30863bb04bff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159609181?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aakif-Kohari","id":159609181,"login":"Aakif-Kohari","node_id":"U_kgDOCYNxXQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aakif-Kohari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:26:44Z","email":"kohariaakif@gmail.com","name":"Aakif Kohari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T03:26:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: implement interactive campus safety blue light phone map layer with spatial validation (Closes #4981) (#5336)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nIntegrates a spatial map layer showing all physical \"Blue Light\"\nemergency phones on the Event Canvas. Ingests GeoJSON data, renders\npermanent blue icons, and calculates the Haversine distance from the\nevent geofence to the nearest phone. If the distance exceeds 500 feet\nfor a night-time event, it triggers a hard block and requires the\norganizer to allocate budget for private security before approval.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #4981\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","tree":{"sha":"970812c67508d90fe08aa9448770a1aa9de9e845","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/970812c67508d90fe08aa9448770a1aa9de9e845"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 970812c67508d90fe08aa9448770a1aa9de9e845\nparent c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5\nauthor Aakif Kohari <kohariaakif@gmail.com> 1788146804 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788146804 +0530\n\nfeat: implement interactive campus safety blue light phone map layer with spatial validation (Closes #4981) (#5336)\n\n# Pull Request\n\n## Description\nIntegrates a spatial map layer showing all physical \"Blue Light\"\nemergency phones on the Event Canvas. Ingests GeoJSON data, renders\npermanent blue icons, and calculates the Haversine distance from the\nevent geofence to the nearest phone. If the distance exceeds 500 feet\nfor a night-time event, it triggers a hard block and requires the\norganizer to allocate budget for private security before approval.\n\n## Type of Change\n- [x] New Feature\n- [ ] Bug Fix\n- [ ] Documentation Update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [ ] Performance Improvement\n- [x] Security Improvement\n- [ ] Other\n\n## Related Issue\nCloses #4981\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested locally\n- [x] Existing functionality verified\n- [x] No new warnings or errors\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Code follows project conventions\n- [x] Documentation updated where required\n- [x] No unnecessary files included\n- [x] Changes have been tested\n- [x] Ready for review","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlPR0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtagQAKYy2jkNh+6e0aG2LJ7K274I\nR+shOX1OHrorMVK0VHAKY23cW6oJt5u/XwMAnWB6wjntnecy9EEOJjRXRxJuQ5s6\n7kITC8qmi654Skz8Hx3CZkV9dmpIOmCnAESkdB00bi1LidDjHTflu8HpRgRmcVCz\n3er5JzqBoyvl51sgFf420ECwn4gd5x9ftxZoSdrv5w1WZSYqZvYJicT7Tdb0zNvD\nIkxLKXSyqF/245jcl47hq0A6h7h3a29lUCInEVwcMqCRQ5SoZmc+iFezu2l5Dkwt\nHk7o10Gc6ONGmOYXWLtNXWWsb5IPkGYQHgWn5M+tUlhlUrPKNRajVZAAVrY1gLjh\n0g1dy/oZhCKFWc2Ihg4ir1ialjXNgcqVnkSQHIUot2g5SHs4mldk8eqO1kiNJBw/\n2fXvq4FZEdYyQyrXWUuqrzLTrY2Ep3K691e21cTtSWJa3OgX6jJM7Qa9mMVytt1u\nzOWXlEWq6K9XsWKPnCaj8tbYfBhygn9iZ9C/LUKZxtZR1ZYvg2c2Ggoka1b5cOM8\nictVrNtfhaKsNlMqCL8eq0xp8g3bqhrNGqMGsBl4Kc5IQCU3//JNlul6MtTRvbRN\n5bGhwNaYW49Li658t1x0ERgHqaJy2qGOyfeZTxMCfxvPMIRM1NZfRsRJ3zQYMMNw\naygk8fRWuCg2FfRO0Qwj\n=pCDy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T03:26:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed","node_id":"C_kwDOTPF5RdoAKDhjOWQwMjg1NTVkYzNkMTIzY2Y0MGUwNGNjNTA1MGI2OGMyMWUxZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5","sha":"c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5"}],"sha":"8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/8c9d028555dc3d123cf40e04cc5050b68c21e1ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226661509?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karan-chaos","id":226661509,"login":"karan-chaos","node_id":"U_kgDODYKUhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:46:01Z","email":"karannagpal11825@gmail.com","name":"karan-chaos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:46:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Campus Activity Insights Report (#5335)\n\ncloses #5334 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a full-page Campus Activity Insights Report for analyzing\ncampus activity trends, performance, utilization, and future RSVP\npatterns.\n\nFeatures\nActivity Insights\nAdded campus health score gauge.\nAdded key insights panel.\nAdded first-half vs second-half trend comparison.\nAdded club performance rankings.\nAdded location utilization analysis.\nAdded category breakdowns.\nPredictive Analytics\nAdded RSVP forecasting using linear regression.\nAdded 95% confidence bands to forecast visualizations.\nProvides a clear view of expected RSVP trends based on historical\nactivity.\nFiltering\n\nAdded filters for:\n\nClub.\nLocation.\nComparison mode.\n\nReport data and visualizations update according to the selected filters.\n\nExport\n\nAdded report export functionality in:\n\nCSV.\nJSON.\nTesting\nAdded 10 unit tests covering the major report functionality.\nAdded coverage for report sections and analytics behaviour.\nRouting\n\nRegistered the new insights report at:\n\n/analytics/insights\nFiles Changed\nsrc/hooks/useCampusActivityInsights.ts\nsrc/components/heatmap/TrendComparisonCard.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/PredictiveTrendChart.tsx\nsrc/pages/ActivityInsightsReport.tsx\nsrc/pages/ActivityInsightsReport.test.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/index.ts\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nThis feature provides organizers and users with a consolidated view of\ncampus activity health, historical trends, club and location\nperformance, category distribution, and predicted RSVP activity.\n\nBranch: feature/activity-insights-report\n\nCommit: bf489030 — feat(insights): add campus activity insights report\nwith trend analysis and predictions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"d37755b2176e2d8d25350963ffce1840970ab0ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/d37755b2176e2d8d25350963ffce1840970ab0ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5","verification":{"payload":"tree d37755b2176e2d8d25350963ffce1840970ab0ae\nparent f158390b57e24fcb1499213266b021543d3b9790\nauthor karan-chaos <karannagpal11825@gmail.com> 1788133561 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788133561 +0530\n\nAdd Campus Activity Insights Report (#5335)\n\ncloses #5334 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a full-page Campus Activity Insights Report for analyzing\ncampus activity trends, performance, utilization, and future RSVP\npatterns.\n\nFeatures\nActivity Insights\nAdded campus health score gauge.\nAdded key insights panel.\nAdded first-half vs second-half trend comparison.\nAdded club performance rankings.\nAdded location utilization analysis.\nAdded category breakdowns.\nPredictive Analytics\nAdded RSVP forecasting using linear regression.\nAdded 95% confidence bands to forecast visualizations.\nProvides a clear view of expected RSVP trends based on historical\nactivity.\nFiltering\n\nAdded filters for:\n\nClub.\nLocation.\nComparison mode.\n\nReport data and visualizations update according to the selected filters.\n\nExport\n\nAdded report export functionality in:\n\nCSV.\nJSON.\nTesting\nAdded 10 unit tests covering the major report functionality.\nAdded coverage for report sections and analytics behaviour.\nRouting\n\nRegistered the new insights report at:\n\n/analytics/insights\nFiles Changed\nsrc/hooks/useCampusActivityInsights.ts\nsrc/components/heatmap/TrendComparisonCard.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/PredictiveTrendChart.tsx\nsrc/pages/ActivityInsightsReport.tsx\nsrc/pages/ActivityInsightsReport.test.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/index.ts\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nThis feature provides organizers and users with a consolidated view of\ncampus activity health, historical trends, club and location\nperformance, category distribution, and predicted RSVP activity.\n\nBranch: feature/activity-insights-report\n\nCommit: bf489030 — feat(insights): add campus activity insights report\nwith trend analysis and predictions\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlMC5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkxkQABUkn2pHrrpofHhxWWqP/NMD\nTu199dUTZRwMH/Q/A38w41jtziDsXlBXOJYmrfcyFLWfzogDT33ZvO5P2cYd+O35\n060gVyku5/zoYrHwatf7YXgu5+v/u7VQjKB++QHImYvCDkqd9LAnhBr8qp+IKS4N\nf5SfyyZyIOho0wgSZRFMd5ECgMtE3C60nIf5us2bVAKZosWFiRXG5cexeu9VGaT6\n1BMTu8FtSnvGkZhU2Mqbu60dslDmGVpRUYgloPUHo0RV5kKaCSvjQ0svIBNsd9cN\n3eckJIvFh9QHxeFOCpX+MF6L4zviLxNb9fty49WkKaH18k2FQ1O/ynZ+oOsQlio+\nQTG3UrdR2ZqrnCHhM6kqrplKwjohksrGm5F5WMOlWf1iZ5eq386PI/hpGEiQ9Lj5\n+j9Qmza7Ex0XoAIFM8EZGx/MeAWfXa4jn+64oxd5IoRUutFJiY7cNNTbp5k7MMMp\nhS/Nvl5af46d9OSNpbPzbHtBB4eValloemtooCPcr9KQUH1N7ZsYxqrDrYKUzpC3\nht0emWm+bjjyTZmeP0JENOvEMkG78FlMul3fT433Hm031OHsYwf9n8+LHsAwdAps\nFO/nJkhmGMGb9cWXjiBHt6YwySzp0VceY0aZ3bCL75BYc6F0f961Quqk4znEK/LW\nB5XC3aFIFYEItu22Lpgn\n=XxXP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T23:46:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5","node_id":"C_kwDOTPF5RdoAKGMyNGJkMzQ2MDY1NzdhODYwNGMyYmU0OGQwZjkyMDk3NDY2MWM0YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commit/f158390b57e24fcb1499213266b021543d3b9790","sha":"f158390b57e24fcb1499213266b021543d3b9790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f158390b57e24fcb1499213266b021543d3b9790"}],"sha":"c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/c24bd34606577a8604c2be48d0f920974661c4b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226661509?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karan-chaos","id":226661509,"login":"karan-chaos","node_id":"U_kgDODYKUhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f158390b57e24fcb1499213266b021543d3b9790/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:19:10Z","email":"karannagpal11825@gmail.com","name":"karan-chaos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T23:19:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Campus Activity Heatmap Dashboard (#5333)\n\ncloses #5332 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a Campus Activity Heatmap Dashboard for visualizing event\nactivity, engagement, and RSVP patterns across campus locations, days,\nand time slots.\n\nFeatures\nActivity Heatmap\nAdded a day × hour heatmap showing campus event density.\nHover tooltips display:\nEvent counts.\nRSVP counts.\nFill rates.\nCategory breakdowns.\nAdded hot-zone weighting to generate realistic campus activity patterns.\nUses deterministic seeded data generation for reproducible results.\nAnalytics\n\nAdded multiple visualizations:\n\nLocation activity ranking bar chart.\nClub engagement donut chart.\nRSVP velocity trend with growth indicators.\nCategory distribution pie chart.\nCategory fill-rate comparisons.\n8 KPI summary cards covering aggregate campus activity.\nFiltering\n\nAdded interactive filters for:\n\nDays.\nEvent categories.\nVenues/locations.\n\nAll dashboard visualizations update based on the selected filters.\n\nComponents\n\nAdded reusable components:\n\nCampusActivityHeatmap\nTimeSlotGrid\nLocationActivityBar\nClubEngagementRing\nRSVPVelocityTrend\nCategoryBreakdown\nSummaryStatsCards\nHeatmapFilterBar\n\nAlso added a barrel export through src/components/heatmap/index.ts.\n\nHook & Utilities\nAdded activityHeatmap.ts for data generation, calculations, and\ncolor-scale logic.\nAdded useCampusActivity.ts for managing dashboard filters and derived\nstate.\nTesting\n\nAdded 25 test cases covering activity calculations, filtering, data\ngeneration, aggregation, and edge cases.\n\nRouting\n\nAdded a lazy-loaded dashboard route:\n\n/analytics/heatmap\nFiles Changed\nsrc/utils/activityHeatmap.ts\nsrc/hooks/useCampusActivity.ts\nsrc/components/heatmap/CampusActivityHeatmap.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/TimeSlotGrid.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/LocationActivityBar.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/ClubEngagementRing.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/RSVPVelocityTrend.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/CategoryBreakdown.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/SummaryStatsCards.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/HeatmapFilterBar.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/index.ts\nsrc/tests/activityHeatmap.test.ts\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nThis feature provides a centralized visual overview of campus activity,\nhelping users identify busy time slots, high-activity locations, popular\ncategories, club engagement, and RSVP trends.\n\nBranch: feature/campus-activity-heatmap\n\nCommit: 3ac5c00a — feat(analytics): add campus activity heatmap\ndashboard\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d4826f66c0c6516f320b211f7200b06042a69ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/5d4826f66c0c6516f320b211f7200b06042a69ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/f158390b57e24fcb1499213266b021543d3b9790","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d4826f66c0c6516f320b211f7200b06042a69ef\nparent 094866b37dbef8fec74ef0b14a8633f8bfb4a0cc\nauthor karan-chaos <karannagpal11825@gmail.com> 1788131950 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788131950 +0530\n\nAdd Campus Activity Heatmap Dashboard (#5333)\n\ncloses #5332 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a Campus Activity Heatmap Dashboard for visualizing event\nactivity, engagement, and RSVP patterns across campus locations, days,\nand time slots.\n\nFeatures\nActivity Heatmap\nAdded a day × hour heatmap showing campus event density.\nHover tooltips display:\nEvent counts.\nRSVP counts.\nFill rates.\nCategory breakdowns.\nAdded hot-zone weighting to generate realistic campus activity patterns.\nUses deterministic seeded data generation for reproducible results.\nAnalytics\n\nAdded multiple visualizations:\n\nLocation activity ranking bar chart.\nClub engagement donut chart.\nRSVP velocity trend with growth indicators.\nCategory distribution pie chart.\nCategory fill-rate comparisons.\n8 KPI summary cards covering aggregate campus activity.\nFiltering\n\nAdded interactive filters for:\n\nDays.\nEvent categories.\nVenues/locations.\n\nAll dashboard visualizations update based on the selected filters.\n\nComponents\n\nAdded reusable components:\n\nCampusActivityHeatmap\nTimeSlotGrid\nLocationActivityBar\nClubEngagementRing\nRSVPVelocityTrend\nCategoryBreakdown\nSummaryStatsCards\nHeatmapFilterBar\n\nAlso added a barrel export through src/components/heatmap/index.ts.\n\nHook & Utilities\nAdded activityHeatmap.ts for data generation, calculations, and\ncolor-scale logic.\nAdded useCampusActivity.ts for managing dashboard filters and derived\nstate.\nTesting\n\nAdded 25 test cases covering activity calculations, filtering, data\ngeneration, aggregation, and edge cases.\n\nRouting\n\nAdded a lazy-loaded dashboard route:\n\n/analytics/heatmap\nFiles Changed\nsrc/utils/activityHeatmap.ts\nsrc/hooks/useCampusActivity.ts\nsrc/components/heatmap/CampusActivityHeatmap.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/TimeSlotGrid.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/LocationActivityBar.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/ClubEngagementRing.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/RSVPVelocityTrend.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/CategoryBreakdown.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/SummaryStatsCards.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/HeatmapFilterBar.tsx\nsrc/components/heatmap/index.ts\nsrc/tests/activityHeatmap.test.ts\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nThis feature provides a centralized visual overview of campus activity,\nhelping users identify busy time slots, high-activity locations, popular\ncategories, club engagement, and RSVP trends.\n\nBranch: feature/campus-activity-heatmap\n\nCommit: 3ac5c00a — fea