22:44:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Personalized Event Recommendation Engine (#5331)\n\ncloses #5330 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a Personalized Event Recommendation Engine that recommends\nevents based on user preferences, similar-user behaviour, popularity,\nand recency.\n\nFeatures\nRecommendation Engine\nAdded recommendationEngine.ts.\nImplements a hybrid recommendation approach:\n40% content-based filtering.\n25% collaborative filtering.\n20% popularity.\n15% recency.\nUses cosine similarity for preference and event scoring.\nSupports recommendations across 10 event categories.\nBuilds user preference profiles and generates ranked recommendation\nsets.\nRecommendation Dashboard\n\nAdded a full-page /recommendations dashboard with four sections:\n\nTop Picks — highest-scoring personalized events.\nBecause You Liked — recommendations based on previous interests.\nTrending — popular events.\nHidden Gems — relevant events with lower overall popularity.\nUser Controls & Insights\nAdded user preference sidebar.\nAdded recommendation filters.\nAdded scoring breakdown insights to explain recommendation rankings.\nAdded interactive RSVP and bookmark actions.\nComponents\n\nAdded reusable components:\n\nUserPreferenceCard\nRecommendedEventCard\nRecommendationInsights\nRecommendationFilters\nEventRecommendationEngine\nData\nAdded 16 mock events covering all supported categories.\nAdded useEventRecommendations.ts hook for recommendation state and data\nhandling.\nTesting\n\nAdded comprehensive tests covering:\n\nVector creation.\nCosine similarity calculations.\nRecommendation scoring.\nUser profile building.\nRecommendation set construction.\nRanking behaviour.\nEdge cases.\nFiles Changed\nsrc/utils/recommendationEngine.ts\nsrc/hooks/useEventRecommendations.ts\nsrc/components/recommendations/UserPreferenceCard.tsx\nsrc/components/recommendations/RecommendedEventCard.tsx\nsrc/components/recommendations/RecommendationInsights.tsx\nsrc/components/recommendations/RecommendationFilters.tsx\nsrc/components/recommendations/EventRecommendationEngine.tsx\nsrc/components/recommendations/index.ts\nsrc/components/recommendations/__tests__/recommendationEngine.test.ts\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nUsers can now discover events tailored to their interests while still\nseeing trending and less-obvious events, with transparent recommendation\ninsights and direct RSVP/bookmark actions.\n\nBranch: feature/event-recommendation-engine\n\nCommit: 7d9bc618 — feat(recommendations): add personalized event\nrecommendation engine\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added an event recommendation dashboard with personalized event\nsuggestions.\n  * Added filters for category, price, rating, and date range.\n* Added event cards with match scores, recommendation reasons, details,\nand RSVP, bookmark, and skip actions.\n* Added user preference insights, scoring visualizations, and\nrecommendation sections including Top Picks, Trending, and Hidden Gems.\n* Added dedicated routes for attendance analytics and event\nrecommendations.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"dce7f50b7f5e0beb42129701db26b6e22da08fa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/dce7f50b7f5e0beb42129701db26b6e22da08fa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/094866b37dbef8fec74ef0b14a8633f8bfb4a0cc","verification":{"payload":"tree dce7f50b7f5e0beb42129701db26b6e22da08fa3\nparent 237f88a292fab61d332e348b2920c8a6fa947c82\nauthor karan-chaos <karannagpal11825@gmail.com> 1788129872 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788129872 +0530\n\nAdd Personalized