RecommendationEngine.tsx\nsrc/components/recommendations/index.ts\nsrc/components/recommendations/__tests__/recommendationEngine.test.ts\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nUsers can now discover events tailored to their interests while still\nseeing trending and less-obvious events, with transparent recommendation\ninsights and direct RSVP/bookmark actions.\n\nBranch: feature/event-recommendation-engine\n\nCommit: 7d9bc618 — feat(recommendations): add personalized event\nrecommendation engine\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added an event recommendation dashboard with personalized event\nsuggestions.\n  * Added filters for category, price, rating, and date range.\n* Added event cards with match scores, recommendation reasons, details,\nand RSVP, bookmark, and skip actions.\n* Added user preference insights, scoring visualizations, and\nrecommendation sections including Top Picks, Trending, and Hidden Gems.\n* Added dedicated routes for attendance analytics and event\nrecommendations.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlLJQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPigQAESx/Fb8Lc1t/QeV7iRYeQQQ\nqnQGi/koHZBuWw+sl7sOWWF36PbLhn1FhkaeNMGa7Txp7QMuRcgNNtJwg/xt1xno\nar6+g+II/zsPioqHxHtGO/OvsYHPBZtmxzy31K55btEDje5QrPjCdbtLSLF8S4tL\nH7KBSa1Bok94xoQliZWYwoyeSXTZFDLxUi2hPOQHFSb4pwFvPMAU50GNC+JF46Xh\n9jjUJEZXt9Nn4vqmptYKarghJf3N86JFoiwpaT26t3TIiNYCT5XtnQzETNqjDvsF\nFSONfM32WXQnhslJ5fWntiW75hMq3wjyZvAc1wshSn/MUQHKwAteVNZu1XggBcFk\nMIian6nAI0URsAZROyiUv8Q2eDObB83YeFCs71cg1RwF7vyNQSlICj3ZqJbuH5lV\nnuVvx56Aplgl9KeTxruMnvFaf+q6ml0nTVvr7cycGsNv3KpdDFp8VjGBaSgQxzM3\nq1Kogwl9fteIq6nTZz/4VflE5rUZ4BxcmCY1UrvLZA4R