followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karan-chaos","id":226661509,"login":"karan-chaos","node_id":"U_kgDODYKUhQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karan-chaos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/237f88a292fab61d332e348b2920c8a6fa947c82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:38:08Z","email":"karannagpal11825@gmail.com","name":"karan-chaos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:38:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add Event Attendance Analytics Dashboard (#5329)\n\ncloses #5328 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a full-page Event Attendance Analytics Dashboard for\nmonitoring attendance trends, event performance, participation patterns,\nand no-show behaviour.\n\nFeatures\nAnalytics Dashboard\nAdded a dedicated /analytics/attendance page.\nAdded 8 KPI cards for key attendance metrics.\nAdded interactive attendance trend visualization with dual-line/area\ncharts.\nAdded category distribution using an interactive donut chart.\nAdded sortable top-events table for comparing event performance.\nAdded a 7×24 attendance heatmap to visualize activity by day and hour.\nAdded no-show analysis with:\nBar chart.\nNo-show metrics.\nInsight cards.\nFiltering\n\nAdded an analytics filter bar supporting:\n\n7-day range.\n30-day range.\n90-day range.\n1-year range.\nAll-time range.\nCategory filtering.\nClub filtering.\n\nDashboard metrics and visualizations update based on the selected\nfilters.\n\nData & Utilities\nAdded attendanceAnalytics.ts for analytics calculations and data\nprocessing.\nAdded useAttendanceAnalytics.ts for dashboard state and analytics\nhandling.\nIncluded 24 mock events across 10 categories for realistic dashboard\ndata.\nAdded CSV export functionality for filtered attendance data.\nUI Components\n\nCreated reusable analytics components:\n\nAttendanceKpiCards\nAttendanceTrendChart\nCategoryPieChart\nTopEventsTable\nAttendanceHeatmapChart\nNoShowAnalysis\nAnalyticsFilterBar\nAttendanceAnalyticsDashboard\n\nComponents use React, TypeScript, Recharts, and Framer Motion.\n\nTesting\n\nAdded comprehensive dashboard tests covering analytics behaviour and\ncomponent functionality.\n\nFiles Changed\nsrc/utils/attendanceAnalytics.ts\nsrc/hooks/useAttendanceAnalytics.ts\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceKpiCards.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceTrendChart.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/CategoryPieChart.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/TopEventsTable.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceHeatmapChart.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/NoShowAnalysis.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AnalyticsFilterBar.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceAnalyticsDashboard.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/index.ts\nsrc/components/analytics/__tests__/AttendanceAnalyticsDashboard.test.tsx\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nThis feature gives organizers and administrators a centralized view of\nevent attendance, category performance, participation trends, peak\nactivity periods, and no-show behaviour, with filtering and CSV export\nfor further analysis.\n\nBranch: feature/event-attendance-analytics-dashboard\n\nCommit: 3c57101e — feat(analytics): add event attendance analytics\ndashboard\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"de3b14095602515f92ffd2fbab71f604f8d4fd75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/de3b14095602515f92ffd2fbab71f604f8d4fd75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/237f88a292fab61d332e348b2920c8a6fa947c82","verification":{"payload":"tree de3b14095602515f92ffd2fbab71f604f8d4fd75\nparent f99f26d4e52c021fa375750a02090c360fa1ab6f\nauthor karan-chaos <karannagpal11825@gmail.com> 1788129488 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788129488 +0530\n\nAdd Event Attendance Analytics Dashboard (#5329)\n\ncloses #5328 \nSummary\n\nThis PR adds a full-page Event Attendance Analytics Dashboard for\nmonitoring attendance trends, event performance, participation patterns,\nand no-show behaviour.\n\nFeatures\nAnalytics Dashboard\nAdded a dedicated /analytics/attendance page.\nAdded 8 KPI cards for key attendance metrics.\nAdded interactive attendance trend visualization with dual-line/area\ncharts.\nAdded category distribution using an interactive donut chart.\nAdded sortable top-events table for comparing event performance.\nAdded a 7×24 attendance heatmap to visualize activity by day and hour.\nAdded no-show analysis with:\nBar chart.\nNo-show metrics.\nInsight cards.\nFiltering\n\nAdded an analytics filter bar supporting:\n\n7-day range.\n30-day range.\n90-day range.\n1-year range.\nAll-time range.\nCategory filtering.\nClub filtering.\n\nDashboard metrics and visualizations update based on the selected\nfilters.\n\nData & Utilities\nAdded attendanceAnalytics.ts for analytics calculations and data\nprocessing.\nAdded useAttendanceAnalytics.ts for dashboard state and analytics\nhandling.\nIncluded 24 mock events across 10 categories for realistic dashboard\ndata.\nAdded CSV export functionality for filtered attendance data.\nUI Components\n\nCreated reusable analytics components:\n\nAttendanceKpiCards\nAttendanceTrendChart\nCategoryPieChart\nTopEventsTable\nAttendanceHeatmapChart\nNoShowAnalysis\nAnalyticsFilterBar\nAttendanceAnalyticsDashboard\n\nComponents use React, TypeScript, Recharts, and Framer Motion.\n\nTesting\n\nAdded comprehensive dashboard tests covering analytics behaviour and\ncomponent functionality.\n\nFiles Changed\nsrc/utils/attendanceAnalytics.ts\nsrc/hooks/useAttendanceAnalytics.ts\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceKpiCards.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceTrendChart.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/CategoryPieChart.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/TopEventsTable.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceHeatmapChart.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/NoShowAnalysis.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AnalyticsFilterBar.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/AttendanceAnalyticsDashboard.tsx\nsrc/components/analytics/index.ts\nsrc/components/analytics/__tests__/AttendanceAnalyticsDashboard.test.tsx\nsrc/App.tsx\nImpact\n\nThis feature gives organizers and administrators a centralized view of\nevent attendance, category performance, participation trends, peak\nactivity periods, and no-show behaviour, with filtering and CSV export\nfor further analysis.\n\nBranch: feature/event-attendance-analytics-dashboard\n\nCommit: 3c57101e — feat(analytics): add event attendance analytics\ndashboard\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: krushit1307 <kp7802829544@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlLDQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaHUQAAE4SWTWNsJlYxdT6MqdEgnP\nbndj79k+m/NFPuO73izPNmcq1ZKE2vLWGsxr9c8EbwYlVJj9QdxqeNpfh8l7ztQN\nqodGE4J2pyRcu62fOcLVD493+njVBuDtzah6MVny0anCPRkeZW9GTUGYMKic3Ixb\nabxhPETb5uHHEFfSc4DHUGkbnlhzcrGuUECWVgsX51cHkIDAUc1SkzJ+Yd9YuZOD\nTHDtt8U4NPEtWnW2b8bB77TMGNYSIJj+9AbODG+UFozjXOQ5FGY0UmNFUM1Ytuc3\nx7WtepzTXBgwIsTlkkhuaPwMRV24ErSfeaG7fR3SNEI+JPB8oppKpVCWnaC1pBkG\nKBu0748bMD2sxe8X6UlAMGIts12EPdCM8jtC4Ee9AfqaEE9XGmq/cGlLPEq