ars.githubusercontent.com/u/183577111?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sanjana2505006","id":183577111,"login":"sanjana2505006","node_id":"U_kgDOCvEqFw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanjana2505006","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/commits/f99f26d4e52c021fa375750a02090c360fa1ab6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T21:59:50Z","email":"sanju250506@gmail.com","name":"Sanjana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T21:59:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/ble proximity checkin (#5327)\n\nCloses #5283\n\n### Description\nThis PR introduces the \"Walk-Through\" proximity-based check-in system\nutilizing Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) to eliminate QR code scanning\nbottlenecks at large events.\n\n**Key Architecture & Implementation:**\n- [ ] Implement BLE beacon broadcasting for the Bouncer iPad view.\n- [ ] Implement background beacon detection in the mobile app.\n- [ ] Secure cryptographic edge handshake over BLE to verify RSVP\nstatus.\n- [ ] RSSI spatial triangulation to confirm the attendee is within a\n2-foot radius of the door.\n- [ ] Auto-trigger UI updates (flashing green profile) for verified\nattendees.\n\n### Type of Change\n- [x] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n\n### UI Changes\n*(Leave blank for now, but add screenshots or screen recordings here\nonce the Bouncer iPad UI and attendee states are implemented!)*\n\n### Testing Instructions\n1. Run the app on two devices with Bluetooth enabled (one acting as the\nBouncer iPad, one as the attendee).\n2. Ensure the attendee device is logged into an account with an active\nRSVP.\n3. Bring the attendee device within 2 feet of the Bouncer device to\nverify the frictionless check-in triggers automatically.","tree":{"sha":"2c7dffd0b622783656972ba4f5cdc8e5e84a85e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/2c7dffd0b622783656972ba4f5cdc8e5e84a85e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/f99f26d4e52c021fa375750a02090c360fa1ab6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c7dffd0b622783656972ba4f5cdc8e5e84a85e3\nparent 1d9f2511d734173c8836f225063baf13e1e9f8ee\nauthor Sanjana <sanju250506@gmail.com> 1788127190 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788127190 +0530\n\nFeat/ble proximity checkin (#5327)\n\nCloses #5283\n\n### Description\nThis PR introduces the \"Walk-Through\" proximity-based check-in system\nutilizing Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) to eliminate QR code scanning\nbottlenecks at large events.\n\n**Key Architecture & Implementation:**\n- [ ] Implement BLE beacon broadcasting for the Bouncer iPad view.\n- [ ] Implement background beacon detection in the mobile app.\n- [ ] Secure cryptographic edge handshake over BLE to verify RSVP\nstatus.\n- [ ] RSSI spatial triangulation to confirm the attendee is within a\n2-foot radius of the door.\n- [ ] Auto-trigger UI updates (flashing green profile) for verified\nattendees.\n\n### Type of Change\n- [x] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n\n### UI Changes\n*(Leave blank for now, but add screenshots or screen recordings here\nonce the Bouncer iPad UI and attendee states are implemented!)*\n\n### Testing Instructions\n1. Run the app on two devices with Bluetooth enabled (one acting as the\nBouncer iPad, one as the attendee).\n2. Ensure the attendee device is logged into an account with an active\nRSVP.\n3. Bring the attendee device within 2 feet of the Bouncer device to\nverify the frictionless check-in triggers automatically.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlKfWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/WEQAFaXG0UDlJP1TaXHLIFpIoLu\n/NMusE3xGd/Ap9NPYC3rHIrzqCTCbLWffMv5lU4VvvjwQzlvLJfboptPXM/4ICfb\n9ylzaXkf9zGUo5cpaPMuPqFTJPujMAhqvr/nglCliQDbJvtERGqQg3N6zoULN4ID\nM+QkGn1hjBv76xD9h+VUj9Sxje7r0MYRLKewBRzwqc+pj9+QgPPbU1ZS8mDCOlvz\nUJMTcwb73/ESNMn1XGq1kQvifvwQgb6Tg7VPtcLbxdTANptgJcz33c2WRhpUpwjq\nqgK0mJ9GtHOWsqP0d+HTXdMRc/j6F+XUwj2KugDvIrkZQ8li1RdNB8Ifoek7ydik\nGKEvTx1rb3h1wy6+9kXaxIRj7gi53PeXzvnHp33tdjC+UHoITvwR6nK+WLMxtpCI\nf5J+AVS+RlUrJLwUHJ831lwjnd3i4Qdlz46ZchOOh+9FdAG8+i8wr1C5rBfTgPKv\n1Nl/LQqAxY/LXpadb3jnSKmOaw2BVaddcDP4vin5az1pRQmOfWuBf8m7ku0BQKyk\n3KP95JTf8VgXsBm3fg3tyP3NGwHYJbgQezV8AQ19udwt2ql+P5Afq437EoqBx/HB\nWrGr5jwmx8DUWiRduF0yI34224FaAABlLH7q4eJMVHhRiv+KGUdrwwDKFkU5+brZ\njuu5uppQJHR5yOtPzwik\n=H5L1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T21:59:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gi