oast\n\nCloses https://github.com/krushit1307/CampusConnect/issues/4735\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n* Added event-specific checkout pages accessible through checkout links.\n* Added live checkout activity indicators showing the number of viewers.\n* Added notifications when tickets are purchased, including remaining\nticket availability.\n* Added real-time updates for purchases made through supported checkout\nmethods.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n* Buyers are excluded from receiving notifications about their own\npurchases.\n* **Tests**\n* Added coverage for viewer counts, purchase notifications, and\nremaining-ticket calculations.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"ecd1a78cddbbc780ea99bb1981b687ea5b0c1381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/trees/ecd1a78cddbbc780ea99bb1981b687ea5b0c1381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krushit1307/CampusConnect/git/commits/7150dda6461bb90600034fa8e106d5bedd0d3763","verification":{"payload":"tree ecd1a78cddbbc780ea99bb1981b687ea5b0c1381\nparent 1b9b035b4b1ba4de1e5fe335db39ca5db6097ad9\nauthor Sanjana <sanju250506@gmail.com> 1788121785 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788121785 +0530\n\nfeat: add early bird checkout social proof counter (#5323)\n\n## Summary\n- Join a checkout WebSocket presence channel on /checkout/:event_id and\nbroadcast the live viewer count.\n- Show a pulsing badge: 14 people are looking at this ticket right now.\n- Listen for ticket_purchased and toast other viewers: Someone just\nbought a ticket! Only 5 left!\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `npx vitest run src/lib/earlyBirdSocialProof.test.ts`\n- [ ] Open /checkout/:event_id in two browsers and confirm the pulsing\nviewer count updates\n- [ ] Complete a ticket purchase and confirm other checkout viewers see\nthe remaining-tickets toast\n\nCloses https://github.com/krushit130