repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commit/1cbba8819d0cea9d75903d579802f9a0e9c8397b","node_id":"C_kwDOTPH6GNoAKDFjYmJhODgxOWQwY2VhOWQ3NTkwM2Q1Nzk4MDJmOWEwZTljODM5N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commit/d84f1dca00db436459f85cd465ff76a256848d80","sha":"d84f1dca00db436459f85cd465ff76a256848d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/d84f1dca00db436459f85cd465ff76a256848d80"}],"sha":"1cbba8819d0cea9d75903d579802f9a0e9c8397b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/1cbba8819d0cea9d75903d579802f9a0e9c8397b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/d84f1dca00db436459f85cd465ff76a256848d80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T05:11:21Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T05:11:21Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"feat: Evidence Vault + Chain-of-Custody + Live Stream pipeline\n\nevidence_vault.py (new):\n- Content-addressed storage (SHA-256 deduplication)\n- Immutable chain-of-custody: every detection/classification/DMCA/review\n  creates a chained custody event (prev_hash → current_hash)\n- Tamper detection: verify_custody_chain() recomputes every hash\n- Artifacts: thumbnail.jpg, clip_embedding.npy, sentinel_result.json,\n  audio_fingerprint.json, forensics_chain.json, dmca_notice.txt, contract.json\n- Dual storage: local ./evidence_vault/ + GCS (EVIDENCE_BUCKET env var)\n- Delta sync: skips re-upload if hash matches\n- Atomic writes: .tmp → os.replace() for crash safety\n- Export: ZIP bundle with all artifacts + manifest + custody log\n- Live stream segments: independent evidence packages per 30s segment\n\nlive_stream.py (new):\n- Parallel pipeline: Embed + Audio run concurrently per segment\n  (not sequential — designed for continuous ingestion)\n- StreamMonitor: extraction → embed+audio → scan → alert\n- Each 30s segment flows independently through all pipeline stages\n- Segment latency: detection in ~30s, not after full stream ends\n- StreamRegistry: tracks active monitors, results, stop/start\n- Segments packaged to evidence vault immediately (fire-and-forget)\n\nmain.py:\n- POST /evidence/{id}/package_detection — called by swarm (non-blocking)\n- GET/POST /evidence/{id} — summary, custody, export, sync\n- POST/DELETE/GET /stream/* — live stream monitoring endpoints\n\nserver/routes/stream.js + evidence.js (new):\n- Node.js proxy routes for live stream + evidence vault\n- stream.js polls FastAPI every 10s and emits Socket.IO events\n\nserver/app.js:\n- Register streamRouter + evidenceRouter\n\nserver/controllers/swarmController.js:\n- Auto-package detection evidence after each sentinel scan\n- Fire-and-forget: never blocks swarm pipeline on vault failure\n\nBackend/.env.example:\n- EVIDENCE_BUCKET: GCS bucket for artifact storage","tree":{"sha":"a5c19e7ae1ab86943cb5f37c789ed9db3382bed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/trees/a5c19e7ae1ab86943cb5f37c789ed9db3382bed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/commits/d84f1dca00db436459f85cd465ff76a256848d80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commit/d84f1dca00db436459f85cd465ff76a256848d80","node_id":"C_kwDOTPH6GNoAKGQ4NGYxZGNhMDBkYjQzNjQ1OWY4NWNkNDY1ZmY3NmEyNTY4NDhkODA","parents":[{"htm