rl":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/6253b45303d3d3595efafe513d1d99baba6bbbcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:02:29Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:02:29Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"fix: add scipy + google-cloud-storage to requirements, add .env.example\n\nrequirements.txt:\n- scipy: required by forensics.py (DCT via scipy.fft.dctn) and\n  train_forensics.py (same). Was missing — would cause ImportError at runtime.\n- google-cloud-storage: required by train_forensics.py GCS upload and\n  forensics.py _load_model_weights() GCS fallback when gsutil unavailable.\n\nBackend/.env.example:\n- Documents all env vars including new forensics ones:\n  FORENSICS_MODEL_PATH, FORENSICS_MODEL_GCS, GCS_BUCKET\n- Clear instructions for each var","tree":{"sha":"c79268aaaf538ff0c5d4f9960ef85c40f8fa578d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/trees/c79268aaaf538ff0c5d4f9960ef85c40f8fa578d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/commits/6253b45303d3d3595efafe513d1d99baba6bbbcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418