ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:53:07Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:53:07Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"feat: production training script for forensics model\n\ntrain_forensics.py:\n- Clean, self-contained training script (no Colab boilerplate)\n- Auto-downloads R-SMUD dataset (~8GB) from loki.disi.unitn.it\n- Full SND model (AFT encoder + LCD decoder) matching Su et al. 2025\n- AMP (float16) training on GPU for 2-3x speedup on T4/A100\n- Auto-resume from latest checkpoint on restart\n- Stratified split (train/val/test) preserved across resumes\n- Uploads best.pth to GCS if GCS_BUCKET env var is set\n- Prints gap vs paper reference (C1/C2/C3 accuracy)\n\nUsage:\n  python train_forensics.py                  (local GPU)\n  GCS_BUCKET=my-bucket python train_forensics.py  (auto-upload)\n\nAfter training:\n  FORENSICS_MODEL_GCS=gs://my-bucket/forensics/best.pth\n  → forensics agent auto-switches heuristic → neural (95% accuracy)","tree":{"sha":"292da1d416f4d61fa6049237740d58e52fdf8654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/trees/292da1d416f4d61fa6049237740d58e52fdf8654"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/commits/14ccdd3b8c96a07b3e8a9973575ffa5f0af3b2a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"ht