.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/ebb9aa2d8f30121cbba136b7077e7f584cd813f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T15:59:22Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T15:59:22Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"fix: ensure full system compatibility with MobileNetV3 model\n\n- archivist.py: fixed-seed (42) orthogonal projection matrix so vault\n  embeddings are DETERMINISTIC across server restarts — without this,\n  vault vectors from previous runs are incompatible with new projection\n- sentinel.py: recalibrate thresholds for MobileNetV3 cosine similarity\n  distribution (MATCH=0.90, SUSPECT=0.75 vs CLIP''s 0.82/0.65)\n  Remove all CLIP references from comments\n- vault/faiss_vault.index: deleted — old CLIP 512-dim vectors are\n  incompatible with MobileNetV3 embeddings, must re-ingest\n- vault/vault_metadata.json: cleared — stale CLIP metadata removed","tree":{"sha":"a62b690ac78e80d4cc0bf43614225326887a3c50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/trees/a62b690ac78e80d4cc0bf43614225326887a3c50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/git/commits/ebb9aa2d8f30121cbba136b7077e7f584cd813f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180258418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/follow