://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KaranGupta2005","id":180258418,"login":"KaranGupta2005","node_id":"U_kgDOCr6Gcg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaranGupta2005","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/haritchhabra/SportsMedia-piracy-protector/commits/806a23765ad3583c47a33730df8482d333bdfb6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T13:25:03Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T13:25:03Z","email":"guptakaran.port@gmail.com","name":"KaranGupta_2006"},"message":"fix: ingest persistence, CLIP RAM optimisation, swarm bot detection bypass\n\n- main.py: replace in-memory _ingest_jobs dict with file-backed store\n  in /tmp/mediaguard_jobs/ — jobs now survive Render process restarts\n- archivistController.js: fail fast on 404 during polling instead of\n  retrying forever when FastAPI restarts mid-ingest\n- archivist.py: float16 CLIP (350MB->175MB RAM), batch embedding (8x\n  faster), 10s sample interval (3x fewer frames), resize frames to 224px\n- requirements.txt + Dockerfile.fastapi: remove torchvision (unused,\n  ~200MB), add Node.js 20 for yt-dlp JS runtime\n- spider.py: pass cookies to search queries, smarter fallback when\n  yt-dlp fails on official URL (cloud IP bot detection)\n- swarmController.js: accept official_title in request body, priority\n  order: request > ingested asset > yt-dlp extraction\n- ThreatHunter.jsx: add title input field with auto-fill from ingested\n