https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/ba8e1bf5a36e01f2061576a29dd9e8198156cd1c","sha":"ba8e1bf5a36e01f2061576a29dd9e8198156cd1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/ba8e1bf5a36e01f2061576a29dd9e8198156cd1c"}],"sha":"10e0f1d29f82526eeaa484ee8660fb6b3d152ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/10e0f1d29f82526eeaa484ee8660fb6b3d152ea1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81605929?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abdulrahmancodes","id":81605929,"login":"abdulrahmancodes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNjA1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/ba8e1bf5a36e01f2061576a29dd9e8198156cd1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T23:10:55Z","email":"81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdul Rahman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T23:10:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(docs): self-clean orphans and surface failed languages in i18n … (#22278)\n\n## Summary\nTwo robustness fixes to `docs-i18n-pull.yaml` so localized docs can''t\nsilently drift:\n\n1. **Prune orphan localized files.** The pull only adds/updates files,\nnever deletes — so localized copies of renamed/moved/deleted English\npages linger and serve dead URLs (recently ~113 of them). A new\n`prune-orphan-translations` script (run with `--apply` in the workflow,\non real pulls only) removes any `l/<lang>/**` file whose English source\nno longer exists.\n2. **Surface per-language download failures.** The loop previously\nswallowed failures with `|| echo \"Warning...\"`, so a language whose\nCrowdin server-side build fails (e.g. `ja`, failing at 79%) was skipped\n*silently* and froze indefinitely while every other language updated. We\nnow collect failures, still commit the languages that succeeded, and\n**fail the run at the end** so a broken language is visible.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d01edc2f08dccaf136f2cd8a578250026b8a862a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/d01edc2f08dccaf136f2cd8a578250026b8a862a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/ba8e1bf5a36e01f2061576a29dd9e8198156cd1c","verification":{"payload":"tree d01edc2f08dccaf136f2cd8a578250026b8a862a\nparent b1a781fbd9245f45efd84ef8a2d3b226a3319655\nauthor Abdul Rahman <81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com> 1782774655 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782774655 +0530\n\nchore(docs): self-clean orphans and surface failed languages in i18n … (#22278)\n\n## Summary\nTwo robustness fixes to `docs-i18n-pull.yaml` so localized docs can''t\nsilently drift:\n\n1. **Prune orphan localized files.** The pull only adds/updates files,\nnever deletes — so localized copies of renamed/moved/deleted English\npages linger and serve dead URLs (recently ~113 of them). A new\n`prune-orphan-translations` script (run with `--apply` in the workflow,\non real pulls only) removes any `l/<lang>/**` file whose English source\nno longer exists.\n2. **Surface per-language download failures.** The loop previously\nswallowed failures with `|| echo \"Warning...\"`, so a language whose\nCrowdin server-side build fails (e.g. `ja`, failing at 79%) was skipped\n*silently* and froze indefinitely while every other language updated. We\nnow collect failures, still commit the languages that succeeded, and\n**fail the run at the end** so a broken language is visible.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQvt/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgVQQAAb3XQZ5vjiteVjDzgy707dR\niig58oRpskZ+L2v5jAZGc/XbcJCjkwLMlqezuP6/Ov9urzHBI5glCGAQEBfCTCHi\nJn3Gs05ou1ZWmjg7qaKeB5h0UqCxpQS/Tv15f2udxgYIweyTMBFeAo89nun+k0Nc\nFx4D67nODTFy/mwEpgUiOnwsk9B+zRicEl15Llh0JNPPnbAMqO8liyrCkRint++S\nAMsbtHADVpNBvG1UfmeyvomR2KKJWyLGH5uAMdVCUrRYiMYu2qreUC0HRxksHvkK\nB3iLDyxseXf8I5Doic2rdNCcCNS49gdMNk6yiRbBKiok/ipXKhZ3pjdsK6MPoGHt\n5P7X0Dive60E4AKMqbiLLDtdwpgTdfCgVaEAolbWAvVdmmCiSZG/2IZybX+FUKt9\nbmkFYL+NYANHePurGqo4g1L0el/0/85TlOlLb1lgc5CtxwFVffLdNIfs+c6Gxl3i\nSAAxWNvbC1G70iT60k9uA3T/KaLHhJOQvsfsgfNgp4fZdesRl/dc7Ukd2QpQNNrl\n2Nznij7ULzj83KGIvZdvtYUmExESDDJ2KkxCLNSkfl1RpAsoMYOsFDmDXbBqEBmm\n3iIGj7LVnPx3Q3IArK1ml3rwviSXUqzBX3XDZpWS83l5qv89goeFriwFnGWa0NZW\nfbacmiRLQkdIIM7PMpeZ\n=K5Er\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T11:43:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.