://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/78cbe498f60a466a9c7d59cbd07b6a44420c0a74","node_id":"C_kwDOTPIvWNoAKDc4Y2JlNDk4ZjYwYTQ2NmE5YzdkNTljYmQwN2I2YTQ0NDIwYzBhNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/facdbb5ba8ea0d29b95a340ec21900db6e778bed","sha":"facdbb5ba8ea0d29b95a340ec21900db6e778bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/facdbb5ba8ea0d29b95a340ec21900db6e778bed"}],"sha":"78cbe498f60a466a9c7d59cbd07b6a44420c0a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/78cbe498f60a466a9c7d59cbd07b6a44420c0a74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71827178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/facdbb5ba8ea0d29b95a340ec21900db6e778bed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T16:32:30Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T16:32:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"v2 onboarding: dedicated verify step and upgrade-free-trial as the last step (#22303)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1ee4f77-c6d7-4638-b9f1-dd801d1cc0db\n\nCompletes the onboarding-v2 flow: a dedicated verify step, the\nreordering that makes the plan step come last, and the\nupgrade-free-trial page itself.\n\n## Verify step (`/verify-v2`)\nAfter the cross-domain token exchange, v2 sign-ups land on a clean\n`BlankLayout` \"Verifying your email\" screen (fading Twenty logo) instead\nof the v1 `AuthModal` flashing over the background mock. The redirect\ntarget is chosen from `isOnboardingV2` (read from the Jotai store at\nredirect time). The pulsing logo is extracted into a shared\n`OnboardingPulsingLogo`, reused by the workspace-activation loader.\n`/verify-v2` joins the same exempt lists as `/verify` (ongoing-creation\nguard, metadata gater, apollo unauthenticated handler, captcha, page\ntitle) — intentionally not `useShowAuthModal`, which is what drops the\nmodal.\n\n## Plan step is now last\n`getOnboardingStatus` checks `PLAN_REQUIRED` after invite-team instead\nof first, so onboarding runs workspace activation → email → profile →\ninvite → plan. This is what lets the upgrade step be reached as the\nfinal step instead of gating right after sign-up. Applies to both v1 and\nv2 (same order).\n\n## Upgrade free trial page (`PlanRequiredV2` → `ChooseYourPlanV2` /\n`UpgradeFreeTrial`)\nThe final step, full-screen under `BlankLayout` via\n`OnboardingV2Layout`, matching the Figma (billing card with the Stripe\nform, the \"Basic / without credit card\" option, trial + credits pills).\nReuses the v1 `ChooseYourPlanContent` billing logic\n(`SubscriptionPaymentForm`, `useHandleCheckoutSession`). The \"+N free\ncredits\" reward comes from\n`clientConfig.onboarding.upgradeCreditsReward` (sourced from\n`BILLING_FREE_WORKFLOW_CREDITS_FOR_TRIAL_PERIOD_WITH_CREDIT_CARD`).\n\n## Also\nFixes a latent staleness in the Apollo `onUnauthenticatedError` handler\n— it captured `location` from the memoized client, now read via a ref —\nso auth-path exemptions are correct after navigation.\n\nNote: the onboarding step order change affects v1 too (plan becomes its\nlast step as well).","tree":{"sha":"565810fced1d2bcc9f320a0396861254426c3add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/565810fced1d2bcc9f320a0396861254426c3add"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/facdbb5ba8ea0d29b95a340ec21900db6e778bed","verification":{"payload":"tree 565810fced1d2bcc9f320a0396861254426c3add\nparent 2bb7fb2e9b4fda8f5f9118493d0fbddf49915c4f\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1782750750 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782750750 +0000\n\nv2 onboarding: dedicated verify step and upgrade-free-trial as the last step (#22303)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1ee4f77-c6d7-4638-b9f1-dd801d1cc0db\n\nCompletes the onboarding-v2 flow: a dedicated verify step, the\nreordering that makes the plan step come last, and the\nupgrade-free-trial page itself.\n\n## Verify step (`/verify-v2`)\nAfter the cross-domain token exchange, v2 sign-ups land on a clean\n`BlankLayout` \"Verifying your email\" screen (fading Twenty logo) instead\nof the v1 `AuthModal` flashing over the background mock. The redirect\ntarget is chosen from `isOnboardingV2` (read from the Jotai store at\nredirect time). The pulsing logo is extracted into a shared\n`OnboardingPulsingLogo`, reused by the workspace-activation loader.\n`/verify-v2` joins the same exempt lists as `/verify` (ongoing-creation\nguard, metadata gater, apollo unauthenticated handler, captcha, page\ntitle) — intentionally not `useShowAuthModal`, which is what drops the\nmodal.\n\n## Plan step is now last\n`getOnboardingStatus` checks `PLAN_REQUIRED` after invite-team instead\nof first, so onboarding runs workspace activation → email → profile →\ninvite → plan. This is what lets the upgrade step be reached as the\nfinal step instead of gating right after sign-up. Applies to both v1 and\nv2 (same order).\n\n## Upgrade free trial page (`PlanRequiredV2` → `ChooseYourPlanV2` /\n`UpgradeFreeTrial`)\nThe final step, full-screen under `BlankLayout` via\n`OnboardingV2Layout`, matching the Figma (billing card with the Stripe\nform, the \"Basic / without credit card\" option, trial + credits pills).\nReuses the v1 `ChooseYourPlanContent` billing logic\n(`SubscriptionPaymentForm`, `useHandleCheckoutSession`). The \"+N free\ncredits\" reward comes from\n`clientConfig.onboarding.upgradeCreditsReward` (sourced from\n`BILLING_FREE_WORKFLOW_CREDITS_FOR_TRIAL_PERIOD_WITH_CREDIT_CARD`).\n\n## Also\nFixes a latent staleness in the Apollo `onUnauthenticatedError` handler\n— it captured `location` from the memoized client, now read via a ref —\nso auth-path exemptions are correct after navigation.\n\nNote: the onboarding step order change affects v1 too (plan becomes its\nlast step as well).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQp4eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlN8QACPVEbUb8lLZXEAkR8HK+G4B\n9K33UJwaP9TZq6Xm14OVhPZ7b7ftTvJnpiJmrTcv8giBmdnXqSdjgsXRiH+enY/G\nNAVE8xbELSrX3ei1E87Sw1EjkQNELXG//h2b04FR6wbY5qBY07QS0xt4pddPkEGZ\nfXXDyliTy5AkPDCi7gsc9PQa7k4mY1UbplkzzrYwbPblQBP3x7mcrNvUmfV0AxAM\n97l9cQ3iW1W2XQ2ifOTwwmmhEoAnjZcKB0axMn2H3JqG7UIszC9MLi7P9ExkSH9N\nzpFmx42/OfWK8vuf3+LrJQ7YavNCkVDVbDnvfaipBhgXW/IT2czpPFLfm6n2YSPl\nbAQhKLlua05xNJbnZG8j6J9lQNKCHMJC12km3UabbsDFrxT03dV2ru7Am5yPYW0e\nCcBaOAj1NrxHtL7SrjJWszN/QR+u03mGbr79g7my4wBm/yD4PJp4mGbCAyST7GzD\nBip30zDPitOAGCxhy3nb/oU41NtUkzP8mCSkGZZLQ90MdGdQ/DCt9xnkO8+HTY2i\n2s6yz9y8sbxbUZoB1wB70KvDh0IpKRNVBqJ0rqb9vGbp+1VHCNDiiYTaNDDa/Ej4\