usercontent.com/u/118611908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Souheyl7Gouadria","id":118611908,"login":"Souheyl7Gouadria","node_id":"U_kgDOBxHfxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Souheyl7Gouadria","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/1b2f2c71c3c6c406248d52f3e753cdfe5bdd1170/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:54:15Z","email":"118611908+Souheyl7Gouadria@users.noreply.github.com","name":"souheyl gouadria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:54:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":" Move filter group destruction after filter operations (#22248)\n\n### The current order is:\n\n1. Create filter groups\n2. Update filter groups\n3. Destroy filter groups ← **happens here**\n4. Clean up store (cascade)\n5. Create/update/delete filters (which may reference groups just\ndestroyed)\n\nThe fix is to move filter group destruction after filter operations, so\nfilters that reference those groups get created/updated/deleted first.\n\n### after fix : The persistence order is now:\n\n1. Create filter groups\n2. Update filter groups\n3. Create/update/delete view filters (these can safely reference groups\nthat still exist)\n4. Destroy filter groups (only after all filter mutations are done)\n5. Clean up store (cascade-deleted filters\n\n**root cause :** step 4 happened before step 3, so filter\ncreates/updates would reference groups that had already been deleted in\nthe same save cycle ; causing the backend to fail with \"Migration\nexecution failed\" when it couldn''t resolve the `viewFilterGroupId\n`foreign key.\n\nthis fixes the bug : #21351\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22248?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Souheyl Gouadria <souheyl.gouadria@medius.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charles Bochet <charles@twenty.com>","tree":{"sha":"141034c975203ffa7b1a28238bf44e93491d2856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/141034c975203ffa7b1a28238bf44e93491d2856"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/1b2f2c71c3c6c406248d52f3e753cdfe5bdd1170","verification":{"payload":"tree 141034c975203ffa7b1a28238bf44e93491d2856\nparent 4eb28b73c776b7f56fac5fea2d7b7d1a39b6d0ab\nauthor souheyl gouadria <118611908+Souheyl7Gouadria@users.noreply.github.com> 1782744855 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782744855 +0200\n\n Move filter group destruction after filter operations (#22248)\n\n### The current order is:\n\n1. Create filter groups\n2. Update filter groups\n3. Destroy filter groups ← **happens here**\n4. Clean up store (cascade)\n5. Create/update/delete filters (which may reference groups just\ndestroyed)\n\nThe fix is to move filter group destruction after filter operations, so\nfilters that reference those groups get created/updated/deleted first.\n\n### after fix : The persistence order is now:\n\n1. Create filter groups\n2. Update filter groups\n3. Create/update/delete view filters (these can safely reference groups\nthat still exist)\n4. Destroy filter groups (only after all filter mutations are done)\n5. Clean up store (cascade-deleted filters\n\n**root cause :** step 4 happened before step 3, so filter\ncreates/updates would reference groups that had already been deleted in\nthe same save cycle ; causing the backend to fail with \"Migration\nexecution failed\" when it couldn''t resolve the `viewFilterGroupId\n`foreign key.\n\nthis fixes the bug : #21351\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22248?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\nCo-authored-by: Souheyl Gouadria <souheyl.gouadria@medius.com>\nCo-authored-by: Charles Bochet <charles@twenty.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQocXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqTAQAIdiBLHrCgXPTvQ1IEM4hV2n\nJird2U7+lsxJlqTnjtLCWqFWdCj3q0hX2YZhBCJLZMaFFtDNNSB6iLhLJJ87KwDW\nF+52I5hsaMizmXpiNzONPiAkdrw/O6UL8tG0fChMOD2nVGfukT0ukCU+1S7e2K60\n3n6KSKA1d1MfLuEjC0zIEILhi3o+T1tfFPk5H3rsutqqgixlvFvyEDWBjG7+FeMr\nWu/Y5iATybk7QQttCEQQHtx9IedCnh7TVtxoYWje5SqE28v39uiUcznx5xY+e9jB\nZbRGH4K/57FSXWG1DDXyN3Fgvm69LRrtpKZ0i9kLHIzoAIXO9xAAVLZywHpboS4E\ngMv5ROAC