JkMjY3ZDVlYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/d1854bc7e9fc6b9ad18e7b6c027a717654cb15e0","sha":"d1854bc7e9fc6b9ad18e7b6c027a717654cb15e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/d1854bc7e9fc6b9ad18e7b6c027a717654cb15e0"}],"sha":"61d094b185473e2e56f206d7481429bd267d5ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/61d094b185473e2e56f206d7481429bd267d5ec3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29927851?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/martmull","id":29927851,"login":"martmull","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTI3ODUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/martmull","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/d1854bc7e9fc6b9ad18e7b6c027a717654cb15e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:58:34Z","email":"martmull@hotmail.fr","name":"martmull"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T12:58:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add marketplace catalog synchronization to admin panel (#22260)\n\n## After\n\n<img width=\"1476\" height=\"658\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25a042dd-eabf-4b71-9872-d3b627104634\"\n/>\n\n\n## Summary\nThis PR adds the ability for admins to manually synchronize the\nmarketplace application catalog from the admin panel. It introduces a\nnew mutation endpoint and UI controls to trigger catalog synchronization\nwith user feedback via snackbar notifications.\n\n## Key Changes\n- **Frontend (SettingsAdminApps component)**:\n  - Added `useSnackBar` hook for user feedback on sync success/failure\n- Imported `useMutation` from Apollo Client to handle the sync operation\n  - Added `IconRefresh` and `Button` imports for the sync UI control\n- Created `handleSyncCatalog` function that triggers the mutation,\nrefetches app registrations, and displays appropriate snackbar messages\n- Added a new \"General\" section with a \"Synchronize catalog\" button\nabove the existing app registrations table\n  - Button shows loading state and is disabled while sync is in progress\n\n- **Backend (AdminPanelResolver)**:\n- Added `syncMarketplaceCatalog` mutation that queues a\n`MarketplaceCatalogSyncCronJob` via the message queue\n- Uses `@InjectMessageQueue` decorator to inject the cron queue service\n- Includes job deduplication via `id: ''marketplace-catalog-sync''` to\nprevent multiple pending sync jobs\n  - Protected with `@UseGuards(AdminPanelGuard)` for admin-only access\n\n- **GraphQL Schema**:\n  - Added `SyncMarketplaceCatalog` mutation type definition\n  - Generated corresponding TypeScript types and mutation document\n\n- **New Files**:\n  - Created `syncMarketplaceCatalog.ts` GraphQL mutation document\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22260?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"de16415345ebcd9edfe4b3c792613dd89ffe5e92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/de16415345ebcd9edfe4b3c792613dd89ffe5e92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/d1854bc7e9fc6b9ad18e7b6c027a717654cb15e0","verification":{"payload":"tree de16415345ebcd9edfe4b3c792613dd89ffe5e92\nparent 66edd9621392dafe0468d2edbe4233006642f000\nauthor martmull <martmull@hotmail.fr> 1782737914 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782737914 +0000\n\nAdd marketplace catalog synchronization to admin panel (#22260)\n\n## After\n\n<img width=\"1476\" height=\"658\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25a042dd-eabf-4b71-9872-d3b627104634\"\n/>\n\n\n## Summary\nThis PR adds the ability for admins to manually synchronize the\nmarketplace application catalog from the admin panel. It introduces a\nnew mutation endpoint and UI controls to trigger catalog synchronization\nwith user feedback via snackbar notifications.\n\n## Key Changes\n- **Frontend (SettingsAdminApps component)**:\n  - Added `useSnackBar` hook for user feedback on sync success/failure\n- Imported `useMutation` from Apollo Client to handle the sync operation\n  - Added `IconRefresh` and `Button` imports for the sync UI control\n- Created `handleSyncCatalog` function that triggers the mutation,\nrefetches app registrations, and displays appropriate snackbar messages\n- Added a new \"General\" section with a \"Synchronize catalog\" button\nabove the existing app registrations table\n  - Button shows loading state and is disabled while sync is in progress\n\n- **Backend (AdminPanelResolver)**:\n- Added `syncMarketplaceCatalog` mutation that queues a\n`MarketplaceCatalogSyncCronJob` via the message queue\n- Uses `@InjectMessageQueue` decorator to inject the cron queue service\n- Includes job deduplication via `id: ''marketplace-catalog-sync''` to\nprevent multiple pending sync jobs\n  - Protected with `@UseGuards(AdminPanelGuard)` for admin-only access\n\n- **GraphQL Schema**:\n  - Added `SyncMarketplaceCatalog` mutation type definition\n  - Generated corresponding TypeScript types and mutation document\n\n- **New Files**:\n  - Created `syncMarketplaceCatalog.ts` GraphQL mutation document\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22260?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQmv6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHpIQADaJfqjBYiei4QAowd3EATR1\n8fBEm53aDt29OhwGVwKM40U6zpQMOWE3xe3AyojxgR2utMNRfug7tjYwOH9OANIs\n+MKFZfstHI8H+68RVE/NsXqenNtV4qx0zhk/QhtlQ4X9Qnjrt+FxtoMngD11Ie/R\nSATEAVsFH30sCY3szbKZRM3YzA/PgdxRn8wZlNTIvz3Ya+AkzXEiO2cmuT2LFPSK\n7MpVRb0rvxEZ8TaCBeioPVBtfedYcTKbKPbNgBaOX6emSQHxRMTem2C8lAMwFD1g\n9G6qoIhueQWvTD8Uh8RzQMKIbBJ/Jst50xKDx6J2MxssT0qj7TfG9vw4whxBTLvO\nUhiBBaUEGSSSy4qqlaih6cAIch0XetPRIt/zkqfPajQ8tDmZO28M9VCuTsiU1OXz\ngitbPBseSjvrj+3Hs10wNDgxskndz3uwsD2y3PJWRbFGRevulK/l9mV/PNe78S7b\nRhfX1a98ibfegkbgwKaEB5g70PK80tbhu/Ug17dTBxvW+/ZQc0b6fg5v+eIez7gy\nE72xYqSQ1+NO4vsStNc0jEcgrFrCud9YuZbV0rnc3GnO0b7LlHelK2wKQFyva7oZ\n+C4bWCP8EzSCJZaHBEtxYDPF+qeoI9vHbp8SBmOzXA6qoFT5FfynYe4Njkq4fxGW\nQ/nkrYsVXkzrr31kQkov\n=+pvw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T11:43:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/