"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/e69c3ae5ce793f9219ee6f468d03fc4453f0e216/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T16:18:31Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T16:18:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(website): bump @opennextjs/cloudflare to 1.20.0 (R2 deploy on Node 24) (#22266)\n\n## What\n\nThe twenty-infra **\"Deploy Website\"** workflow has failed every run\nsince 06-26 — at OpenNext''s R2 incremental-cache step, **not** the\nbuild:\n\n```\nFailed to provision remote R2 bucket \"twenty-website-cache-dev\"\nfor binding \"NEXT_INC_CACHE_R2_BUCKET\":\nFailed to check whether bucket exists: … Premature close\n```\n\n## Root cause\n\n`@opennextjs/cloudflare`''s `ensureR2Bucket()` calls the Cloudflare SDK''s\n`r2.buckets.get()`. On **Node 24** (which the deploy pins) undici\ntruncates the **gzip-compressed** Cloudflare API response → `Premature\nclose`. The SDK''s own retries don''t help (it''s systematic, not flaky),\nand pre-creating the bucket doesn''t help (it always `.get()`s first).\n\nThis is **pre-existing and unrelated to the multi-locale change**\n(#22257): the *Build Worker* step succeeds, and the identical error\nappears on 06-26 runs (two days before that merged).\n\n## Fix\n\nopennext **1.20.0** fixes this precisely — it passes `defaultHeaders: {\n\"Accept-Encoding\": \"identity\" }` to the Cloudflare SDK client, so the\nAPI returns **uncompressed** responses (no decompression → no premature\nclose). **Node 24 is kept**, and no twenty-infra change is needed — the\ndeploy runs `twenty`''s own `npx opennextjs-cloudflare`, so bumping the\ndep here is enough.\n\n`^1.0.0 → ^1.20.0`. **1.20.0, not the latest 1.20.1**, because the\nrepo''s `npmMinimalAgeGate: 3d` still quarantines 1.20.1 (published\n06-26); 1.20.0 (06-25) is past the gate and carries the same fix.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Resolved to `1.20.0`; confirmed `Accept-Encoding: identity` is in the\ninstalled `dist/cli/utils/ensure-r2-bucket.js`.\n- `nx typecheck twenty-website` green (OpenNext config API unchanged\nacross the bump).\n- Diff is just `package.json` + `yarn.lock`.\n\n⚠️ Full confirmation needs a **Deploy Website** run (exercises the build\n+ the R2 provision step), which I can''t trigger — please re-run it after\nmerge.","tree":{"sha":"b126cab141ff033d102f76b2c5b7f4055c65cbbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/b126cab141ff033d102f76b2c5b7f4055c65cbbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/e69c3ae5ce793f9219ee6f468d03fc4453f0e216","verification":{"payload":"tree b126cab141ff033d102f76b2c5b7f4055c65cbbd\nparent 0569c490fdf5f755a43e9dad4a81c7018773da51\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1782663511 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782663511 +0000\n\nfix(website): bump @opennextjs/cloudflare to 1.20.0 (R2 deploy on Node 24) (#22266)\n\n## What\n\nThe twenty-infra **\"Deploy Website\"** workflow has failed every run\nsince 06-26 — at OpenNext''s R2 incremental-cache step, **not** the\nbuild:\n\n```\nFailed to provision remote R2 bucket \"twenty-website-cache-dev\"\nfor binding \"NEXT_INC_CACHE_R2_BUCKET\":\nFailed to check whether bucket exists: … Premature close\n```\n\n## Root cause\n\n`@opennextjs/cloudflare`''s `ensureR2Bucket()` calls the Cloudflare SDK''s\n`r2.buckets.get()`. On **Node 24** (which the deploy pins) undici\ntruncates the **gzip-compressed** Cloudflare API response → `Premature\nclose`. The SDK''s own retries don''t help (it''s systematic, not flaky),\nand pre-creating the bucket doesn''t help (it always `.get()`s first).\n\nThis is **pre-existing and unrelated to the multi-locale change**\n(#22257): the *Build Worker* step succeeds, and the identical error\nappears on 06-26 runs (two days before that merged).\n\n## Fix\n\nopennext **1.20.0** fixes this precisely — it passes `defaultHeaders: {\n\"Accept-Encoding\": \"identity\" }` to the Cloudflare SDK client, so the\nAPI returns **uncompressed** responses (no decompression → no premature\nclose). **Node 24 is kept**, and no twenty-infra change is needed — the\ndeploy runs `twenty`''s own `npx opennextjs-cloudflare`, so bumping the\ndep here is enough.\n\n`^1.0.0 → ^1.20.0`. **1.20.0, not the latest 1.20.1**, because the\nrepo''s `npmMinimalAgeGate: 3d` still quarantines 1.20.1 (published\n06-26); 1.20.0 (06-25) is past the gate and carries the same fix.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Resolved to `1.20.0`; confirmed `Accept-Encoding: identity` is in the\ninstalled `dist/cli/utils/ensure-r2-bucket.js`.\n- `nx typecheck twenty-website` green (OpenNext config API unchanged\nacross the bump).\n- Diff is just `package.json` + `yarn.lock`.\n\n⚠️ Full confirmation needs a **Deploy Website** run (exercises the build\n+ the R2 provision step), which I can''t trigger — please re-run it after\nmerge.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQUlXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlMIQAAi8IEPIdbVknP4+Dy0XNjj4\ng/BBGOWroSs+IvwK8Kjz0An