4ZGYwYWVhOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/c891258f34115c3b0f9c8eb57756d75e74d5aee4","sha":"c891258f34115c3b0f9c8eb57756d75e74d5aee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/c891258f34115c3b0f9c8eb57756d75e74d5aee4"}],"sha":"e1120d38b69816e5704db63462be3868df0aea9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/e1120d38b69816e5704db63462be3868df0aea9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71827178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/c891258f34115c3b0f9c8eb57756d75e74d5aee4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T15:34:44Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T15:34:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add v2 onboarding create profile page (#22221)\n\n<img width=\"3024\" height=\"1498\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-26 at 15 30\n23@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b4863a9-66ed-4da1-851b-473cedf71511\"\n/>\n\n<img width=\"3022\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-26 at 15 29\n43@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22fc0e94-f670-4638-975c-f06b2b2e25e8\"\n/>\n\nAdds the v2 onboarding **Create profile** page, shown right after the\nimport-contacts step (`PROFILE_CREATION`) for the onboarding-v2 cohort.\nIt renders full-screen under `BlankLayout` via the shared\n`OnboardingV2Layout`, matching the Figma (340px column, inline round\navatar uploader + First/Last row, Job Title, dark Continue). The v1\nmodal flow is untouched and still used for non-v2 users.\n\nJob Title is wired end-to-end: it adds a real `jobTitle` field to the\n`WorkspaceMember` standard object (shared metadata constant + flat field\nmetadata + entity property) and a `2-17` workspace upgrade command to\nbackfill the field on existing workspaces. Continue persists name +\njobTitle through the existing `updateWorkspaceMemberSettings` mutation,\nwhose allow-list picks up the new standard field automatically.\n\nRouting mirrors `SyncEmailsV2`: new `AppPath.CreateProfileV2`, lazy\nroute, and an `isOnboardingV2`-gated branch in\n`usePageChangeEffectNavigateLocation` (+ tests and a Storybook story).\n\nReviewer notes:\n- `jobTitle` is **write-only** for now (no read-back path: core\nDTO/transpiler/fragment unchanged), and the field is\n`isSystem`/non-UI-editable to match its siblings. Easy to surface later\nif wanted.\n- New `OnboardingProfilePictureUploader` is a compact round avatar\nuploader reusing the same upload mutation flow as\n`WorkspaceMemberPictureUploader`.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22221?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"59a990c239fd260549e03b02ff449c8305e98c08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/59a990c239fd260549e03b02ff449c8305e98c08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/c891258f34115c3b0f9c8eb57756d75e74d5aee4","verification":{"payload":"tree 59a990c239fd260549e03b02ff449c8305e98c08\nparent 1bf0d06e18e556eb386c4a25edb28d3d3d275ee0\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1782488084 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782488084 +0200\n\nAdd v2 onboarding create profile page (#22221)\n\n<img width=\"3024\" height=\"1498\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-26 at 15 30\n23@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b4863a9-66ed-4da1-851b-473cedf71511\"\n/>\n\n<img width=\"3022\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-26 at 15 29\n43@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22fc0e94-f670-4638-975c-f06b2b2e25e8\"\n/>\n\nAdds the v2 onboarding **Create profile** page, shown right after the\nimport-contacts step (`PROFILE_CREATION`) for the onboarding-v2 cohort.\nIt renders full-screen under `BlankLayout` via the shared\n`OnboardingV2Layout`, matching the Figma (340px column, inline round\navatar uploader + First/Last row, Job Title, dark Continue). The v1\nmodal flow is untouched and still used for non-v2 users.\n\nJob Title is wired end-to-end: it adds a real `jobTitle` field to the\n`WorkspaceMember` standard object (shared metadata constant + flat field\nmetadata + entity property) and a `2-17` workspace upgrade command to\nbackfill the field on existing workspaces. Continue persists name +\njobTitle through the existing `updateWorkspaceMemberSettings` mutation,\nwhose allow-list picks up the new standard field automatically.\n\nRouting mirrors `SyncEmailsV2`: new `AppPath.CreateProfileV2`, lazy\nroute, and an `isOnboardingV2`-gated branch in\n`usePageChangeEffectNavigateLocation` (+ tests and a Storybook story).\n\nReviewer notes:\n- `jobTitle` is **write-only** for now (no read-back path: core\nDTO/transpiler/fragment unchanged), and the field is\n`isSystem`/non-UI-editable to match its siblings. Easy to surface later\nif wanted.\n- New `OnboardingProfilePictureUploader` is a compact round avatar\nuploader reusing the same upload mutation flow as\n`WorkspaceMemberPictureUploader`.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22221?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPpwUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuCAQACz3GorUhnVo9udiCfeV6Ck4\nA7/0HUvINwNk8Bav4p24Yq9ebgyJKIMI1R/A/K7sauGHGiyeNM19bPeQDSYtrFVs\n5hW2esY1YHN2AZi3CrHBBJOJr52VMcHJeQ/wOCjDs21wfKtVbBno5Y3NE5/RMJhO\n5kAIBW27azv61tw4gBcYnRUYezeCPNi1mRR3+KcxvEfxjYm0NunJD6928JwlDsol\naqeMwA6cmOHYjxV2AvuDJtRxuY6EzRxtZ4ZBwuSds6JCPxguZdvMrlETJKC/S5jY\nAMxwW+cB/QULCy1I4thMsiVbhoN7hVvayuCDLFynxhqF6VBDo1OOfB6572EePOvO\neaQTm7uJy0w1HldVb49/MXQJmbt7EumkM8tKYeBMCg/2wsnZ6jq3jsudiB0VCzvn\nETL18c7B/YxKjue+4tbZK+HxjwGrsdpGClCQsgPZzTHTmQA4UIES07VxCHv/gSle\ntlI/3lwZgS2u3gbvnk7Gk3TOPScTc/MCmpZa6V9BTJZpnrKFbWq/TqHBWJkOEqcD\nP5B9ytNxf5cma6kumLq21dbOAa713UHTGF4pmymjWHQQ3vMkGwP2ukljpzxmNzgq\nDpGOtsITS/GbBZIzk4FiN0gdjXvuYjArE1jlbFcuir+UDxBnOGufIiHBjdwDI/km\nE8QcOViQkygkbl/jtqHm\n=vsHZ\n-----END PGP SIGNAT