,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/8f7d6c24ddfb0e67535074f944ec6cdb464ce774/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:54:52Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:54:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add v2 onboarding import contacts page and unify the onboarding v2 shell (#22212)\n\n<img width=\"3024\" height=\"1668\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-26 at 13 29\n28@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bdd0029-45eb-4ddb-859f-eaab9bb61406\"\n/>\n\nAdds the new v2 onboarding **Import contacts** step (email + calendar\nimport), shown right after workspace creation in the v2 flow. The\npresentational page was designed in a previous PR; this wires it in and\nunifies the shell.\n\n**What changed**\n- Reuses and unifies the existing v2 onboarding shell: extracts\n`OnboardingV2Layout` + `OnboardingV2Header` (the back + logo header, now\nwith the free-credits pill), and the `SignInUpV2` workspace-creation\nstep renders through it (old `SignInUpV2Header` removed).\n- New `SyncEmailsV2` route (`/sync/emails-v2`) under `BlankLayout`,\nwired to the same OAuth/skip hooks as v1 `SyncEmails`.\n- The `SYNC_EMAIL` step routes to the new page only when\n`isOnboardingV2` is set (mirrors the existing `WorkspaceActivation` →\n`WorkspaceActivationV2` branch); the v1 modal is unchanged for the\nnon-v2 flow.\n- No backend changes — reuses the `SYNC_EMAIL` status and\n`skipSyncEmailOnboardingStep` mutation.\n\n**Reviewer notes**\n- Connect defaults to `METADATA` (private) visibility to match the \"Only\nyou will be able to see your emails and events\" note (v1 had a selector\ndefaulting to `SHARE_EVERYTHING`).\n- The header free-credits pill shows `0` for now (no current-workspace\ncredits source on the frontend yet).\n- The back button is hidden on the import page (no meaningful \"back\"\nafter workspace creation); unchanged on the workspace-creation step.","tree":{"sha":"90c447ac111a45eac21fb78486d806d8bb0402dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/90c447ac111a45eac21fb78486d806d8bb0402dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/8f7d6c24ddfb0e67535074f944ec6cdb464ce774","verification":{"payload":"tree 90c447ac111a45eac21fb78486d806d8bb0402dd\nparent 9747e3a7a3e7b6b2d1596d8f398007dcf66842b2\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1782478492 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782478492 +0000\n\nAdd v2 onboarding import contacts page and unify the onboarding v2 shell (#22212)\n\n<img width=\"3024\" height=\"1668\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-06-26 at 13 29\n28@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bdd0029-45eb-4ddb-859f-eaab9bb61406\"\n/>\n\nAdds the new v2 onboarding **Import contacts** step (email + calendar\nimport), shown right after workspace creation in the v2 flow. The\npresentational page was designed in a previous PR; this wires it in and\nunifies the shell.\n\n**What changed**\n- Reuses and unifies the existing v2 onboarding shell: extracts\n`OnboardingV2Layout` + `OnboardingV2Header` (the back + logo header, now\nwith the free-credits pill), and the `SignInUpV2` workspace-creation\nstep renders through it (old `SignInUpV2Header` removed).\n- New `SyncEmailsV2` route (`/sync/emails-v2`) under `BlankLayout`,\nwired to the same OAuth/skip hooks as v1 `SyncEmails`.\n- The `SYNC_EMAIL` step routes to the new page only when\n`isOnboardingV2` is set (mirrors the existing `WorkspaceActivation` →\n`WorkspaceActivationV2` branch); the v1 modal is unchanged for the\nnon-v2 flow.\n- No backend changes — reuses the `SYNC_EMAIL` status and\n`skipSyncEmailOnboardingStep` mutation.\n\n**Reviewer notes**\n- Connect defaults to `METADATA` (private) visibility to match the \"Only\nyou will be able to see your emails and events\" note (v1 had a selector\ndefaulting to `SHARE_EVERYTHING`).\n- The header free-credits pill shows `0` for now (no current-workspace\ncredits source on the frontend yet).\n- The back button is hidden on the import page (no meaningful \"back\"\nafter workspace creation); unchanged on the workspace-creation step.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPnacCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANyUQAEYiQ2yiQOVRdKxpaSek5Wh+\nMnKz698rVXxbPtwNZXNwabtdznIFjXC7zXAmz2hVhzYQIm/7XuQhV1DXRLZhZEcL\nEWXZXaXo7wrPAslq8hUGlqWx9VGM3yZX/JDJLL5xttPRK6sW9GN4vERlr/TodSji\nB2QjtPwNBRexMiqJ1m5uHHiYfzYRExG/dp/Q/2xVD8qMlB7BoBfC0b7q3NGNnGXB\nV7uDogS9Dyt38sSh6WLVZAnTZhzy81ZNRTf9TW1j4vznVNXrVj0vEeacqmtV05v3\n47e9yGGnafIA5Pu8pj9Q34+OJJblqlD5g8RdvNd5drbcPyNH8vVKKa8ylBMPPX0Q\ngy/0G10khrfCNMcOf9DfVpEt80d0YUgj7duUNVYopMpnzYtOGZiJ3iH1L4EmYbdv\niK/BIRf89bZunaY+FR9ScduZAHg2/0KsAsa0UvP9gKd8lPf6iyl5L7eBnCEr/Lv5\nEITJJFbYn0zEDSy4IbwZxvMeN/FBPJ1bG653R7oXjV8A1LF1BpML63NUA3pzGoNj\ndRKPHyFqDY6bdn+9565HQS/S4pCq7dHLf8d+j7/0XS0Jc1MQJW2M5/7S9nd09fWT\n4XkXyi+Q+LF9llHGhZMNFWlpgDU0kdv0/JSiYU622I48pDhX/2mdpvC7njIawAv1\nSZje0Lnxoj131i5pMQoB\n=wOPH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T11:43:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_u