o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neo773","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/9747e3a7a3e7b6b2d1596d8f398007dcf66842b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:28:51Z","email":"62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com","name":"neo773"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:28:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(messaging): link emails by Reply-To as a REPLY_TO participant (#22216)\n\nRelay senders (e.g. a website form sending as a shared address with the\nreal contact in Reply-To) never linked to the contact because matching\nonly used From/To/Cc/Bcc. Record Reply-To addresses under a new REPLY_TO\nparticipant role across the Gmail, Microsoft and IMAP drivers, excluding\nany that just repeat the sender.\n\nAdds the REPLY_TO option to the messageParticipant role field and a 2.17\nworkspace command to backfill it for existing workspaces.\n\nQAed with real test run\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22216?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"fcc247fbaa284478320ccbffe1d4d1facc22939f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/fcc247fbaa284478320ccbffe1d4d1facc22939f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/9747e3a7a3e7b6b2d1596d8f398007dcf66842b2","verification":{"payload":"tree fcc247fbaa284478320ccbffe1d4d1facc22939f\nparent ebe067f65cfb0e26449c569cb81540e4597f920b\nauthor neo773 <62795688+neo773@users.noreply.github.com> 1782476931 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782476931 +0530\n\nfeat(messaging): link emails by Reply-To as a REPLY_TO participant (#22216)\n\nRelay senders (e.g. a website form sending as a shared address with the\nreal contact in Reply-To) never linked to the contact because matching\nonly used From/To/Cc/Bcc. Record Reply-To addresses under a new REPLY_TO\nparticipant role across the Gmail, Microsoft and IMAP drivers, excluding\nany that just repeat the sender.\n\nAdds the REPLY_TO option to the messageParticipant role field and a 2.17\nworkspace command to backfill it for existing workspaces.\n\nQAed with real test run\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22216?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPnCDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAefsQAHbH7/qubmmeVoDSW+HHHKoS\nNiNylXkBl7pkjpXBRuvtArnVHt9PmYLPhmC4k2jYOWRh78hKif0GqbgRKojmmb9H\nDzIcvEgVwJuva+/TAp7PzT3JOLt0YHdmaAr+r0APZQpYaQPpfx60C5MEeh+nlNR0\npoJW7Icd/jkTKjB33ZImNd3MIHLgD/q8sd/9i5PsCDBiqxJmSI7q/p9HPfpGz1R1\ncfU7gyzvNhkLt9hi0atAWRIUo9xN4GUHJXLmSTp9HEoLE4evtnVPvKYQe+BCuPFb\nhuFGLmmEc0MhN5pny+QmyBzXGG2VZxVH4HOWjcmoT4L1HzAb4RbZlR/P8g5kSkB9\nV6eXwkeYWu1u2XT/DFG8H4ZBeVB8we324pstOgjzkgsenj2XjLBjbi/7UnWoScLU\nxTdacC3S4hmIV8kpBsfQsxwJMYeAB0iR/cNkK0AuIDgBkNsf