ko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Weiko","id":1834158,"login":"Weiko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzQxNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/ebe067f65cfb0e26449c569cb81540e4597f920b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T11:55:09Z","email":"corentin@twenty.com","name":"Weiko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T11:55:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix favorite showing non-readable objects (#22217)\n\n## Context\nNavigation menu items backed by objects the user has no read permission\non were correctly hidden from the Workspace section, but Favorites still\nshowed them. Favorites are user-scoped nav items (tied to\nworkspaceMemberId), and FavoritesSection only filtered out folder\nchildren (!item.folderId) without ever checking canReadObjectRecords.\n\nThe shared upstream filter (filterAndSortNavigationMenuItems)\nintentionally does not apply read permissions, because its output also\ndrives drag-and-drop position math and layout-customization/edit mode,\nwhich need the complete, unfiltered list. So read-permission filtering\nbelongs at the display layer.\n\n## Fix\nNew shared hook useReadableNavigationMenuItems that centralizes the\nread-permission filtering logic previously duplicated across sections:\nwires up objectMetadataItems + views + object permissions around\nisNavigationMenuItemReadable\nfilters folder children and top-level items (dropping folders whose\nchildren are all unreadable)\nexposes both raw filtered* outputs and\nisLayoutCustomizationModeEnabled-aware display* outputs\nFavoritesSection now applies the filter via the hook, so unreadable\nfavorites are hidden — while still showing everything in\nlayout-customization mode (consistent with the Workspace section).\nWorkspaceSectionContainer refactored to consume the same hook, removing\nits inline isItemReadable, the dual-map reduce, and inline filtering.\n\n## Before\n### With access\n<img width=\"842\" height=\"570\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-25 at 14 01 38\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae51f3c8-c178-4162-84ce-3fe49cf07987\"\n/>\n\n### Without access\n<img width=\"987\" height=\"590\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-25 at 14 02 08\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94dacea3-bd77-4fcb-868d-353ed513b28c\"\n/>\n\n## After\n### Without access\n<img width=\"1001\" height=\"615\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-25 at 14 02 46\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1ccd5d9-8583-4ff1-ab91-6f6d187925c5\"\n/>\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22217?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"9eba2da2d23667dd34d3ff947ec19df3fa7137d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/9eba2da2d23667dd34d3ff947ec19df3fa7137d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/ebe067f65cfb0e26449c569cb81540e4597f920b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9eba2da2d23667dd34d3ff947ec19df3fa7137d4\nparent fdf9f543ae8c306ea814dfc068f9ece39f439eff\nauthor Weiko <corentin@twenty.com> 1782474909 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782474909 +0000\n\nFix favorite showing non-readable objects (#22217)\n\n## Context\nNavigation menu items backed by objects the user has no read permission\non were correctly hidden from the Workspace section, but Favorites still\nshowed them. Favorites are user-scoped nav items (tied to\nworkspaceMemberId), and FavoritesSection only filtered out folder\nchildren (!item.folderId) without ever checking canReadObjectRecords.\n\nThe shared upstream filter (filterAndSortNavigationMenuItems)\nintentionally does not apply read permissions, because its output also\ndrives drag-and-drop position math and layout-customization/edit mode,\nwhich need the complete, unfiltered list. So read-permission filtering\nbelongs at the display layer.\n\n## Fix\nNew shared hook useReadableNavigationMenuItems that centralizes the\nread-permission filtering logic previously duplicated across sections:\nwires up objectMetadataItems + views + object permissions around\nisNavigationMenuItemReadable\nfilters folder children and top-level items (dropping folders whose\nchildren are all unreadable)\nexposes both raw filtered* outputs and\nisLayoutCustomizationModeEnabled-aware display* outputs\nFavoritesSection now applies the filter via the hook, so unreadable\nfavorites are hidden — while still showing everything in\nlayout-customization mode (consistent with the Workspace section).\nWorkspaceSectionContainer refactored to consume the same hook, removing\nits inline isItemReadable, the dual-map reduce, and inline filtering.\n\n## Before\n### With access\n<img width=\"842\" height=\"570\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-25 at 14 01 38\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae51f3c8-c178-4162-84ce-3fe49cf07987\"\n/>\n\n### Without access\n<img width=\"987\" height=\"590\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-25 at 14 02 08\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94dacea3-bd77-4fcb-868d-353ed513b28c\"\n/>\n\n## After\n### Without access\n<img width=\"1001\" height=\"615\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-06-25 at 14 02 46\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1ccd5d9-8583-4ff1-ab91-6f6d187925c5\"\n/>\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22217?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPmidCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsREQAGZvj6IvORuNz9F/+IN8nO5H\naiG+CHWBwYFeit94R0m7bHmmfoZ4kuF/KGlgD066nxwJ/9AjIv3tl9Fy87W9ic9x\nRB0cGvKOyTwImkurVekhtVSLO9hsJ9GzEVIfzaTA4axnf4pvC7e716XhKwNORRFo\nUJ+oPpqYXUIkwoauztpZyWMJrrFzR1w9p2NSG5Qp93zxTgUmIT3oC3VJypSNAtnJ\nHwev/uvBsIqleXk8KGUk18H8zg1LwDj+2A0gL5UqBubd8qyEQr26eP5bNcgv8ggW\n/+l7zx3qV3eT9jBnzf2Fs99FMk5vQdKOuyHSO4ZnudrhEvuO8gM69HBusiXv9no/\nn+lfOm5ApRP/F848EI55mXjbeUB6c6QiMBIlqWsSHFauGmRbxkD9ON+kQ792IOp1\nA+szRdfj1jxz1A2kQhn+mF9NbISlvCJf2JP+pmuAG5oanAGNXoeSFamK7lxLUE4d\ntMMAPWio8r/QpgUdZCDNngGHEH/yTCk4rLdi3aNLJCr2gaxtkgX2XAYMp0Gmozo9\nF01idyia/LDJjNa+OEsdAlZ1z3RIsgmNent2C/aVr+ytyo8361NfyFV/mUsIoPbX\nW+ZsumdM8kjG7yiBNDR79OgPw5rb8ACes3HPI3aqCTKPM/riUa82VJOBCCJ1gk5+\nLww4U7o1pOWviygfgO5E\n=3HO5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T11:43:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":