commits/a22eb5a5915ce97f06125f5c0feb885d5505b433"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19412894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bonapara","id":19412894,"login":"Bonapara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDEyODk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonapara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/bea7857a1c578876169a7f406a49fd7cad82bd39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:34:19Z","email":"tdesfrancs@gmail.com","name":"Thomas des Francs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:34:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix settings page root overflow (#22207)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Clamp the fixed app shell with `overflow: hidden` so long nested\nsettings scroll content no longer contributes to the document root\nscroll range.\n- Keeps the object permission page scrolling inside its existing\nsettings `ScrollWrapper` instead of letting the whole page slide under\nthe viewport.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nBefore: root document can scroll under the bottom of the viewport and\nexposes the gray app background.\n\n![Before root\nscroll](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/twentyhq/twenty/bonapara/pr-screenshots-settings-root-scroll-20260626/.github/pr-screenshots/fix-settings-root-scroll/before-object-permission-root-scroll.png)\n\nAfter: the same root scroll attempt leaves the app shell fixed to the\nviewport.\n\n![After root\nscroll](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/twentyhq/twenty/bonapara/pr-screenshots-settings-root-scroll-20260626/.github/pr-screenshots/fix-settings-root-scroll/after-object-permission-root-scroll.png)\n\n## Browser Validation\n\nRoute tested:\n`/settings/members/roles/78fa69cb-1237-43b5-bfa5-5a11a47bf781/object/5ab1a16b-7811-471f-ac53-940666c667dd`\n\n- Before on `http://apple.localhost:3001`: `window.scrollTo(0, 9999)`\nmoved the root to `scrollY=244.5`; `htmlScrollHeight=1287`,\n`htmlClientHeight=1043`.\n- After on `http://apple.localhost:3002`: the same root scroll attempt\nstayed at `scrollY=0`; `htmlScrollHeight=1043`, `htmlClientHeight=1043`.\n- The settings content still scrolls internally: wrapper\n`scrollHeight=1475`, `clientHeight=955`.\n\n## Checks\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- `yarn oxfmt --check\npackages/twenty-front/src/modules/ui/layout/page/components/DefaultLayout.tsx`\n- `cd packages/twenty-front && npx oxlint --type-aware -c .oxlintrc.json\nsrc/modules/ui/layout/page/components/DefaultLayout.tsx`\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22207?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"7446d1cdf0eb1e734de9336fc82a0710764e967e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/7446d1cdf0eb1e734de9336fc82a0710764e967e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/bea7857a1c578876169a7f406a49fd7cad82bd39","verification":{"payload":"tree 7446d1cdf0eb1e734de9336fc82a0710764e967e\nparent d6fca7a82edfb84619bdc3f556476c1b681f237d\nauthor Thomas des Francs <tdesfrancs@gmail.com> 1782466459 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782466459 +0200\n\nFix settings page root overflow (#22207)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Clamp the fixed app shell with `overflow: hidden` so long nested\nsettings scroll content no longer contributes to the document root\nscroll range.\n- Keeps the object permission page scrolling inside its existing\nsettings `ScrollWrapper` instead of letting the whole page slide under\nthe viewport.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nBefore: root document can scroll under the bottom of the viewport and\nexposes the gray app background.\n\n![Before root\nscroll](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/twentyhq/twenty/bonapara/pr-screenshots-settings-root-scroll-20260626/.github/pr-screenshots/fix-settings-root-scroll/before-object-permission-root-scroll.png)\n\nAfter: the same root scroll attempt leaves the app shell fixed to the\nviewport.\n\n![After root\nscroll](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/twentyhq/twenty/bonapara/pr-screenshots-settings-root-scroll-20260626/.github/pr-screenshots/fix-settings-root-scroll/after-object-permission-root-scroll.png)\n\n## Browser Validation\n\nRoute tested:\n`/settings/members/roles/78fa69cb-1237-43b5-bfa5-5a11a47bf781/object/5ab1a16b-7811-471f-ac53-940666c667dd`\n\n- Before on `http://apple.localhost:3001`: `window.scrollTo(0, 9999)`\nmoved the root to `scrollY=244.5`; `htmlScrollHeight=1287`,\n`htmlClientHeight=1043`.\n- After on `http://apple.localhost:3002`: the same root scroll attempt\nstayed at `scrollY=0`; `htmlScrollHeight=1043`, `htmlClientHeight=1043`.\n- The settings content still scrolls internally: wrapper\n`scrollHeight=1475`, `clientHeight=955`.\n\n## Checks\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- `yarn oxfmt --check\npackages/twenty-front/src/modules/ui/layout/page/co