ame":"Thomas des Francs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:14:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Use settings icon in settings drawer tab (#22204)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Let the shared navigation drawer tab row accept a custom icon and\naccessible label for its navigation tab.\n- Use the Settings icon and Settings label when that tab row is rendered\ninside the settings drawer.\n- Keep the main navigation drawer defaulting to the Home icon.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n### Before\n\n<img width=\"420\" alt=\"Before: settings drawer navigation tab uses the\nHome icon\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03b684ba-0f62-4a96-a9f1-8c6138efd9cf\"\n/>\n\n### After\n\n<img width=\"420\" alt=\"After: settings drawer navigation tab uses the\nSettings icon\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e5f4669-ed7c-4355-be92-c9cfbf160959\"\n/>\n\n## Validation\n\n- `yarn oxfmt --check\npackages/twenty-front/src/modules/navigation/components/MainNavigationDrawerTabsRow.tsx\npackages/twenty-front/src/modules/navigation/components/SettingsNavigationDrawer.tsx`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `yarn nx typecheck twenty-front`\n\nNote: `oxlint` could not run locally because the installed dependencies\nare missing the native `@oxlint/binding-darwin-*` optional package.","tree":{"sha":"f9d6eb744e55f9563672389efb8a421d561b61b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/f9d6eb744e55f9563672389efb8a421d561b61b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/34dc681c0ed98962b85089b68890aaedefe8f482","verification":{"payload":"tree f9d6eb744e55f9563672389efb8a421d561b61b4\nparent cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f\nauthor Thomas des Francs <tdesfrancs@gmail.com> 1782465270 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782465270 +0000\n\nUse settings icon in settings drawer tab (#22204)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Let the shared navigation drawer tab row accept a custom icon and\naccessible label for its navigation tab.\n- Use the Settings icon and Settings label when that tab row is rendered\ninside the settings drawer.\n- Keep the main navigation drawer defaulting to the Home icon.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n### Before\n\n<img width=\"420\" alt=\"Before: settings drawer navigation tab uses the\nHome icon\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03b684ba-0f62-4a96-a9f1-8c6138efd9cf\"\n/>\n\n### After\n\n<img width=\"420\" alt=\"After: settings drawer navigation tab uses the\nSettings icon\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e5f4669-ed7c-4355-be92-c9cfbf160959\"\n/>\n\n## Validation\n\n- `yarn oxfmt --check\npackages/twenty-front/src/modules/navigation/components/MainNavigationDrawerTabsRow.tsx\npackages/twenty-front/src/modules/navigation/components/SettingsNavigationDrawer.tsx`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `yarn nx typecheck twenty-front`\n\nNote: `oxlint` could not run locally because the installed dependencies\nare missing the native `@oxlint/binding-darwin-*` optional package.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPkL2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzq4QAIXN/0IZu4WnfWTO2/hH0D1S\nKig47owZ6rkHEc54lONxORvf/ZeKNTI1ZvF+FfAgIl6m9bdZIsqK2S3VQr9JGMtJ\nK8ui87QItD0HlZZl9vOS/kha5cywvxdQNtS7jXRaNd3Tmuz3VMmw1o8pmXCxQk9a\n7nwBI+GkkU+feHtwvjO9vaesF136qcu/dkUGaFPzXdqfZyE9Y6pXpi4vms8Fv42e\n+OZHyNg2ulx7vgJ1ow7KP9aAzQwozmfJFjfZ23wTQ4KY/v9qYT5h82MUHhwTJ1pQ\nWByI4BWvUEZfb8PfoDF5DG/AeOqM340eNFFtk2qRKe9r+YkqN6lvf6A7IrdnRW+o\nxH1ixYEJ5eEN+ks1ZaZYG5Kl8jw6leue92Jah81N+thZfc9hpkcS38RfwrLQenmO\nQ6fsvumoVDQiEi2jrvZ8m4EhvKs9N3K7OoI85HagtZwt/YASWbv7IUhdIWo9Xk6m\nzDaY4M2x2nqaWw0gwPmajn82QmEN/ZzrQMMgWD/TnSXfSNEBcj6LZYj6ifUd48LC\n3c3OtCTqNueKVrrAbzVfuXd9Orbrao8mEWZ/OSI1bpEiNt/XzD4HTk2YTOzEEvyn\nMpTGWtGqfPaoFkQiZ44atJjeQjMxMBxdZzNsxjf0X1uyL/eDiFRfayw/HeB91yt+\neKgTmPX5VeeWLGMzl0sP\n=O8l9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T12:16:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/34dc681c0ed98962b85089b68890aaedefe8f482","node_id":"C_kwDOTPIvWNoAKDM0ZGM2ODFjMGVkOTg5NjJiODUwODliNjg4OTBhYWVkZWZlOGY0ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commit/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f","sha":"cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f"}],"sha":"34dc681c0ed98962b85089b68890aaedefe8f482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/34dc681c0ed98962b85089b68890aaedefe8f482"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71827178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/commits/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:46:34Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:46:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add v2 onboarding loading screen while creating workspace (#22152)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc7b1d10-7495-4f21-9311-4c22c0f14771\n\nAdds the full-screen loading screen shown while a new workspace is being\ncreated in the v2 sign-up flow (`SignInUpV2`), building on the v2\n\"Create your workspace\" step.\n\nHow it works:\n- Submitting the v2 create-workspace form marks the flow as v2\n(`isOnboardingV2State`) and creates the workspace. The flag is carried\nacross the cross-subdomain redirect with an `onboardingV2=true` URL\nparam, so v2 users land on a new `/workspace-activation-v2` route\ninstead of v1''s `/workspace-activation`.\n- `WorkspaceActivationV2` runs the real `activateWorkspace` mutation on\nmount and renders the loader: a pulsing Twenty logomark above a stack of\nstatus messages that shift up one at a time, cycling once per second.\nThere is no faked/minimum duration; it advances to the next onboarding\nstep as soon as the workspace is activated.\n- On activation failure it shows a \"Workspace creation failed\" screen\nwith a Retry button.\n\nv1 onboarding is unchanged. Storybook:\n`Modules/Auth/SignInUpWorkspaceActivationV2`.\n\nNote: The flashes will be fixed in later PRs\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22152?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"a24213ba222cafedda5f7ff2d16c42186a14132a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/trees/a24213ba222cafedda5f7ff2d16c42186a14132a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogSulem/KarkasCRM/git/commits/cb49a7a053f0e244bc284a1a5f95e90aaeeaec8f","verification":{"payload":"tree a24213ba222cafedda5f7ff2d16c42186a14132a\nparent ce4d0f344725843f5a725548722cd3d30fd07521\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1782463594 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782463594 +0000\n\nAdd v2 onboarding loading screen while creating workspace (#22152)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc7b1d10-7495-4f21-9311-4c22c0f14771\n\nAdds the full-screen loading screen shown while a new workspace is being\ncreated in the v2 sign-up flow (`SignInUpV2`), building on the v2\n\"Create your workspace\" step.\n\nHow it works:\n- Submitting the v2 create-workspace form marks the flow as v2\n(`isOnboardingV2State`) and creates the workspace. The flag is carried\nacross the cross-subdomain redirect with an `onboardingV2=true` URL\nparam, so v2 users land on a new `/workspace-activation-v2` route\ninstead of v1''s `/workspace-activation`.\n- `WorkspaceActivationV2` runs the real `activateWorkspace` mutation on\nmount and renders the loader: a pulsing Twenty logomark above a stack of\nstatus messages that shift up one at a time, cycling once per second.\nThere is no faked/minimum duration; it advances to the next onboarding\nstep as soon as the workspace is activated.\n- On activation failure it shows a \"Workspace creation failed\" screen\nwith a Retry button.\n\nv1 onboarding is unchanged. Storybook:\n`Modules/Auth/SignInUpWorkspaceActivationV2`.\n\nNote: The flashes will be fixed in later PRs\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/22152?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPjxqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyV0QAASs7Sw9PgnYzI/SA2gzFGfY\nFpXUhmtE3Ycd4K4w5UwYWYXDCaL2EzC9bApGWYm8iNXEVZrzeLkEKKyQd3k3s7eG\nSciM7TQPCPOfSb0pJVDPbRVaeueVF4/zEafTnkcjrZVQqM9ZbFSM1C9tnTKep4rG\nYYZSqBdNnI+puSfW/AGVPKcRHbu9nerKRmCTcbuqK8hWxKWbwzxWLnWVY1eoOJiT\no6J+6qQIxn/ee85FEaNhsTJ11bdO3SjJn9mDa65MQvlYcbTSHPMIlL6xNFA80lNN\nSGkpdnGsmt0mPAhA+/Yuy3Srhx5czmXL01DkxbWre364FGMStRBszmx3Vs9gbE63\nYx6o4LR3e+hcCD5+rmm3he+ksa4xZejKQDihGNnXp2u6SLM2OsoJrk1V7kzZlUZR\n4x+1JTqvNtDUTX4+LdF1V48GAtEtxp+d3CbAslqbQwa2md6yff/OMOA5hyKYkwJ7\nM54U2wMenqgs1r5RY+Oiode11rtZNXJCeL1b7dIe//wlvR0bm3b4tOaQpoXfaf2T\njNQfk9FVE53SNfProtOewxyIcbmInx8IGQZmww7IT0V2Z6QpSUjV0RSTtX7kP3Fa\nTXohACbCPvqj1+ZZ5WZ708vfQRzQ/zFUpttw++b4xR3FuE8wpmrZ1AAI3eRadNCt\nUl2LBsVIN2O9Pn4uPJwk\n=v4MR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-06T11:43:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git