o.il","name":"Alexander Arshavski"},"message":"feat: add React frontend with custom ink-and-lime design\n\nDark ink theme, acid-lime accent, serif display type and hash-generated\ngradient avatars. Pages: hero/auth, home feed with composer, profiles\nwith follow, thread view, debounced search. Optimistic like/follow\ntoggles, cursor-based load-more, 27-line hash router (react/react-dom\nare the only deps). Responsive: sidebar becomes a sticky blurred top\nbar with icon nav on mobile. All JS files under 100 lines.","tree":{"sha":"22a9243162ad1485f16b94c64ba14cc9f4d9fd02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexarsh/MyOwnX/git/trees/22a9243162ad1485f16b94c64ba14cc9f4d9fd02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexarsh/MyOwnX/git/commits/dc5638c917728275573d08a5092834167fc9fdb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84426?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexarsh","id":84426,"login":"alexarsh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexarsh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexarsh/MyOwnX/commit/dc5638c917728275573d08a5092834167fc9fdb9","node_id":"C_kwDOTPQwldoAKGRjNTYzOGM5MTc3MjgyNzU1NzNkMDhhNTA5MjgzNDE2N2ZjO