a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/78090965b557c678967abfdf22090df06e3630a1"}],"sha":"c33dc598d147b6538e2481d782b3c33fd41cece5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/c33dc598d147b6538e2481d782b3c33fd41cece5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/78090965b557c678967abfdf22090df06e3630a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:18:41Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T10:19:19Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"feat(islands): opt-in propsSchema validation — closes the M3 audit follow-up\n\nThe C2/A2 handshake validates the snapshot ENVELOPE (IslandSnapshotSchema:\nprops is z.record(z.unknown())), so a same-version fragment could still\nstamp a wrong-typed prop (e.g. {\"symbol\": 42}) and hydrate garbage\nsilently. registerIsland''s third argument gains an optional propsSchema\n(IslandPropsSchema<TProps> — a minimal { safeParse, description? }\nstructural contract any Zod schema satisfies, mirroring @mvp/request''s\nResponseSchema<T> from PR #44). mountIsland validates the EFFECTIVE props\n(opts.props ?? snapshot.props) against it right after the C2 check passes;\na mismatch skips hydration through the existing degradation path with a\nnew reason: \"invalid-props\", console.warn''ed and reported through\nconfigureIslandRuntime''s onSnapshotMismatch hook exactly like every other\nmismatch reason. No propsSchema declared -> unaffected (backward\ncompatible).\n\n- packages/islands/src/index.ts: IslandPropsSchema/IslandPropsSchemaIssue\n  types, IslandVersionExpectation<TProps> (now generic), the propsSchema\n  check in mountIsland, SnapshotMismatchInfo.reason gains \"invalid-props\".\n- Reference adoption: fragments/order-form''s new OrderFormIslandPropsSchema\n  (render.ts) mirrors OrderFormIslandProps field-for-field, reusing\n  @mvp/trade-data''s AccountMarginSchema directly for the account field (one\n  source of truth). Wired in apps/page-trade/src/hydrate.tsx''s\n  registerTradeIslands via a new @mvp/fragment-order-form/render export path.\n- Real regression caught and fixed by pnpm verify itself: re-exporting the\n  schema through island.tsx (which doubles as the C3 spike''s\n  island.browser.ts build entry) pulled zod + @mvp/trade-data into that\n  30KB-budgeted browser bundle, 4.6KB -> 64.8KB. Fixed by keeping\n  island.tsx''s render.ts import type-only (now commented as load-bearing)\n  and exporting the schema through a dedicated ./render package path\n  instead — bundle measured back at 4,663 bytes (unchanged from before\n  this PR).\n- Tests: 5 new packages/islands/src/index.test.ts cases (valid props\n  hydrate; schema-invalid props skip with reason invalid-props; the\n  EFFECTIVE props incl. an opts.props override are checked, not just the\n  raw snapshot; C2 runs before the propsSchema check; no propsSchema is\n  backward compatible) plus one real end-to-end test in\n  apps/page-trade/src/hydrate.test.tsx exercising the reference adoption\n  through the actual registerTradeIslands wiring.\n- Docs: packages/islands/AGENT.md (all sections; the executable Example\n  gained a third scenario proving invalid-props — verified by docs:test)\n  and docs/INTERACTION.md (the handshake section + the bundle-budget\n  gotcha, so a future value-export from island.tsx doesn''t silently\n  regress the C3 bundle again).\n\npnpm verify: REAL_EXIT=0, 14/14 (first run caught the real 64.8KB budget\nregression above; fixed and re-verified clean).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4aabcee8be1664dbb945d235506e055cda2271d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/b4aabcee8be1664dbb945d235506e055cda2271d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/78090965b557c678967abfdf22090df06e3630a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zyo