/api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/05f1f2d6a2a007224d9ea37ec68f143bb7fdbda2","node_id":"C_kwDOTPTVXtoAKDA1ZjFmMmQ2YTJhMDA3MjI0ZDllYTM3ZWM2OGYxNDNiYjdmZGJkYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/f78c244470fca0c64d9471fdcce2ac9c47749918","sha":"f78c244470fca0c64d9471fdcce2ac9c47749918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/f78c244470fca0c64d9471fdcce2ac9c47749918"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/056614a04927bfbf45c765ff47c433160f608853","sha":"056614a04927bfbf45c765ff47c433160f608853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/056614a04927bfbf45c765ff47c433160f608853"}],"sha":"05f1f2d6a2a007224d9ea37ec68f143bb7fdbda2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/05f1f2d6a2a007224d9ea37ec68f143bb7fdbda2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/056614a04927bfbf45c765ff47c433160f608853/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:41:48Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:41:48Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"refactor(pages): roll out shared page-wrapper scaffolding to product/markets/portfolio\n\nFollow-up to PR #42, which piloted the @mvp/runtime dedup helpers\n(applySlotRequestOverrides, collectSlotDiagnostics, resolveFragmentStream)\non page-home only and left the rollout to the other pages as a natural,\nlow-risk follow-up now that the pattern was proven. Same pilot-then-rollout\ndiscipline this repo already used for A1 (PR #18 -> #20-22).\n\n- page-markets and page-portfolio: diagnostic shape is exactly\n  FragmentSlotDiagnostic (source/strategy/status/required), so both adopt\n  collectSlotDiagnostics(execution.slots) with the default projection,\n  applySlotRequestOverrides for their slot-definition builder, and\n  resolveFragmentStream for the barrier entry point. Their now-redundant\n  local MarketsSlotDiagnostic/PortfolioSlotDiagnostic types alias\n  FragmentSlotDiagnostic instead of re-declaring it; the hand-written\n  toDiagnostic() helpers and the barrier''s manual Promise.all/html-map\n  assembly are gone.\n- page-product: diagnostic shape is narrower (source/strategy only, no\n  status/required) — collectSlotDiagnostics(execution.slots, toDiagnostic)\n  is called with an explicit custom projection instead of the default,\n  keeping its own toDiagnostic() as the projection function. Its extra\n  non-fragment-slot work (recently-viewed cookie, background stats job)\n  is untouched — those still fold into the same aggregate promise exactly\n  as before; only the redundant scaffolding (slot overrides, barrier\n  Promise.all) was extracted.\n- page-trade stays on the barrier executeFragmentSlots API, unaffected\n  (out of scope by design, per its own documented react-dom/server\n  constraint).\n\nLine counts: page-product 359->325, page-markets 227->178,\npage-portfolio 248->194 (130 lines removed across the three). Rendered\noutput, diagnostics shape, and every existing test are unchanged by\nconstruction (the barrier is built ON the stream helper, not a second\ncode path) — verified: typecheck 53/53 tsconfigs, affected tests 52/52.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4e946b5760267052ab99818822b3ac10101f392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/a4e946b5760267052ab99818822b3ac10101f392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/056614a04927bfbf45c765ff47c433160f608853","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","recei