eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/8d0f7ec5c69c054ee2244378bb494ef389081ed1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:46:04Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:46:04Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"Merge origin/main into fix/typed-channels-island-props (artifacts regenerated below)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b883f4ac12a235955a7f1a3ab0ba692c08d81b12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/b883f4ac12a235955a7f1a3ab0ba692c08d81b12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/8d0f7ec5c69c054ee2244378bb494ef389081ed1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/8d0f7ec5c69c054ee2244378bb494ef389081ed1","node_id":"C_kwDOTPTVXtoAKDhkMGY3ZWM1YzY5YzA1NGVlMjI0NDM3OGJiNDk0ZWYzODkwODFlZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/3cdf7c2865ef8a4e8afb03dbb5f2143c091cf823","sha":"3cdf7c2865ef8a4e8afb03dbb5f2143c091cf823","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/3cdf7c2865ef8a4e8afb03dbb5f2143c091cf823"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/255653018647a83585b993c16e17e259fa80b9b0","sha":"255653018647a83585b993c16e17e259fa80b9b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/255653018647a83585b993c16e17e259fa80b9b0"}],"sha":"8d0f7ec5c69c054ee2244378bb494ef389081ed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/8d0f7ec5c69c054ee2244378bb494ef389081ed1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/3cdf7c2865ef8a4e8afb03dbb5f2143c091cf823/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:45:27Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T08:45:27Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"feat(interaction)!: typed channels — a typo''d channel fails at compile time\n\nSized-small closer for the residual A2 gap: InteractionContract.channel\nwas runtime-string-only, so a typo''d channel name in publish/subscribe\ncompiled fine and only surfaced as a runtime InteractionContractError.\n\ncreateInteractionBus<C extends string = string> now infers C from the\nliteral channel types of its contracts; the returned InteractionBus<C>\nrejects publish/subscribe/getContract/listChannels on any channel\noutside the declared union at COMPILE time. Default C = string keeps\nevery existing untyped call site compiling unchanged - this is\nopt-in-by-declaration, not a breaking API.\n\n- Methods (not arrow-typed fields) so a channel-narrowed\n  InteractionBus<''a''|''b''> stays assignable wherever a plain\n  InteractionBus is expected (island bus props, bridges) and vice\n  versa - the narrowing is a call-site check, not an assignability\n  wall.\n- createBroadcastBridge<C> takes NoInfer<C> for its channels option so\n  the union comes from the bus alone, not widened by a typo''d entry.\n- domains/trade-contracts'' tradeSliceContracts/tradeStoreContracts and\n  apps/page-home''s homeInteractionContracts switched from a widening\n  InteractionContract[] annotation to `satisfies\n  ReadonlyArray<InteractionContract>`, exporting their literal channel\n  unions (TradeChannel, HomeChannel) so buses built from them are\n  narrowed automatically.\n- Runtime behavior byte-identical (contract validation, ACL\n  enforcement, payload schemas all unchanged) - this is a type-level\n  addition only.\n\nType-level tests (expectTypeOf + @ts-expect-error) prove: a typo''d\nchannel fails publish/subscribe/getContract; an untyped bus stays\nInteractionBus<string>; a narrowed bus is assignable to a plain one;\ncreateBroadcastBridge rejects an undeclared channel.\n\nNote: the packages/islands propsSchema half of this audit item (M3)\nis NOT in this PR - scoped out to keep this change reviewable; tracked\nas a separate follow-up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99358cfaeb5db6de18f9816b5d2b9cb510d3a1cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/99358cfaeb5db6de18f9816b5d2b9cb510d3a1cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/3cdf7c2865ef8a4e8afb03dbb5f2143c091cf823","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/3cdf7c2865ef8a4e8afb03dbb5f2143c091cf823","node_id":"C_kwD