ttps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/ea785151db6cc59c8474a8481aa83ff6a5c41aa7","node_id":"C_kwDOTPTVXtoAKGVhNzg1MTUxZGI2Y2M1OWM4NDc0YTg0ODFhYTgzZmY2YTVjNDFhYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/98a251cbb959e966bb8d51b44c0db36043015d62","sha":"98a251cbb959e966bb8d51b44c0db36043015d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/98a251cbb959e966bb8d51b44c0db36043015d62"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/e71d0edefe09ecad087aa6a8ab49b6800c573f31","sha":"e71d0edefe09ecad087aa6a8ab49b6800c573f31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/e71d0edefe09ecad087aa6a8ab49b6800c573f31"}],"sha":"ea785151db6cc59c8474a8481aa83ff6a5c41aa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/ea785151db6cc59c8474a8481aa83ff6a5c41aa7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/280b5bfada4bbaacb12436a141233062ad37a8c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T16:53:23Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T16:53:23Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"fix(audits): make bundle/CSS budget gates real — per-unit budget.ts vs measured artifacts\n\nThe \"hard budget gates\" were vacuous (2026-07-11 audit, runtime-plane H1):\nbundle-budget-check compared a root budget.json against a root stats.json,\nNEITHER of which exists, so every pnpm verify passed on zero checks\n(\"checks\": []), and css-budget-check''s budget side read the same dead file\n(budget = {} -> failureCount always 0). The 21 per-unit\nfragments/*/src/budget.ts + apps/page-*/src/budget.ts ceilings had zero\nconsumers.\n\nNow both sides are derived from the repo:\n\n- tools/_shared/budgets.ts: shared loader that dynamic-imports every\n  fragments/*/src/budget.ts and apps/*/src/budget.ts (same pattern as\n  release-tools'' load-graph manifest loader).\n- bundle-budget-check gates jsBytes per unit:\n  * pages: gzipped first-load client JS from the real next build output\n    (.next app-build-manifest route files + build-manifest rootMainFiles);\n    verify runs build before audit:bundle, and an unbuilt tree FAILS loudly\n    per page (actual: -1) instead of passing on nothing;\n  * fragments: minified esbuild bundle of the fragment''s client entry\n    (island.browser.ts > client.ts > island.tsx) with react/react-dom/@mvp/*\n    external — reproducing the measurement fragments'' budget comments were\n    already written in (order-form: documented ~4.6KB == measured 4663B);\n    SSR-only fragments report 0 with an explicit note.\n  * everything NOT measured is listed in the report (unmeasured/notes):\n    page cssBytes with no extracted .css asset, inline SSR scripts,\n    runtime-only metrics. Legacy root budget.json/stats.json still honored\n    when present.\n- css-budget-check keeps its measurement (minified source CSS) but its\n  budget side now gates each unit''s own CSS against that unit''s cssBytes\n  ceiling (21 unit checks; css-less units get an explicit zero row).\n- Budget calibrations against first real measurements (all documented\n  in-file): page-trade 180000 -> 220000 gzip (measured 202009; page carries\n  React + shared vendor + all island glue by D3 design), page-vaults and\n  page-referrals 0 -> 110000 (Next app-router first-load baseline 102531\n  gzip ships even for a pure server-component page; 0 was unmeasurable\n  aspiration). Pinned test assertions updated to match.\n- order-form budget.ts \"declarative only / real gap\" comment closed;\n  docs/PERFORMANCE_BUDGET.md now documents how each gate measures and what\n  stays unmeasured.\n- Regression tests: a fragment exceeding its declared jsBytes ceiling and a\n  fragment exceeding its cssBytes ceiling each FAIL the audit; unbuilt page\n  fails loudly; page first-load measured from fixture .next manifests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2277cb140c140da1be228263a1b34235f6387a04","url":"https://api.github