vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/e2ed482430a1f736868368e9e3c10f2439bab10e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:56:38Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:56:38Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"fix(delivery): make slotless pages first-class units in the release graph\n\npage-vaults and page-referrals had no src/manifest.slots.json, so\nload-graph never registered them as page units: any change under\napps/page-vaults|referrals fell through seedsFromPaths to the GLOBAL\nfallback (one-line tweak rebuilt all 22 units), and — worse — even a\nGLOBAL plan''s deployables come from graph units, so the CI docker\nmatrix NEVER built or pushed these two pages'' images, though compose\nruns them and shell-gateway routes to them. Found by the 2026-07-11\nre-audit (delivery H1).\n\n- Both pages gain an EMPTY manifest.slots.json (honest: composed page\n  with zero fragment slots) + a src/manifest.ts with route/renderMode/\n  seo/budget, mirroring the composed pages'' manifest shape. vaults\n  declares renderMode isr + revalidateSeconds 3600 (its page.tsx\n  revalidate; the known layout-headers() inertness is noted in the\n  manifest comment); referrals declares ssg (force-static).\n- deploy-affected''s runtime gate now derives their URLs from the\n  manifest route instead of hard-failing.\n- Both pages'' test suites gain a PageManifestSchema.parse test (and a\n  declared @mvp/contracts devDependency instead of relying on hoisting).\n\nProven against the real engine: a vaults-only file change now yields\n{global: false, seeds: [page-vaults], deployables: [page-vaults]};\nboth pages appear in units + deployables of a GLOBAL plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35f86f975b39d5b23235cd1af0d6d69a15e362b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/35f86f975b39d5b23235cd1af0d6d69a15e362b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/e2ed482430a1f736868368e9e3c10f2439bab10e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"