ttps://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/1922aded60efc8ad3e4d539e4b48138f5cd07e5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T13:50:55Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T13:50:55Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"chore(hygiene): sweep dead @mvp/trade-client asset refs, retired isr manifest values, orphan nx.json\n\nFollow-ups from the 2026-07-11 re-audit (hygiene H3 + M1):\n\n- 7 fragments (trades-feed, account-bar, open-orders, market-header,\n  order-book, chart-panel, positions-table) still declared the dead\n  ''@mvp/trade-client'' package (deleted in P1) in manifest assets.js —\n  and their tests ASSERTED the dead string, locking the lie in. Swept\n  the same way order-form was cleaned during the C3 spike: assets.js\n  now lists only each fragment''s real fragment-local asset; chart-panel\n  also drops its never-resolved ''@mvp/ui/shadcn'' placeholder; comments\n  in manifests/budgets/islands reworded to the truth (React ships in\n  the consuming page''s bundle via static import). tailwindPreset''s\n  example path updated.\n- chart-panel and pnl-chart manifests still declared the RETIRED\n  renderStrategy ''isr'' (PR #29 removed it from RenderStrategySchema;\n  nothing caught these because fragment manifests are never parsed —\n  the exact A2 gap the audit ranked H1, fix tracked separately).\n  Codemodded to ''ttl-cache'' + test updated.\n- nx.json deleted: nx is not installed anywhere (no package.json ref,\n  no lockfile entry); the repo runs its own graph affected engine.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1e19fcc5e8c3da4dd594dc1c2191124d5a50ebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/e1e19fcc5e8c3da4dd594dc1c2191124d5a50ebb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/1922aded60efc8ad3e4d539e4b48138f5cd07e5c","verification":{"paylo