t.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commits/39b20af2b1f2edca2cf98bed0b75d0865360ba23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T13:41:18Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T13:41:18Z","email":"joewong7321@gmail.com","name":"Joe Wong"},"message":"fix(spike): defuse the C3 spike per the no-go decision — unmount + unchain\n\nPR #28 recorded the C3 no-go but left the spike live: every trade-page\nrender mounted a second, parallel order-form island (the registry\nassetsUrl activated SpikeOrderFormLoader unconditionally), and every\npnpm build paid for build:spike-vendor (~208KB) plus order-form''s\nbuild:island-browser. Found by the 2026-07-11 re-audit (hygiene H1).\n\n- page.tsx: spike import-map <script> + SpikeOrderFormLoader unmounted;\n  a comment points at the dormant reference (hydrateSpike.tsx /\n  spikeImportMap.ts, both kept with their tests).\n- page-trade build no longer chains build:spike-vendor; order-form\n  build no longer chains build:island-browser (both scripts remain\n  runnable manually; the /assets route already answers a structured\n  404 when the bundle is absent — behavior covered by existing tests).\n- Registry entry keeps assetsUrl as append-only 0.1.0 history (version\n  immutability forbids rewriting it; with the loader unmounted it has\n  zero consumers).\n- Plan §4.3.3 decision record updated to note the defuse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44a7cb25def0980a337898af6e2c37352996e0c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/trees/44a7cb25def0980a337898af6e2c37352996e0c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/git/commits/39b20af2b1f2edca2cf98bed0b75d0865360ba23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20755029?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyoncode","id":20755029,"login":"zyoncode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzU1MDI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyoncode","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-first-web-frame/commit/39b20af2b1f2edca2cf98bed0b75d0865360ba23","node_id":"C_kwDOTPTVXtoAKDM5YjIwYWYyYjFmMmVkY2EyY2Y5OGJlZDBiNzVkMDg2NTM2MGJhMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zyonlab/ai-